<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="GEN" style="id">KITAABUA BIBLE TRANSLATION</book>
  <para style="h">KUTENDEKA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kitabu Kya Mambo Kyakua Musa Kilikyakuutua Kutendeka</para>
  <para style="toc2">Kutendeka</para>
  <para style="toc3">Kut</para>
  <para style="mt1">KUTENDEKA</para>
  <para style="imt">BULONDOLOZI</para>
  <para style="im">
    <char style="bk">Kutendeka </char> i ntendeko ya bintu byonse, kabili i liina lya kitabu kya mambo mu kipingo kya kale mu bitabu byonse bili mu Biblia. Biblia ya mambo ya mu lulimi lwa Kiebrania, twebo tubambiilepo ni “Pa kutendeka.” Kilangile ntuntuko ya bintu byonse ni kukilapo miilo yaabombele Leza ni vyaatendekele bantu. Eno nsiku, balia basambiliile, tebamaninepo bintu bingi palua muntu ao palua bantu baalembele kitabu kya kutendeka ni palua musita ukyaalembeeluepo. Bange baketekeele nangue kili nga kya-ambwilue mu malembo a kale mu myaka ya 500-600 NK mu Babiloni. Bange baketekeele nangue Musa i waalembele kitabu kya Kutendeka, ni kya Kufuma, ni kya Balawi, ni kya Mpendua pamo ni kitabu kya Malanguluzi a Mizilo. Bilibyalingwilua nangue byaalembelue mu mwaka wa 1,300 ao 1,400 NK.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mu kitabu kya Kutendeka muli mpunda ya mponvu iliyakwasia bazumizi kunvwisia Biblia, Kipingo kya Kale ni Kipingo kya Lenu. Keki kitabu kilikyatulanga kibalo vikyaingiile mu kyalo ni kutulanga bukabilo bwa bantu bwa mupususi. Keki kitabu kilikyafyula mapange akua Leza a kupususia bantu. Kaka keebo kali mu mbiko ya mambo palwakua Yesu (Kutendeka 3.15) ni palua bulayo bwakua Leza kuli Abrahamu bwa kupaala ntundu yonse ya pa kyalo (Kutendeka 12.3).</para>
  <para style="iot">Bwipi bwa bili mu kitabu kya Kutendeka</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Leza waalengele kyalo, ni Adamu ni Eva nga vikilandilue mu katue ka 1 ni ka 2.</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Mu katue ka 3 kwita mu katue ka 5 mulondolwelue palwakua Adamu ni Eva, palua kibalo kyabo ni palua nvyalo yabo.</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Mu katue ka 6 kwita mu katue ka 9 mulandilue palwakua Noa ni kibunda kikata.</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Kabili kitabu kya Kutendeka mu katue 10 ni ka 11, mulondolwelue palua belia byaakitikile pa musita wakua Noa ni pa musita wakua Abrahamu pamo ni pa musita wa lupungu lwa Babeli.</para>
  <para style="io1">5. Mu katue ka 12 kwita mu katue ka 50, mulondolwelue palwakua Abrahamu, palua lupua lwakue, ni palua kutendeka kwa ntundu ya Baizraeli.</para>
  <para style="io2">A. Bwikazi bwakua Abrahamu ni mukazi wakue Sara bulembelue mu katue ka 12 kwita mu katue ka 25.</para>
  <para style="io2">B. Bwikazi bwakua Izaaki ni mukazi wakue Rebeka bulondolwelue mu katue 21 kwita mu katue ka 28, ni kufua kwakue kulondolwelue mu katue ka 35.</para>
  <para style="io2">C. Bwikazi bwakua Yakobo, ni bwa baana bakue pamo ni lwendo lwabo lwa kufuma ku Kanaani kuya ku Misri, bilondolwelue mu katue ka 25 kwita mu katue ka 50.</para>
  <para style="io2">D. Mu katue ka 37 kwita mu katue ka 50 mulandilue palua bwikazi bwakua Yusufu mwana mtonua mwina Yakobo, ni vya-alukile kateeka mu Misri.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GEN 1" />
  <para style="s1">Ntendeko ya bintu byonse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 1:1" />Pa kutendeka Leza waalengele myulu ni kyalo. <verse eid="GEN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 1:2" />Ozo musita, kyalo kyaali kyali sie kibeebeebe, kabili tekuba mwali kantu, ni nfinzi yaali yakupiliile pa menda azikile. Inzi Mweo wakua Leza<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mweo wakua Leza </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Maka akua Leza; </char></note> waali walela peulu menda. <verse eid="GEN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 1:3" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 4:6">2 Bak 4.6</ref></char></note>Leza waalandile evi, “Kube kisue!” Ni kisue kya-alukileko. <verse eid="GEN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 1:4" />Leza waamwene nangue kisue kyaali kyaweme. Waalekenkaniizie kisue ni nfinzi. <verse eid="GEN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 1:5" />Kisue Leza waakiinikile musita wa koba, ni nfinzi waiinikile busiku. Kwa-alukile kyungulo, kabili kwa-alukile lukeelekeele. Bobo i bwaali busiku bwa mambo.<verse eid="GEN 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 1:6" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2PE 3:5">2 Pet 3.5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kabili Leza waalandile evi, “Kube lweleele pa bukata bwa menda pakuti lulekenkanie menda ni menda.” <verse eid="GEN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 1:7" />Evi Leza waakitile lweleele ni kulekekania menda ali pensina lweleele ku menda ali mu muulu. Evio i vikyaali. <verse eid="GEN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 1:8" />Lweleele Leza waalwinikile lyulu. Kwa-alukile kyungulo, kabili kwa-alukile lukeelekeele. Bobo i bwaali busiku bwa bubili.<verse eid="GEN 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 1:9" />Kabili Leza waalandile evi, “Menda a pa kyalo akolonghane pa nkendo imo, evi musili umoneke.” Evio i vikyaali. <verse eid="GEN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 1:10" />Musili Leza wawinikile kyalo, ni menda aakolongheene pamo waenikile lyezi. Leza waamwene nangue kyaali kyaweme. <verse eid="GEN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 1:11" />Kabili Leza waalandile evi, “Kyalo kimenie bikusi ni saasa uliwaseekako mbezu ilekenkeene, ni bimuti bilibyaseekako mazabo kukonkana ni misango yabyo, mazabo ali ni mbezu mukati.” Evio i vikyaali. <verse eid="GEN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 1:12" />Kyalo kyaameniizie bikusi ni saasa uliwaseekako mbezu ilekenkeene, ni bimuti bilibyaseekako mazabo kukonkana ni misango yabyo, mazabo ali ni mbezu mukati. Leza wamwene nangue kyaali kyaweme. Evio i vikyaali. <verse eid="GEN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 1:13" />Kwa-alukile kyungulo, kabili kwa-alukile lukeelekeele. Bobo i bwaali busiku bwa butatu.<verse eid="GEN 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 1:14" />Kabili Leza waalandile evi, “Misaniko imoneke mu lyulu ya kuti ilekenkanie musita wa koba ni musita wa busiku, kuti iye yali tulangi twa nsita ni nsiku ni myaka, <verse eid="GEN 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 1:15" />kabili misaniko iye yali mu lyulu kuti iye yasanikila pa kyalo.” Evio i vikyaali. <verse eid="GEN 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 1:16" />Leza waakitile misaniko ibili ikata, musaniko utaniisie uye wasanikila musita wa koba, ni ukeepeleko uye wasanikila musita wa busiku. Kabili Leza waakitile ni ntanda. <verse eid="GEN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 1:17" />Leza waabiikile misaniko mu lyulu kuti iye yasanikila pa kyalo, <verse eid="GEN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 1:18" />iye yateeka musita wa koba ni wa busiku, evi iye yalekenkaniizie kisue ni nfinzi. Leza waamwene nangue kyaali kyaweme. <verse eid="GEN 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 1:19" />Kwa-alukile kyungulo, kabili kwa-alukile lukeelekeele. Bobo i bwaali busiku bwa buna.<verse eid="GEN 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 1:20" />Kabili Leza waalandile evi, “Mu menda mube bilengua bikose bilibyaenda, ni mu lweleele mube byoni bilibyapupuka peulu kyalo.” <verse eid="GEN 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 1:21" />Leza waalengele bilengua bikata bya mu lyezi mu misango yabyo, ni bilengua bikose bilibyaenda mu menda mu misango yabyo pamo ni byoni bilibyapupuka mu lweleele mu misango yabyo. Leza waamwene nangue kyaali kyaweme. <verse eid="GEN 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 1:22" />Leza waabipaalile walanda bivyalane, bisanduluke ni kwizula mu menda a mu lyezi, ni byoni bisanduluke mu kyalo. <verse eid="GEN 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 1:23" />Kwa-alukile kyungulo, kabili kwa-alukile lukeelekeele. Bobo i bwaali busiku bwa busaano.<verse eid="GEN 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 1:24" />Kabili Leza waalandile evi, “Kyalo kifumie misango yonse ya bilengua bikose mu misango ilekenkeene. Nama ya kuteekua, ni bilibyayibula pansi, ni nama ya mu kisonso mu misango ilekenkeene.” Evio i vikyaali. <verse eid="GEN 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 1:25" />Leza waakitile nama ya mu musitu mu misango yayo, ni nama ya kuteekua mu misango yayo, ni kubalua kilengua kilikyayibula pansi mu misango yayo. Leza waamwene nangue kyaali kyaweme.<verse eid="GEN 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 1:26" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.26: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 11:7">1 Bak 11.7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kabili Leza waalandile evi, “Ale kansi tubumbe muntu mu lukebu lwetu wapaleene ni fwefue. Kabili tumupeele buvinde bwa kuteeka masabi a mu lyezi, ni tooni twa mu lweleele, ni nama ya kuteekua, ni buvinde bwa kuteeka kyalo kyonse pamo ni bilengua byonse bilibyayibula pansi.” <verse eid="GEN 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 1:27" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 19:4">Mat 19.4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:6">Mk 10.6</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 5:1-2">Kut 5.1-2</ref></char></note>Evi Leza waalengele muntu mu lukebu lwakue mwine. Mu lukebu lwakua Leza i mwaalengeelue muntu. Mwalalume ni mwanakazi, waabalengele. <verse eid="GEN 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 1:28" />Leza waabapaalile wabaana nangue, “Ale vyalane musanduluke. Izuzie kyalo ni kukinasia. Muye mwali bakateeka ba masabi a mu lyezi, ni ba byoni bya mu lweleele, ni ba bilengua byonse bikose bilibyayibula pansi.” <verse eid="GEN 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 1:29" />Leza waalandile evi, “Mone namipeela kubalua saasa uli pa kyalo kyonse uliwaseekako mbezu, ni kubalua kimuti kilikyaseekako mazabo ali ni mbezu mukati kuti bikabe bya kulia byenu. <verse eid="GEN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 1:30" />Inzi nama yonse ya pa kyalo, ni tooni twa mu lweleele, ni kyonse kilikyayibula pansi kili ni bukose, nabipeela maani a saasa kuti bibe bilio byabo.” Evio i vikyaali. <verse eid="GEN 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 1:31" />Leza waamwene nangue byonse bi-aakitile byaali byakilile kuwama. Kwa-alukile kyungulo, kabili kwa-alukile lukeelekeele. Bobo i bwaali busiku bwa mutanda.<verse eid="GEN 1:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GEN 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 2:1" />Evi i vyaapwile kulengua kwa lyulu ni kyalo pamo ni byonse bilimo. <verse eid="GEN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 2:2" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 4:4">Bae 4.4</ref>,<ref loc="HEB 4:10">10</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 20:11">Kut 20.11</ref></char></note>Mu busiku bwa kilooba, Leza waali wasyapwile miilo yakue yonse i-aali wakita. Ni pakako, waatuziizie busiku bwa kilooba ni kulekela kubomba miilo yakue yonse i-aali wakita. <verse eid="GEN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 2:3" />Leza waapaalile busiku bwa kilooba ni kubuzuukia pantu i busiku bu-atuziiziemo pa kyamba kya miilo ya kulenga bintu byonse. <verse eid="GEN 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 2:4" />Leli i lyasi lya kulengua kwa lyulu ni kyalo.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="GEN 2:4">Bukaba bwa mu Edeni</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 2:4">Yawe Leza lu-aalengele lyulu ni kyalo, <verse eid="GEN 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 2:5" />pa kyalo tepaali pamenene kantu, ni saasa wa mu kisonso waali teunamene, pantu Yawe Leza waali tananokiepo nvula, kabili tepaali muntu wa kulima musili. <verse eid="GEN 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 2:6" />Inzi menda a pansi i-aali aleeta kinwanvi pa bulongo.<verse eid="GEN 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 2:7" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 15:45">1 Bak 15.45</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yawe Leza waabuulile lufunko lwa bulongo, wabumba mwalalume ni kumupuzila mupuze wa bukose mu myona, ni ye wa-aluka kilengua kikose.<verse eid="GEN 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 2:8" />Kabili Yawe Leza waakitile bukaba mu Edeni lya ku kabanga ni kubiikamo muntu u-aabumbile. <verse eid="GEN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 2:9" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 2:7">Nfy 2.7</ref>; <ref loc="REV 22:2">22.2</ref>,<ref loc="REV 22:14">14</ref></char></note>Yawe Leza waameniizie misango yonse ya bimuti pa musili, bimuti biweme mu monekelo, bilibyaseekako mazabo aweme a kulia. Pa bukata bwa bukaba, paali pali kimuti kya bukose ni kimuti kya kumana biweme ni bibiipile.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.9 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kumana biweme ni bibiipile</char><char style="ft" closed="false">; Ao </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Kumana kubalua kantu.</char></note><verse eid="GEN 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 2:10" />Momo mu Edeni i mwaali mwafumine mwenzi waali waleeta kinwanvi mu bukaba. Ozo mwenzi waali wakasanikilemo myenzi ina. <verse eid="GEN 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 2:11" />Mwenzi wa mambo uliwakuutua Pishoni. Ozo mwenzi i uzyungulukiile kyalo kya Havila kilimo oro. <verse eid="GEN 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 2:12" />Oro ya mu kekio kyalo iwamiisie, kabili i muli butonvu bwa bunu ni mabue a oniksi. <verse eid="GEN 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 2:13" />Mwenzi wa bubili uliwakuutua Gioni. Ozo mwenzi i uzyungulukiile kyalo kya Kushi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.13 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kushi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">(Ili lya ku nkungulua kabamga ya Mezopotamia); Ao Etiopia</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 2:14" />Mwenzi wa butatu uliwakuutua Tigri. Ozo i upitile lya ku kabanga ka Asiria. Ni mwenzi wa buna uliwakuutua Efrati.<verse eid="GEN 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 2:15" />Kabili Yawe Leza waamutweme muntu ni kuya kumuteeka mu bukaba bwa mu Edeni kuti aye wasekwila ni kubulabukila. <verse eid="GEN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 2:16" />Yawe Leza waamwanine evi, “Mazabo onse a ku bimuti bya mu bukaba kuti wa-alia, <verse eid="GEN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 2:17" />inga sie mazabo a ku kimuti kya kumana biweme ni bibiipile, kyene tekuti ukalieko. Busiku buwaakalia mazabo a ku keki kimuti, kisinka waakafua!”<verse eid="GEN 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 2:18" />Kabili Yawe Leza waalandile evi, “Muntu tapalile kuya waikeele bunke bwakue. Ndikumukitila mukwasi amupalile.” <verse eid="GEN 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 2:19" />Yawe Leza waabuulile bulongo ni kubumba kubalua nama wa mu kisonso, ni kubalua kyoni kya mu lweleele ni kumutwalila muntu, evi Leza amone vi-alikubiinika meena. Kubalua liina lyainikilue kilengua kikose, i lyaali liina lyakyo. <verse eid="GEN 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 2:20" />Muntu wainikile meena a nama ya kuteekua ni meena a byoni pamo ni meena a nama ya mu kisonso, inzi pa bebi byonse muntu taamwenepo mukwasi amupalile.<verse eid="GEN 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 2:21" />Yawe Leza waamuoniizie muntu tulo tukata. Lu-aali waonene, waamusomwenemo lubali lumo ni pa kyamba walinghaniapo munofu. <verse eid="GEN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 2:22" />Yawe Leza waakitile mwanakazi na lolia lubali lu-aasomwene ku muntu mwalalume, ni kumutwala ozo mwanakazi kuli mwalalume. <verse eid="GEN 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 2:23" />Mwalalume waalandile evi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 2:23">“Ozu i kikuza kya mu bikuza byane,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 2:23">ni munofu wa mu munofu wane.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 2:23">Evi alikuya wakuutua mwanakazi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 2:23">pantu afumiiziwe ku mwalalume.”<verse eid="GEN 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 2:24" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 19:5">Mat 19.5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:7-8">Mk 10.7-8</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 6:16">1 Bak 6.16</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 5:31">Baef 5.31</ref></char>
    </note>Ni pakako, kubalua mwalalume waakaba wasia se ni nghina ni kuya kulundana na mukazi wakue, ni bo baakaaluka mubili umo.<verse eid="GEN 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 2:25" />Mwalalume ni mukazi wakue baali bali sie bwamba, inzi tebaali baunvua busoni.<verse eid="GEN 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GEN 3" />
  <para style="s1">Kusinakila kwa muntu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 3:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 12:9">Nfy 12.9</ref>; <ref loc="REV 20:2">20.2</ref></char>
    </note>Kizoka kyaali kyakengeele kukila nama yonse ya mu kisonso yaalengelue na Yawe Leza. Kizoka kyaamwipuziizie mwanakazi, “Ati, ni kiine Leza waamikaniizie kulia mazabo a ku bimuti byonse bya mu bukaba?”<verse eid="GEN 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 3:2" />Mwanakazi wa-asukile evi, “Mazabo a ku bimuti byonse bya mu bukaba kuti twalia, <verse eid="GEN 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 3:3" />inzi Leza waalandile nangue, ‘Tekuti mukalie buzabo bwa ku kimuti kili pa bukata bwa bukaba, anzia kukumiako, pantu nga mwaakafua.’”<verse eid="GEN 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 3:4" />Kizoka kyaamwasukile mwanakazi, “Mwandi, temukafua. <verse eid="GEN 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 3:5" />Pantu Leza amanine nangue busiku bumwakaba kulia azo mazabo, menso enu akaba kwizuka, ni mwe mwakaba kwaluka nga Leza mu kumana biweme ni bibiipile.”<verse eid="GEN 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 3:6" />Mwanakazi lu-aamwene nangue mazabo a ku kekio kimuti aali aweme kuliiwa, ni aweme mu kumoneka, kabili apalilile kumuletela mulangue, waakunwineko buzabo, walia, wamupeelako mulume wakue, ni ye walia. <verse eid="GEN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 3:7" />Penka papo, menso abo bonse babili aizuka ni kwinika nangue baali bali bwamba. Kupwako, babamba kutunga kumo maani a kimuti kya miku kuti bavwale.<verse eid="GEN 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 3:8" />Mwalalume ni mwanakazi lubaunvwile Yawe Leza walimukwenda mu bukaba musita wa kyungulo kwasyataleele, baamufyeme mu bimuti bya mu bukaba. <verse eid="GEN 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 3:9" />Yawe Leza waamukuutile muntu ni kumwipuzia, “Uli pi?”<verse eid="GEN 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 3:10" />Ni ye wa-asukile evi, “Naunvwanga lizui lyobe mu bukaba, ni ne natiinanga pantu ngiile nali bwamba, kusyali kufyama!”<verse eid="GEN 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 3:11" />Leza waamwipuziizie evi, “Eba! Nani wakwananga nangue wiile wali bwamba? Eba! Walyanga buzabo bwa ku kimuti kinakikukaania kuliako?”<verse eid="GEN 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 3:12" />Mwaalume wa-asukile evi, “Ozu mwanakazi uwan'mpeele i wan'mpelanga buzabo, ni ne nalia.”<verse eid="GEN 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 3:13" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CO 11:3">2 Bak 11.3</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 2:14">1 Tim 2.14</ref></char>
    </note>Kabili Yawe Leza waamwipuziizie mwanakazi, “Ati, wakitilangaki evio?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 3:13">Mwanakazi wa-asukile evi, “Kizoka i kyan'mbeepanga, ni ne nalia.”<verse eid="GEN 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 3:14" />Ni pakako, Yawe Leza waakyanine kizoka nangue, “Pantu wakitanga evio, watiipua pa nama yonse iliyateekua ni ya mu kisonso. Kutula lelo, waya wasyaendela na kavumo ni kuya walia lufunko nsiku yonse ya bukose bobe. <verse eid="GEN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 3:15" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 12:17">Nfy 12.17</ref></char></note>Ndikubiika bulwani pakati kobe ni mwanakazi, ni pakati ka luvyalo lobe ni lwa mwanakazi. Luvyalo lwa mwanakazi lwaakasyesyeta mutue obe, ni we waakasuma kasinghino kakue.”<verse eid="GEN 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 3:16" />Kabili Yawe waamwanine mwanakazi nangue, “Naakakizia maavia mu kuvyala kobe, pa kuvyala baana waakaba wakisua. Kutona kobe kwaakaba kwali ku mulume obe, kabili i waakaba wakuteekele.”<verse eid="GEN 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 3:17" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HEB 6:8">Bae 6.8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yawe waamwanine mwalalume nangue, “Pantu waitabilanga bintu byalandanga mukazi obe ni kulia buzabo bwa ku kimuti kinakikukaania kuliako, bulongo bwatiipua pa mulandu obe. Mu bukose bobe bonse waakaba wabombesia na maka pa kusanga bilio. <verse eid="GEN 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 3:18" />Mu bulongo mwaakaba mwamena sie lubamba ni myunga, kabili waakaba walia saasa wa mu kisonso. <verse eid="GEN 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 3:19" />Mu kubombesia ni mu kusulwila kobe i muwaakaba wasangila bilio, mpaka paukabwelela ku bulongo kuwaafumine. Uli lufunko, waakabwelela ku lufunko.”<verse eid="GEN 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 3:20" />Mwalalume, liina lyakue Adamu, waamwinikile mukazi wakue liina lya Eva, pantu ozo i wa-alukile nghina wa bantu bonse. <verse eid="GEN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 3:21" />Kabili Yawe Leza waabakitiile bivwalo bya mpapa ya nama ni kubavwika.<verse eid="GEN 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Adamu ni Eva bakumbua mu Edeni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 3:22" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 22:14">Nfy 22.14</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Kabili Yawe Leza waalandile evi, “Evi muntu wa-aluka nga fwefue mu kumana biweme ni bibiipile. Ni pakako, tapalile kupeelua nsambu ya kukununa buzabo bwa ku kimuti kya bukose ni kulia evi akeekalilila muyayaya.” <verse eid="GEN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 3:23" />Yawe Leza waamukumbile Adamu mu bukaba bwa mu Edeni, evi aye alime mu bulongo bu-abumbiilueko. <verse eid="GEN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 3:24" />Leza lu-aamukumbile Adamu mu bukaba, waabiikile makerubi pa nghingililo ya ku kabanga ka bukaba bwa mu Edeni, ni kipanga kya mulilo kyaali kyazyunguluka konse konse kusakilila nzila ya kuya ku kimuti kya bukose.<verse eid="GEN 3:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GEN 4" />
  <para style="s1">Kaini Abeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 4:1" />Adamu waaleele ni mukazi wakue Eva, ni ye waimitile ni kuvyala mwana mwalalume. Eva waalandile evi, “Ozu mwana napeelua na Yawe.” Ni pakako, waamwinikile Kaini.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kaini </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Leli liina mu Kiebrania i kulanda nangue “Kupata.”</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 4:2" />Pa kyamba, waavyele unge mwana mwalalume ni kumwinika Abeli. Abeli waali wali kateeka wa mikooko, inzi Kaini waali mulimi. <verse eid="GEN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 4:3" />Busiku bumo Kaini waatwele ngelelo ya buzombozi kuli Yawe. <verse eid="GEN 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 4:4" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:4">Bae 11.4</ref></char></note>Abeli ni ye waatwele libeli wa pa mikooko yakue, waipaya ni kufumiako munofu unonene kuti ube ngelelo. Yawe waawamiinue na Abeli pamo ni ngelelo yakue, <verse eid="GEN 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 4:5" />inzi taawaamiinue na Kaini pamo ni ngelelo yakue. Ni pakako, Kaini waafiitiisiwe mpaka ni pa menso pakalabana. <verse eid="GEN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 4:6" />Yawe waamwipuziizie Kaini, “Eba, ale wafiitiluaki? Kabili wakalabaniiziaki pa menso? <verse eid="GEN 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 4:7" />Mona we Kaini uwamyenge, nga wawaminwanga.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.7 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Nga wawaminwanga</char><char style="ft" closed="false">; Ao </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Nga napokelelanga ngelelo yobe.</char></note> Inzi pantu waluvyanga, kibalo kikupembeele kyalimukukeba ku kuteeka. Inzi upalile kukyanzia.”<verse eid="GEN 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 4:8" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 23:35">Mat 23.35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:51">Lk 11.51</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 3:12">1 Yoa 3.12</ref></char>
    </note>Kaini waamwanine mwalawakue Abeli nangue, “We mwalawane, twende mu kisonso.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bwaluzi bunge bwa kale </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Twende mu kisonso </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kiebrania tekikwete totu twebo.</char></note> Lubaafikile mu kisonso, Kaini waamwalukiile Abeli ni kumwipaya.<verse eid="GEN 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 4:9" />Yawe waamwipuziizie Kaini, “Mwalaobe ali pi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 4:9">Wa-asukile nangue, “Ne nsimanine. Eba! Nene i musungi wakua mwalawane?”<verse eid="GEN 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 4:10" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HEB 12:24">Bae 12.24</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kabili waamwipuziizie evi, “Wakitangaki? Mulopa wakua mwalaobe uwazuumiizyanga pa bulongo ulimukundilila. <verse eid="GEN 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 4:11" />Evi wewe watiipua ni kukumbua pa bulongo bwaizulanga kanua kakue ni kupokelela mulopa wakua mwalaobe waazuumiiwanga na kuboko kobe. <verse eid="GEN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 4:12" />Paukalima mu bulongo, tebukakuleetela kibwezia, inzi waakaba wali kanukunta mwaya kyalo.”<verse eid="GEN 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 4:13" />Kaini waamwanine Yawe, “Kukanda kuwankanda kwangaviizia, nsivinda kusipikizia. <verse eid="GEN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 4:14" />Mona wankumba mu keno kyalo ni ku menso obe. Evi naakaba nali sie kanukunta mwaya kyalo, ni onse waakan'mona, waakangipaya.”<verse eid="GEN 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 4:15" />Yawe waamwanine Kaini, “Onse waakakwipaya, waakalandwilua nghendo kilooba.” Ni pakako, Yawe waamubiikile kalangi, evi onse waakamumona tekuti akamwipaye. <verse eid="GEN 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 4:16" />Kaini waafumine ku menso akua Yawe ni kuya kwikala mu kyalo kya Nodi, nkendo ili ku kabanga ka Edeni.<verse eid="GEN 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nvyalo yakua Kaini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 4:17" />Kaini waaleele ni mukazi wakue, ni ye waimitile ni kuvyala mwana mwalalume ni kumwinika Enoki. Kaini waakuulile muzi ni kuwinika liina lya mwana wakue mwalalume. <verse eid="GEN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 4:18" />Enoki waavyele mwana mwalalume ni kumwinika Iradi, Iradi waavyele Mehuyaeli, Mehuyaeli waavyele mwana mwalalume ni kumwinika Metushaeli, Metushaeli waavyele Lameki. <verse eid="GEN 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 4:19" />Lameki waupile banakazi babili, umo waali wakuutua Ada, ni unge waali wakuutua Zila. <verse eid="GEN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 4:20" />Ada waavyele Yabali waali kikolue wa bantu baali baikala mu maema ni kuya bali bateeki ba nama. <verse eid="GEN 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 4:21" />Mwalawakue waali wakuutua Yubali. Ozo mwalawakue i kikolue wa balia baali balizia bilimba ni mimpyeta. <verse eid="GEN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 4:22" />Zila waavyele Tubali-Kaini. Ozo muntu i waali mutili wa bibombelo bya misango ilekenkeene,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.22 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ozo muntu i waali mutili wa bibombelo bya misango ilekenkeene</char><char style="ft" closed="false">; Bwaluzi bumo bwa kale buli na </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Kikolue wa batili ba byela.</char></note> bya mukuba ni bya kyela. Nkaziize kwa Tubali-Kaini waali wakuutua Naama.<verse eid="GEN 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 4:23" />Lameki waabaanine bakazi bakue babili,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 4:23">“Ada ni Zila, ntwilizie</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 4:23">mwe bakazi bakua Lameki unvue twebo twane.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 4:23">Nene nakiipaya muntu wakinkisia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 4:23">mulumendo pantu wakinghuma.<verse eid="GEN 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 4:24" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 18:22">Mat 18.22</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kaini kine waakalandwilua nghendo kilooba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 4:24">Lameki waakalandwilua nghendo 77.”<verse eid="GEN 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Seti ni Enoshi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 4:25" />Kabili Adamu waaleele ni mukazi wakue, Eva lu-aimitile waavyele unge mwana mwalalume ni kumwinika Seti. Waalandile evi, “Leza wan'mpeela unge mwana mwalalume wa kupyanikizia pali Abeli waipailue na Kaini.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.25 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Seti: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Leli liina mu Kiebrania i kulanda nangue, “Wakipeelua.”</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 4:26" />Seti ni ye waavyele mwana mwalalume ni kumwinika Enoshi. Ozo musita bantu i ubaatendekeelepo kumupupa Yawe ni kubombia Liina lyakue.<verse eid="GEN 4:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GEN 5" />
  <para style="s1">Nvyalo kufuma pali Adamu mpaka pali Noa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 1:1-4">1 Milandu Ya Nsiku 1.1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 5:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 1:27-28">Kut 1.27-28</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Keki i kitabu kya nvyalo yakua Adamu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="GEN 5:1" />
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 5:1">Leza lu-aalengele muntu, waamukitile wapaleene ni Leza. <verse eid="GEN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 5:2" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 19:4">Mat 19.4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:6">Mk 10.6</ref></char></note>Leza waalengele mwalalume ni mwanakazi, waabapaalile ni kubenika liina lya muntu bobo busiku bubaalengelue. <verse eid="GEN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 5:3" />Adamu lu-aakumaniizie myaka 130, waavyele mwana mwalalume mu lukebu lwakue, wapaleene nakue ni kumwinika Seti. <verse eid="GEN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 5:4" />Pa kyamba kya kuvyala Seti, Adamu waikeele pa kyalo myaka 800 ni kuvyala bange baana balalume ni banakazi. <verse eid="GEN 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 5:5" />Adamu waafwile wali na myaka 930.<verse eid="GEN 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 5:6" />Seti lu-aakumaniizie myaka 105, waavyele mwana mwalalume ni kumwinika Enoshi. <verse eid="GEN 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 5:7" />Pa kyamba kya kuvyala Enoshi, Seti waikeele pa kyalo myaka 807 ni kuvyala bange baana balalume ni banakazi. <verse eid="GEN 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 5:8" />Seti waafwile wali na myaka 912.<verse eid="GEN 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 5:9" />Enoshi lu-aakumaniizie myaka 90, waavyele mwana mwalalume ni kumwinika Kenani, <verse eid="GEN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 5:10" />pa kyamba kya kuvyala Kenani, Enoshi waikeele pa kyalo myaka 815 ni kuvyala bange baana balalume ni banakazi. <verse eid="GEN 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 5:11" />Enoshi waafwile wali na myaka 905.<verse eid="GEN 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 5:12" />Kenani lu-aakumaniizie myaka 70, waavyele mwana mwalalume ni kumwinika Mahalaleli. <verse eid="GEN 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 5:13" />Pa kyamba kya kuvyala Mahalaleli, Kenani waikeele pa kyalo myaka 840 ni kuvyala bange baana balalume ni banakazi. <verse eid="GEN 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 5:14" />Kenani waafwile wali na myaka 910.<verse eid="GEN 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 5:15" />Mahalaleli lu-aakumaniizie myaka 65, waavyele mwana mwalalume ni kumwinika Yaredi, <verse eid="GEN 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 5:16" />pa kyamba kya kuvyala Yaredi, Mahalaleli waikeele pa kyalo myaka 830 ni kuvyala bange baana balalume ni banakazi. <verse eid="GEN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 5:17" />Mahalaleli waafwile wali na myaka 895.<verse eid="GEN 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 5:18" />Yaredi lu-aakumaniizie myaka 162, waavyele mwana mwalalume ni kumwinika Enoki, <verse eid="GEN 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 5:19" />pa kyamba kya kuvyala Enoki, Yaredi waikeele pa kyalo myaka 800 ni kuvyala bange baana balalume ni banakazi. <verse eid="GEN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 5:20" />Yaredi waafwile wali na myaka 962.<verse eid="GEN 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 5:21" />Enoki lu-aakumaniizie myaka 65, waavyele mwana mwalalume ni kumwinika Metusela. <verse eid="GEN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 5:22" />Pa kyamba kya kuvyala Metusela, Enoki waendele pamo ni Leza myaka 300, kabili waavyele ni bange baana balalume ni banakazi. <verse eid="GEN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 5:23" />Enoki waafwile wali na myaka 365. <verse eid="GEN 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 5:24" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:5">Bae 11.5</ref>; <ref loc="JUD 1:14">Yud 14</ref></char></note>Enoki waendele pamo ni Leza, kabili taamwenekele pantu waatwemue na Leza wakosele.<verse eid="GEN 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 5:25" />Metusela lu-aakumaniizie myaka 187, waavyele mwana mwalalume ni kumwinika Lameki, <verse eid="GEN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 5:26" />pa kyamba kya kuvyala Lameki, Metusela waikeele pa kyalo myaka 782 ni kuvyala bange baana balalume ni banakazi. <verse eid="GEN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 5:27" />Metusela waafwile wali na myaka 969.<verse eid="GEN 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 5:28" />Lameki lu-aakumaniizie myaka 182, waavyele mwana mwalalume <verse eid="GEN 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 5:29" />ni kumwinika Noa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.29 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Noa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Leli liina lya Noa mu Kiebrania i kulanda nangue “kutuuzia.”</char></note> Waalandile evi, “Ozu i waakatusansamusia kukonkana ni miilo ikolele itulitwabomba pa kyalo kyaatiipilue na Yawe.” <verse eid="GEN 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 5:30" />Pa kyamba kya kuvyala Noa, Lameki waikeele pa kyalo myaka 595 ni kuvyala bange baana balalume ni banakazi. <verse eid="GEN 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 5:31" />Lameki waafwile wali na myaka 777.<verse eid="GEN 5:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 5:32" />Noa lu-aakumaniizie myaka 500, waavyele Shemu, ni Hamu, ni Yafeti.<verse eid="GEN 5:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GEN 6" />
  <para style="s1">Bubi bwa bantu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 6:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 1:6">Yob 1.6</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 2:1">2.1</ref></char>
    </note>Bantu lubaatendekele kusanduluka pa kyalo, baali bavyala ni baana banakazi. <verse eid="GEN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 6:2" />Baana bena Leza lubaamwene nangue bakazyana bena bantu baali baweme, baisaakwiliilepo bamo kuba bali bakazi babo. <verse eid="GEN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 6:3" />Yawe waalandile evi, “Mweo wane teukikanzyania na muntu muyayaya pantu wene ni wa kufua. Kutula lelo, myaka yakue teikikaba yakila pa myaka 120.” <verse eid="GEN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 6:4" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 13:33">Mpe 13.33</ref></char></note>Mu ezio nsiku Banefili baali bali pa kyalo. Pa kyamba baana bena Leza lubaile kuupa baana banakazi bena bantu, baavyelemo baana balalume. Babo i baali bali babipami ba bantu baali bamanikile pa ozo musita.<verse eid="GEN 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 6:5" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6.5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 24:37">Mat 24.37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:26">Lk 17.26</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 3:20">1 Pet 3.20</ref></char>
    </note>Yawe lu-aamwene nangue bubi bwa muntu bwakila pa kyalo, ni kumona nangue malanga a mu mutima wakue lyonse aali akila kubiipa, <verse eid="GEN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 6:6" />Yawe waunvwile bulanda pantu waalengele muntu pa kyalo, ni mutima wakue waamukisile. <verse eid="GEN 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 6:7" />Yawe waalandile evi, “Nakaba kulovia muntu unaalengele pa kyalo, bonse muntu ni nama, ni bilibyayibula pamo ni tooni twa mu lweleele. Naunvua bulanda pantu naabilengele.” <verse eid="GEN 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 6:8" />Inzi Noa waali watonenue na Yawe.<verse eid="GEN 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Noa wakita safina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 6:9" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6.9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2PE 2:5">2 Pet 2.5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Leli i lyasi lyakua Noa ni luvyalo lwakue. Noa waali wali mulunghami ni wa kisinka mu bantu ba pa musita wakue, kabili waali waenda ni Leza. <verse eid="GEN 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 6:10" />Noa waavyele baana balalume batatu, Shenu, Hamu, ni Yafeti. <verse eid="GEN 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 6:11" />Leza waamwene nangue kyalo kyainooneka, ni kukitilana bibiipile kwakila kukumana mwaya kyalo. <verse eid="GEN 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 6:12" />Leza waakentele ni kumona nangue kyalo kyabiipa pantu bantu bonse baali baikeele mu bwikazi bubi.<verse eid="GEN 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 6:13" />Leza waamwanine Noa nangue, “Mpeleezio ya bantu bonse yakumana pantu bubi bwabo bwaizula mu kyalo kyonse. Kabili nakaba kubaloviizia pamo ni kyalo. <verse eid="GEN 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 6:14" />We Noa, nakwana ukite safina ikata ya mbao ilumine, ni kuputulamo miputule, ukabe kusubako kabulimbu mukati ni panze. <verse eid="GEN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 6:15" />Ukabe kukita safina ileepele metre 133, ni mu bukata metre 22, ni mu kutuuluka metre lyanondo ni itatu. <verse eid="GEN 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 6:16" />Ukabe kukitako mutenge ni kusiako mando ali ni santimetre 44. Ukabe kukitamo mpungu itatu yateekaleene yali ni mulyango mumbali, <verse eid="GEN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 6:17" />pantu nakaba kubunzia kyalo ni kwinoona bilengua byonse bikose. Bilengua byonse bili pa kyalo byakaba kufua. <verse eid="GEN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 6:18" />Inzi nakaba kupinghana nobe. Wewe ukengile mu safina ni mukazi obe, ni baana bobe balalume pamo ni bakazi babo. <verse eid="GEN 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 6:19" />Kabili pa bilengua byonse bikose ukabe kubuulapo bibili bibili ni kubingizia mu safina, ukabisunge byakosele kilume ni kikota. <verse eid="GEN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 6:20" />Ukabe kubuula misango yonse ya nama, ni misango yonse ya tooni, ni ya byonse bilibyayibula. Bebi byonse, byaakeeza kuli wewe bibili bibili kuti ukabisunge byakosele. <verse eid="GEN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 6:21" />Ukabe kubuula misango yonse ya bilio ukabe kubisunga, evi wewe ni nama pamo ni tooni mukabe mwabilia.” <verse eid="GEN 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 6:22" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:7">Bae 11.7</ref></char></note>Noa waakitile bintu byonse nga mwa-aniinue na Leza.<verse eid="GEN 6:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="GEN 7" />
  <para style="s1">Kibunda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 7:1" />Yawe waamwanine Noa nangue, “Ale ingila mu safina pamo ni lupua lobe pantu nakikumona wali mulunghami pa bantu bonse. <verse eid="GEN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 7:2" />Buulapo mpe kilooba ya misango yonse ya nama isambikile ndume ni ikota, inzi nama itiikeene ubuulepo mpe imo imo ndume ni ikota. <verse eid="GEN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 7:3" />Kabili buula mpe kilooba ya misango yonse ya tooni tulume ni tukota. Ukite evio kumona sie misango yonse ya nama ni ya tooni ikasungue bwino, evi ikavyalane paakale ni kuvula pa kyalo, <verse eid="GEN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 7:4" />pantu kwasyala nsiku kilooba nkabe kunokia nvula pa kyalo. Ezio nvula yakaba kunoka nsiku 40 busiku ni koba. Nakaba kwinoona bilengua byonse bikose binaalengele pa kyalo.” <verse eid="GEN 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 7:5" />Noa waakitile bintu byonse bya-aninue na Yawe.<verse eid="GEN 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 7:6" />Kyalo lukyaabundile, Noa waali wali na myaka 600. <verse eid="GEN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 7:7" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:38-39">Mat 24.38-39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:27">Lk 17.27</ref></char></note>Noa ni mukazi wakue ni baana bakue balalume pamo ni bakazi babo, baingiile mu safina evi tekuti bafue na azo menda a kibunda. <verse eid="GEN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 7:8" />Misango yonse ya nama ni ya tooni kilume ni kikota, bisambikile ni bisisambikile pamo ni bilibyayibula pansi, <verse eid="GEN 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 7:9" />byaingiile bibili bibili mu safina pamo ni Noa nga mwaalandiile Leza. <verse eid="GEN 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 7:10" />Pa kyamba kya nsiku kilooba, kibunda kyaizile pa kyalo.<verse eid="GEN 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 7:11" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7.11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2PE 3:6">2 Pet 3.6</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Noa lu-aali na myaka 600, mu mwezi wa bubili pa nsiku lyanondo ni kilooba, menda aabambile kusula na maka mu tusulo. Mu muulu ni mo mwaabambile kwituluka menda. <verse eid="GEN 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 7:12" />Ezio nvula yaanokele pa kyalo nsiku 40 busiku ni koba. <verse eid="GEN 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 7:13" />Bobo bwenka busiku, Noa ni mukazi ni baana bakue balalume batatu, Shemu, ni Hamu, ni Yafeti pamo ni bakazi babo, baingiile mu safina. <verse eid="GEN 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 7:14" />Baingiile mu safina pamo ni nama ya mu kisonso mu misango yayo. Nama ya kuteekua mu misango yayo, ikata ni iniini, ni bilibyayibula pansi mu misango yabyo, ni tooni pamo ni byonse bilibyapupuka mu misango yabyo. <verse eid="GEN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 7:15" />Bilengua bikose, bibili bibili kilume ni kikota, byaingiile mu safina pamo ni Noa. <verse eid="GEN 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 7:16" />Kubalua kilengua kikose, kilume ni kikota byaingiile mu safina nga mwa-aniinue Noa na Leza. Kupwako, Yawe wamwizalila Noa.<verse eid="GEN 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17-18" style="v" sid="GEN 7:17-18" />Nvula yaatwaliliile kunoka mpaka nsiku 40 busiku ni koba. Menda aizwile pa kyalo mpaka ni safina yabamba kweleela. <verse eid="GEN 7:17-18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 7:19" />Menda aizwile pa kyalo mpaka ni mpili yonse yatibila. <verse eid="GEN 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 7:20" />Azo menda atwaaliliile kwizula pa kyalo mpaka metre kilooba kufuma peulu lupili luleepeesie. <verse eid="GEN 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 7:21" />Kubalua kilengua kikose kyaali kyaenda pa kyalo, kyoni, ni nama wa kuteekua ni nama wa mu kisonso, ni kilikyayibula pa kyalo pamo ni muntu, byaafwile. <verse eid="GEN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 7:22" />Bilengua byonse byaali byapeema pano pa kyalo byaafwile. <verse eid="GEN 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 7:23" />Yawe waloviizie bilengua byonse bya pano pa kyalo. Waaloviizie bantu ni nama pamo ni byoni. Paasyele sie Noa ni balia baali wali nabo mu safina. <verse eid="GEN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 7:24" />Menda aasyele aizwile pa kyalo nsiku 150.<verse eid="GEN 7:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="GEN 8" />
  <para style="s1">Nvula yakata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 8:1" />Leza waamulangulukile Noa ni bilengua byonse bikose bi-aali nabio mu safina. Leza waabuusiizie mwela pa kyalo, ni menda aatendekele kuya akama. <verse eid="GEN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 8:2" />Monse mwaali mwafuma menda pansi mwaasinkile, lyulu lyaizalikile, ni nvula yaakatile, <verse eid="GEN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 8:3" />menda aatwaliliile kuya akama buke buke mpaka nsiku 150. <verse eid="GEN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 8:4" />Pa busiku bwa lyanondo ni kilooba mwezi wa kilooba, safina yaikeele peulu mpili ya Ararati. <verse eid="GEN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 8:5" />Menda aatwaliliile kukeepa. Mu mwezi wa lyanondo pa busiku bwa mambo, mpili yaatendekele kumoneka.<verse eid="GEN 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 8:6" />Lupaapitile nsiku 40, Noa waizwile nzota <verse eid="GEN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 8:7" />ni kutuma kazooko. Kazooko tekaabwelele, inzi kaali kaya kazyunguluka sie mu lweleele mpaka musita waakamine menda pa kyalo. <verse eid="GEN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 8:8" />Kabili Noa waatumine kakunda kaye kamone kine menda akeepa pa kyalo, <verse eid="GEN 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 8:9" />inzi pantu menda aali teanakame pa kyalo kyonse, kakunda tekaamwene nkendo ya kuya kwikalapo. Ni pakako, kaabweleele kuli Noa. Noa wakakwata ni kukengizia mu safina. <verse eid="GEN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 8:10" />Pa kyamba kya mulungu umo, kabili Noa waafumiizie kakunda mu safina ni kukatuma. <verse eid="GEN 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 8:11" />Bobo bwenka busiku kyungulo, kakunda kaabwelele katweme lyani lya muzeituni ku mulomo. Noa i lu-ainikile nangue menda akeepa. <verse eid="GEN 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 8:12" />Kabili Noa waapembeele ni unge mulungu. Waatumine kakunda paakale. Lolo lwendo lwene kakunda tekaabwelele.<verse eid="GEN 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 8:13" />Noa lu-aakumaniizie myaka 601, mu mwezi wa mambo pa busiku bwa mambo, menda aakamine pa kyalo. Noa waatupukwile ntupiko ya safina, ni kiine wamwene menda akamine. <verse eid="GEN 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 8:14" />Mu mwezi wa bubili pa nsiku 27, Musili waumine.<verse eid="GEN 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 8:15" />Leza waamwanine Noa nangue, <verse eid="GEN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 8:16" />“Fuma mu safina, wewe ni mukazi obe, ni baana bobe balalume pamo ni bakazi babo. <verse eid="GEN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 8:17" />Fumia kubalua kilengua kikosele ki-uli nakio mu safina, byoni, ni nama pamo ni kubalua kilengua kya pa kyalo, evi bivyalane ni kusanduluka pa kyalo.” <verse eid="GEN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 8:18" />Ni kiine Noa waafumine pamo ni mukazi wakue, ni baana bakue balalume pamo ni bakazi babo. <verse eid="GEN 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 8:19" />Nama ni byoni pamo ni bilengua byonse bikose byaali byali mu safina, byaafumine.<verse eid="GEN 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Noa wamwelela Leza ngelelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 8:20" />Noa waamukuuliile Yawe kitale. Waabuulilepo misango yonse ya bilengua bisambikile, pa nama ni tooni, ni kubiziziizia byonse pa kitale kuti bibe ngelelo. <verse eid="GEN 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 8:21" />Yawe waawamiinue na bunu bwa ngelelo yaaziziiziwe. Yawe waalandile evi, “Nsikikatiipa kabili kyalo pa mulandu wa muntu, anzia kine malanga a muntu abiipile kutula ku bulumendo bwakue. Kabili nsikikeenoona bilengua byonse bikose mu ozu musango. <verse eid="GEN 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 8:22" />Lyonse kyalo lukikilipo, kuli kwaya kwali musita wa kubyala ni musita wa kuzombola, musita wa kasama ni musita wa lyuza, musita wa mwela ni musita wa likungulu, musita wa koba ni musita wa busiku, ni byo byaakabeelelela.”<verse eid="GEN 8:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="GEN 9" />
  <para style="s1">Leza wapinghana ni Noa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 9:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9.1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 1:28">Kut 1.28</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Leza waamupaalile Noa pamo ni baana bakue balalume wabaana nangue, “Vyalane musanduluke evi luvyalo lobe lwizuzie kyalo. <verse eid="GEN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 9:2" />Nama yonse ya pa kyalo ni tooni tonse twa mu lweleele, ni bilengua byonse bilibyayibula pansi, ni masabi onse a mu lyezi, byaakaba byaunvua mwezo ni kumitiina. Kabili namipeela buvinde pa bintu byonse bya pa kyalo. <verse eid="GEN 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 9:3" />Nama ya misango yonse ikosele yaakaba bilio byenu nga vinaamipeele saasa ulekenkeene. <verse eid="GEN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 9:4" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 7:26-27">Bal 7.26-27</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 17:10-14">17.10-14</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:26">Bal 19.26</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 12:16">Mam 12.16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 23">23</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 15:23">15.23</ref></char></note>Inzi tekuti mukaliililile nama pamo ni mulopa wakue, pantu i bukose bwakue. <verse eid="GEN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 9:5" />Kisinka naakakita kibwelezi pa mulopa wa bukose bwenu, naakakita kibwelezi ku muntu ni ku nama, ni ku muntu ni muntu nakue. <verse eid="GEN 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 9:6" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:26">Kut 1.26</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 20:13">Kuf 20.13</ref></char></note>Ozo waakeetila mulopa wa muntu, ni ye mulopa wakue waakeetilua na muntu, pantu muntu waalengelue wapaleene ni Leza.<verse eid="GEN 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 9:7" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9.7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 1:28">Kut 1.28</ref>
      </char>
    </note> “Inzi mwemue vyalane musanduluke evi luvyalo lobe lwizuzie kyalo.”<verse eid="GEN 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 9:8" />Kabili Leza waamwanine Noa ni baana bakue balalume nangue, <verse eid="GEN 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 9:9" />“Unvue, napinghana nenu pamo ni nvyalo yenu. <verse eid="GEN 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 9:10" />Napinghana na bilengua byonse bikose: Toni tonse, ni nama yonse ya kuteekua pamo ni nama yonse ya mu kisonso imwakifuma nayo mu safina. <verse eid="GEN 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 9:11" />Napinghana nenu nangue, nene nsikikeenoona kabili bilengua bikose na kibunda. Kabili tekukaba kinge kibunda kyaakeenoona kyalo.” <verse eid="GEN 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 9:12" />Leza waabaanine nangue, “Kaka i kalangi ka kipingo kinapinghana nenu pamo ni bilengua byonse bikose, kalangi ka muyayaya ku nvyalo yonse ya ku ntanzi. <verse eid="GEN 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 9:13" />Nabiika mukolanvula mu malezi kuti ube kalangi ka kipingo kinapinghana na kyalo. <verse eid="GEN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 9:14" />Naakaba nakita kine nakolonghania malezi, ni mukolanvula wamoneka mu malezi, <verse eid="GEN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 9:15" />naakaba nalangakana kipingo kinapinghana nenu, ni nama yonse ni tooni tonse pamo ni bilengua byonse bikose nangue nsikikabinoona kabili na kibunda. <verse eid="GEN 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 9:16" />Mukolanvula paukaba wamoneka mu malezi, naakaba nakentako kuti nanguluke kipingo kya muyayaya kili pakati kane ni bilengua byonse bikose bya pa kyalo.” <verse eid="GEN 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 9:17" />Leza waamwanine Noa, “Kaka i kalangi ka kipingo kinapinghana na bilengua byonse bikose bya pa kyalo.”<verse eid="GEN 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Noa ni baana bakue balalume</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 9:18" />Meena a baana balalume bena Noa baafumine mu safina ni aza: Shemu, ni Hamu, Ni Yafeti. Hamu i waavyele Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 9:19" />Babo baana batatu balalume bena Noa i babikolue ba bantu bonse baasalangheene mwaya kyalo.<verse eid="GEN 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 9:20" />Noa wa-alukile mulimi. Kabili i waali wa mambo kulima bukaba bwa mizabibu. <verse eid="GEN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 9:21" />Busiku bumo Noa waaminine divai, wakolua, ngubo yakue yaapenukile paali waleele mu liema lyakue. <verse eid="GEN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 9:22" />Hamu, se kwa Kanaani, lu-aamwene se waleele bwamba, waile kubwilako Shemu ni Yafeti. <verse eid="GEN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 9:23" />Shemu ni Yafeti lubaunvwile evio, baatweme ngubo pa nkombe, babamba kuya nayo kinfwefue mpaka kuya kumuvimba sibo. Bene tebaamukentele sibo waali waleele bwamba. <verse eid="GEN 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 9:24" />Noa lu-aakololokelue ni kumana vyaakitile mwana wakue Hamu, <verse eid="GEN 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 9:25" />waalandile evi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 9:25">“Kanaani atiipue!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 9:25">Kabili aye wali muzia wakua Shemu ni Yaferi.”<verse eid="GEN 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 9:26" />Kabili waalandile evi, “Yawe, Leza wakua Shemu apaalue!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 9:26">Kanaani aye wali muzia wakua Shemu!<verse eid="GEN 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 9:27" />Leza avuzie bunonsi bwakua Yafeti.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.27 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Yafeti </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Leli liina mu Kiebrania i kulanda nangue “kuvula.”</char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 9:27">Yafeti ekale mu maema akua Shemu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 9:27">ni Kanaani aye wali muzia wakua Yafeti.”<verse eid="GEN 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 9:28" />Pa kyamba kya kibunda, Noa waikeele pa kyalo myaka 350. <verse eid="GEN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 9:29" />Noa waafwile wali na myaka 950.<verse eid="GEN 9:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="GEN 10" />
  <para style="s1">Ntundu yaafumine mu baana balalume bena Noa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 1:5-23">1 Milandu Ya Nsiku 1.5-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 10:1" />Noa waavyele baana batatu balalumenke: Shemu, ni Hamu, pamo ni Yafeti. Babo batatu ni bo baavyele baana balalume pa kyamba kya kibunda.<verse eid="GEN 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 10:2" />Yafeti waavyele Gomeri, ni Magogi, ni Madai, ni Yavani, ni Tubali, ni Mesheki, pamo ni Tirasi. <verse eid="GEN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 10:3" />Gomeri waavyele Ashkenazi, ni Rifati, pamo ni Togarma. <verse eid="GEN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 10:4" />Yavani waavyele Elisha, ni Tarshishi, ni Kitimu, pamo ni Dodanimu. <verse eid="GEN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 10:5" />Babo i babikolue ba bantu baali baikeele mu bilila. Ezi i nvyalo yakua Yafeti yaali yaikeele kubalua mukowa mu kyalo kyakue. Kubalua libumba lyaali lyalanda lulimi lwakue.<verse eid="GEN 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 10:6" />Hamu waavyele Kushi, ni Misri, ni Puti, pamo ni Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 10:7" />Kushi waavyele Seba, ni Havila, ni Sabuta, ni Raama, pamo ni Sabuteka. Raama i waavyele Sheba ni Dedani. <verse eid="GEN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 10:8" />Kushi waavyele Nimrodi. Ozo Nimrodi i waali kalwisia wa maka pa kyalo. <verse eid="GEN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 10:9" />Waali wali mbwela wa nama mwine mwine ku menso akua Yawe. Ni pakako, bantu balibalanda nangue, “Nga Nimrodi mbwela wa nama mwine mwine ku menso akua Yawe.” <verse eid="GEN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 10:10" />Ntendeko ya bukolo bwakue yaali mu Babeli, ni mu Ereki, ni mu Akadi, pamo ni mu Kalne mu kyalo kya Sinari. <verse eid="GEN 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 10:11" />Nimrodi lu-aafumine koko, waile ku Asuria, wakuulako muzi wa Ninawe, ni muzi wa Rehoboti-Iri, ni muzi wa Kala, <verse eid="GEN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 10:12" />pamo ni muzi ukata wa Reseni, muzi uli pa bukata bwa muzi wa Ninawe ni wa Kala.<verse eid="GEN 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 10:13" />Misri waavyele Baludia, ni Ba-anamu, ni Baleabu, ni Banafutui, <verse eid="GEN 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 10:14" />ni Bapatrusi, ni Bakaslui. Babo i babikolue ba Bafilistini ni Bakaftori.<verse eid="GEN 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 10:15" />Kanaani waavyele Sidona waali libeli wakue, kabili waavyele Heti. <verse eid="GEN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 10:16" />Kanaani ni ye waali wali kikolue wa Bayebushi, ni Ba-amori, ni Bagirgashi, <verse eid="GEN 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 10:17" />ni Bahivi, ni Ba-ariki, ni Basini <verse eid="GEN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 10:18" />ni Ba-arvati, ni Basemari, pamo ni Bahamati.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 10:18">Pa kyamba, nvyalo ya Bakanaani yaasalangheene. <verse eid="GEN 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 10:19" />Mipaka ya kyalo kyabo yaali yafumine ku Sidona yaile lya ku Gerasi mpaka ku Gaza. Kabili yaali yapitile lya ku Sodoma, ni lya ku Gomora, ni lya ku Adima, pamo ni lya ku Seboimu mpaka ku Lasha. <verse eid="GEN 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 10:20" />Ezi i nvyalo yakua Hamu yaali yaikeele kubalua mukowa mu kyalo kyakue. Kubalua libumba lyaali lyalanda lulimi lwakue.<verse eid="GEN 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bena Shemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 10:21" />Shemu, mukuluube kwa Yafeti, i waali kikolue wa Baeberi bonse. <verse eid="GEN 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 10:22" />Shemu waavyele Elamu, ni Ashuri, ni Arpakishadi, ni Ludi, pamo ni Aramu. <verse eid="GEN 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 10:23" />Aramu waavyele Uzi, ni Huli, ni Geteri, pamo ni Mashi. <verse eid="GEN 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 10:24" />Arpakishadi waavyele Sela. Sela ni ye waavyele Eberi. <verse eid="GEN 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 10:25" />Eberi waavyele baana babili balalume: Umo waali wakuutua Pelegi,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.25 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Pelegi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Leli liina mu Kiebrania i kulanda nangue “kukasania.”</char></note> pantu waavyelue musita ubaakaseene kyalo mu mikoa mikoa. Ni unge wainikilue Yoketani. <verse eid="GEN 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 10:26" />Yoketani waavyele Almodadi, ni Shelefu, ni Asarmaveti, ni Yera, <verse eid="GEN 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 10:27" />ni Hadoramu, ni Uzali, ni Dikla, <verse eid="GEN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 10:28" />ni Obali, ni Abimaeli, ni Sheba, <verse eid="GEN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 10:29" />ni Ofiri, ni Avila, pamo ni Yobabu. Babo bonse baali ba mu luvyalo lwakua Yoketani. <verse eid="GEN 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 10:30" />Kyalo kibaali baikeelemo kyaali kyatendekeele ku Mesha kine ulimukuya ku Sefari ku kapili ka ku kabanga ka kyalo. <verse eid="GEN 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 10:31" />Ezi i nvyalo yakua Shemu yaali yaikeele kubalua mukowa mu kyalo kyakue. Kubalua libumba lyaali lyalanda lulimi lwakue.<verse eid="GEN 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 10:32" />Babo bantu bonse ba mu luvyalo lwakua Noa, i ntundu yaafumine mu baana balalume bena Noa, ntundu yaasalangheene mwaya kyalo kyonse pa kyamba kya kibunda.<verse eid="GEN 10:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="GEN 11" />
  <para style="s1">Munara wa Babeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 11:1" />Pa ozo musita, bekala kyalo bonse baali balanda sie lulimi lumo ni twebo tumo. <verse eid="GEN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 11:2" />Lubaali baya lya ku kabanga, baafikile mu lulambe lwa Sinari, ni momo i mubaikeele. <verse eid="GEN 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 11:3" />Baalanzyaniizie nangue, “Emwe, ize tukite mabiliki ni ku-azizia bwino.” Pa kifuka kya mabue, baakitile mabiliki, ni kukuulila na kabulimbu. <verse eid="GEN 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 11:4" />Baalandile nangue, “Tukuule muzi ni munara ufikile mu lyulu pakuti tuye twamanikile evi tekuti tukasalanghanine mwaya kyalo.”<verse eid="GEN 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 11:5" />Yawe waakookele kuya kumona muzi wa munara waali wakuulua na bena bantu. <verse eid="GEN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 11:6" />Yawe waalandile evi, “Baba bantu bali mu mutundu umo, kabili balimukulanda lulimi lumo, ni ezi ikili sie ntendeko ya miilo yabo. Tekuli kyaakabanzia kukita kelia kiboomiine kukita. <verse eid="GEN 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 11:7" />Ale tukooke tuye tuvulunghanie nandilo yabo, evi tekuti bonvwane.” <verse eid="GEN 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 11:8" />Ni pakako, Yawe waabasalanghaniizie pa kyalo kyonse. Ni bo baalekeele kukuula muzi. <verse eid="GEN 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 11:9" />Evi muzi wainikilue Babeli, pantu papo Yawe i pa-aavulunghaniizie lulimi lwa bantu bonse. Kutula papo, Yawe waabasalanghaniizie mwaya kyalo.<verse eid="GEN 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bena Shemu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 1:24-27">1 Milandu Ya Nsiku 1.24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 11:10" />Ezi i nvyalo yakua Shemu. Pa kyamba kya kibunda lupaali pasyapitile myaka ibili, Shemu lu-aakumaniizie myaka 100, waavyele mwana mwalalume ni kumwinika Arpakisadi. <verse eid="GEN 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 11:11" />Pa kyamba kya kuvyala Arpakisadi, Shemu waikeele pa kyalo myaka 500 ni kuvyala bange baana balalume ni banakazi.<verse eid="GEN 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 11:12" />Arpakisadi lu-aakumaniizie myaka 35, waavyele Sela. <verse eid="GEN 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 11:13" />Pa kyamba kya kuvyala Sela, Aripakisadi waikeele pa kyalo myaka 403 ni kuvyala bange baana balalume ni banakazi.<verse eid="GEN 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 11:14" />Sela lu-aakumaniizie myaka 30, waavyele mwana mwalalume ni kumwinika Eberi. <verse eid="GEN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 11:15" />Pa kyamba kya kuvyala Eberi, Sela waikeele pa kyalo myaka 403 ni kuvyala bange baana balalume ni banakazi.<verse eid="GEN 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 11:16" />Eberi lu-aakumaniizie myaka 34, waavyele Pelegi. <verse eid="GEN 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 11:17" />Pa kyamba kya kuvyala Pelegi, Eberi waikeele pa kyalo myaka 430 ni kuvyala bange baana balalume ni banakazi.<verse eid="GEN 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 11:18" />Pelegi lu-aakumaniizie myaka 30, waavyele Reu. <verse eid="GEN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 11:19" />Pa kyamba kya kuvyala Reu, Pelegi waikeele pa kyalo myaka 209 ni kuvyala bange baana balalume ni banakazi.<verse eid="GEN 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 11:20" />Reu lu-aakumaniizie myaka 32, waavyele Serugi. <verse eid="GEN 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 11:21" />Pa kyamba kya kuvyala Serugi, Reu waikeele pa kyalo myaka 207 ni kuvyala bange baana balalume ni banakazi.<verse eid="GEN 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 11:22" />Serugi lu-aakumaniizie myaka 30, waavyele Nahori. <verse eid="GEN 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 11:23" />Pa kyamba kya kuvyala Nahori, Serugi waikeele pa kyalo myaka 200 ni kuvyala bange baana balalume ni banakazi.<verse eid="GEN 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 11:24" />Nahori lu-aakumaniizie myaka 29, waavyele Tera. <verse eid="GEN 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 11:25" />Pa kyamba kya kuvyala Tera, Nahori waikeele pa kyalo myaka 119 ni kuvyala bange baana balalume ni banakazi.<verse eid="GEN 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 11:26" />Tera lu-aakumaniizie myaka 70, waavyele Abramu, ni Nahori pamo ni Harani.<verse eid="GEN 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nvyalo yakua Tera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 11:27" />Ezi i nvyalo yakua Tera se kwa Abramu, ni se kwa Nahori pamo ni Harani. Harani i waavyele Loti. <verse eid="GEN 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 11:28" />Harani waafwiliile mu kyalo ki-aavyaliiluemo, mu Uri, muzi wa Bakaldayo. Ozo musita sibo Tera waali wakikosele. <verse eid="GEN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 11:29" />Abramu waupile Sarai, Nahori ni ye waupile Milka mwana mwanakazi mwina Harani. Harani i waavyele Milka ni Iska. <verse eid="GEN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 11:30" />Sarai muka Abramu taali na mwana pantu waali nghumba.<verse eid="GEN 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 11:31" />Tera waamutweme mwana wakue Abramu ni mwinzikulu wakue Loti mwana mwalalume mwina Harani, pamo ni Sarai muka mwana wakue Abramu. Tera waafumine nabo mu Uri mu muzi wa Bakaldayo ni kuya nabo mu kyalo kya Kanaani. Inzi lubaafikile ku Harani, baikeele koko. <verse eid="GEN 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 11:32" />Tera waafwiliile ku Harani wali na myaka 205.<verse eid="GEN 11:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="GEN 12" />
  <para style="s1">Abramu wakuutua na Leza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 12:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12.1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 7:2-3">Mii 7.2-3</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 11:8">Bae 11.8</ref></char>
    </note>Yawe waamwanine Abramu nangue, “Fuma mu kyalo kyobe, sia bantu bobe pamo ni nghanda yakua so uye waya mu kyalo kindikukulangisia.<verse eid="GEN 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 12:2" />“Nene naakakukita kuba mutundu ukata,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 12:2">kabili naakakupaala.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 12:2">Naakalengia liina lyobe kumanika,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 12:2">ni we waakaba wali mapaalo.<verse eid="GEN 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 12:3" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12.3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GAL 3:8">Bag 3.8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Olia waakakupaala, ni ne naakamupaala.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 12:3">Inzi olia waakakutiipa, ni ne naakamutiipa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 12:3">Kabili ntundu yonse ya pa kyalo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 12:3">yaakapaalilua muli wewe.”<verse eid="GEN 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 12:4" />Abramu waafumine mu Harani nga mwaalandiile Yawe. Pa ozo musita, Abramu waali wasyali na myaka 75. Loti ni ye waile pamo nakue. <verse eid="GEN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 12:5" />Abramu waile ni mukazi wakue Sarai pamo ni Loti mwana mwalalume mwina mwalawakue Harani, kabili waatweme bunonsi bwabo pamo ni bantu babaanonkele mu Harani, ni kutendeka lwendo, waya kwingila nabo mu kyalo kya Kanaani.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 12:5">Lubaafikile ku Kanaani, <verse eid="GEN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 12:6" />Abramu waile waendooka mu kyalo mpaka waya kufika ku muzi wa kimuti kikata kya More kya ku Sekemu. Pa ozo musita, Bakanaani baali bakikeele sie mwenka momo mu Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 12:7" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:5">Mii 7.5</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 3:16">Bag 3.16</ref></char></note>Yawe waamumonekeele Abramu ni kumwana nangue, “We Abramu, keki i kyalo kinaakapeela nvyalo yobe.” Ku ezio nkendo, Abramu i ku-aamukuuliile Yawe kitale. <verse eid="GEN 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 12:8" />Abramu lu-aafumine papo, waile ku kapili ku kabanga ka muzi wa Beteli ni kuya kwimikako liema lyakue pa bukata bwa Beteli ni Ai. Beteli yaali yali ku mboosi, ni Ai yaali yali ku kabanga. Koko kwenka ku Ai, Abramu i ku-aamukuuliile Yawe kinge kitale ni kumupupa Yawe. <verse eid="GEN 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 12:9" />Kabili Abramu waatwaliliile kuya. Waile walungi ku Negebu.<verse eid="GEN 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abramu waya ku Misri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 12:10" />Nzala luyaakilile mu Kanaani, Abramu waile kwikalanke ku Misri nga mweni. <verse eid="GEN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 12:11" />Lu-aali wasyafika ku Misri, waamwanine mukazi wakue Sarai nangue, “N'manine nangue wewe uli mwanakazi aweme lukebu. <verse eid="GEN 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 12:12" />Bamisri pabaya kukumona ni kwinika nangue uli mukazi wane, baya bangipaye, ni we uye usyale wakosele. <verse eid="GEN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 12:13" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 20:2">Kut 20.2</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 26:7">26.7</ref></char></note>Kansi pabaya kukwipuzia, uye ubaasuke nangue uli nkazyamwine pantu kine uye ulande evio, nakaba kusungua bwino.” <verse eid="GEN 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 12:14" />Abramu waile kufika mu Misri. Bantu ba mu Misri lubaamumwene Sarai, baamwene nangue ozo mwanakazi waali wakilile kuwama. <verse eid="GEN 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 12:15" />Babiloolo ni bo lubaamumwene, baile kumutasiizia Likolo Farao. Kupwako, bamutwama ni kumutwala ku nghanda yakua Farao. <verse eid="GEN 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 12:16" />Farao waamukitiile Abramu bintu biweme pa mulandu wakua Sarai, ni pakako waapeelue mikooko ni nghombe, ni punda ndume ni ikota, ni ba bombi balalume ni banakazi, pamo ni nghamia.<verse eid="GEN 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 12:17" />Inzi Yawe waamulwalikile Farao pamo ni bantu ba mu nghanda yakue, pantu waamutweme Sarai muka Abramu kuti aye wali mukazi wakue. <verse eid="GEN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 12:18" />Farao waamukuutile Abramu ni kumwipuzia nangue, “Abramu, ni kiki kiwakinkitila? Ale wakinghaninaki nangue Sarai te mukazi obe? <verse eid="GEN 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 12:19" />Ale kabili wakilandilaki nangue Sarai ni nkaziizo? Wewe i wakilengia nene n'mutwame ni kumwalula mukazi wane. Ewe, mutwame mukazi obe uye waya.” <verse eid="GEN 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 12:20" />Farao wa-anine bantu bakue bamuseekezie Abramu ni mukazi wakue pamo ni bintu byonse bi-aali nabio.<verse eid="GEN 12:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="GEN 13" />
  <para style="s1">Abramu ni Loti balekenkana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 13:1" />Abramu ni mukazi wakue pamo ni byonse bi-aali nabio, baafumine ku Misri ni kuya ku Negebu. <verse eid="GEN 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 13:2" />Abramu waakilile kuba munonsi wa biteekua, ni wa mutofue pamo ni wa oro. <verse eid="GEN 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 13:3" />Waafumine ku Negebu mpaka waya kufika ku Beteli, palia paali waimikilenke liema lyakue pa bukata bwa Beteli ni Ai. <verse eid="GEN 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 13:4" />Papo i paali ni kitale ki-aakuulile pa mambo. Pa ezio nkendo Abramu i paali wamupupila Yawe.<verse eid="GEN 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 13:5" />Loti waile pamo ni Abramu, ni ye waali wakwete bisepe bya nghombe ni mikooko, kabili waali wakwete ni maema. <verse eid="GEN 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 13:6" />Inzi nkendo ya kulisiiziamo nama yabo yaamwenekele kukeepa, pantu baali bateekele nama ingi. Ni keki i kyaalengele tekuti bekale pamo. <verse eid="GEN 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 13:7" />Basungi ba biteekua byakua Abramu ni basungi ba biteekua byakua Loti baatendekele kukankabula. Ozo musita Bakanaani ni Baperizi, baali bakikeele sie mu kekio kyalo.<verse eid="GEN 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 13:8" />Abramu Waamwanine Loti, “Ewe, mona fwefue tuli benenke. Bantu bobe ni bantu bane, tebapalile kuya bakankabula. <verse eid="GEN 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 13:9" />Ni pakako, namona kuti tulekenkane. Saakula nkendo i utonene. Kine ulikuya lya kuso, nene ndikuya lya kulio, kine ulikuya lya kulio, nene ndikuya lya kuso.”<verse eid="GEN 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 13:10" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13.10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 2:10">Kut 2.10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Loti waakentele ni kumona lulambe lonse lwa Yordani, mpaka ku Zoari kwaali kwali menda engi nga bukaba bwakua Yawe, ao nga kyalo kya Misri. Pa ozo musita Yawe waali tanainoone mizi ya Sodoma ni Gomora. <verse eid="GEN 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 13:11" />Loti waasaakwile lulambe lonse lwa Yordani ni kuya lya ku kabanga. Evi i vibaalenkenkeene. <verse eid="GEN 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 13:12" />Abramu waikeele mu kyalo kya Kanaani. Loti wene waikeele pa bukata bwa mizi mu lulambe ni kwimika maema akue pepi ni Sodoma. <verse eid="GEN 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 13:13" />Inzi bantu ba mu Sodoma baali bali babi ni ba bibalo bingi ku menso akua Yawe.<verse eid="GEN 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abramu wakuukila ku Hebroni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 13:14" />Loti lu-aile, Yawe waamwanine Abramu nangue, “Kenta lya ku nkungua ni lya ku nkungulua, kabili kenta lya ku kabanga ni lya ku mboosi.” <verse eid="GEN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 13:15" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:5">Mii 7.5</ref></char></note>Yawe wamwanine Abramu nangue, “Keki kyalo kyonse kiwamona, naakakupeela wewe ni nvyalo yobe kuti kikabe kyenu lonse. <verse eid="GEN 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 13:16" />Naakakita nvyalo yobe kuba nga lufunko lwa pa kyalo, nvyalo isikavinda kupendua na muntu. Inzi kine muntu waakavinda kupenda lufunko lwa pa kyalo, ni vyalo yobe waakavinda kuipenda. <verse eid="GEN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 13:17" />Ale endo waya mu kuleepa ni mu kutana kwa kyalo pantu i kindikukupeela.” <verse eid="GEN 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 13:18" />Abramu waakuusiizie liema ni kuya kwikala pepi na bimuti bya Mamure ku Hebroni ni kukuulako kitale kyakua Yawe.<verse eid="GEN 13:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="GEN 14" />
  <para style="s1">Abramu wamupususia Loti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 14:1" />Amrafeli likolo wa ku Sinari, ni Arioki likolo wa ku Elasari, ni Kedori-Laomeri likolo wa ku Elamu, pamo ni Tidali likolo wa ku Goimu, <verse eid="GEN 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 14:2" />baile kulua na Bera likolo wa ku Sodoma, ni Birsa likolo wa ku Gomora, ni Sinabu likolo wa ku Adima, ni Semeberi likolo wa ku Zeboimu, pamo ni likolo wa ku Bela (i Zoari). <verse eid="GEN 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 14:3" />Azo makolo asaano pamo ni balukale babo baakolongheene mu lulambe lwa Sidimu. Pa ono musita i muli Lyezi lya Mukele. <verse eid="GEN 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 14:4" />Azo makolo aabombeele likolo Kedori-Laomeri myaka lyanondo ni ibili. Inzi mu mwaka wa lyanondo ni itatu, azo makolo aasangukile. <verse eid="GEN 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 14:5" />Mu mwaka wa lyanondo ni ina, Kedori-Laomeri ni makolo a-aunvwene nao pamo ni balukale babo, baumine Barifaimu mu Hasteroti-Karnaimu, ni Bazuzimu mu Hamu, ni Baemi mu Sawe-Kiriataimu, <verse eid="GEN 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 14:6" />ni Bahoriti ku lupili lwa Seiri. Baile babakumbile mpaka kubafikia ku Eli-Parani pepi ni kaseeba. <verse eid="GEN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 14:7" />Kabili baabweleele ku Eni-Misipati (kulikwakuutua Kadeshi), baumine kyalo kya Ba-amaleki, ni Ba-amori baali baikeele mu Hasasoni-Tamari.<verse eid="GEN 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 14:8" />Kabili likolo wa ku Sodoma, ni wa ku Gomora, ni wa ku Adima, ni wa ku Zeboimu, pamo ni wa ku Bela (i Zoari), baile kutantama mu lulambe lwa Sidimu pakuti balue nabo. <verse eid="GEN 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 14:9" />Kedori-Laomeri likolo wa ku Elamu, ni Tidali likolo wa ku Goimu, ni Amrafeli likolo wa ku Sinari, pamo ni Arioki likolo wa ku Elasari. Aza makolo ana aile kulua na makolo asaano. <verse eid="GEN 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 14:10" />Mu lolo lulambe lwa Sidimu mwaali mwali biina bingi bya kabulimbu. Likolo wa ku Sodoma ni wa ku Gomora lubaabutukile, baile kuponena mu biina. Inzi babo bange batatu baabutukiile ku mpili. <verse eid="GEN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 14:11" />Azo makolo ana aatweme bunonsi bonse bwa mu Sodoma ni mu Gomora pamo ni bilio ni kuya nabio. <verse eid="GEN 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 14:12" />Loti mwina mwalawakue kwa Abramu waali waikeele mu Sodoma, ni ye kumo waatwaminiinue pamo ni bintu byakue.<verse eid="GEN 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 14:13" />Kwaali muntu umo waabutukile ku bobo bului ni kuya kutwala mpunda kuli Abramu. Abramu waali Muebrania waali waikeele pepi na bimuti byakua Mamure Muamori wa kwakue kwa Eskoli, ni wa kwakue kwa Aneri. Baba i baali bamukwasia Abramu. <verse eid="GEN 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 14:14" />Abramu lu-aunvwile nangue mwana mwina mwalawakue akwetue, waakolonghaniizie balalume 318 ba mu nghanda yakue, bantu baali basambiliziiziwe bului. Baile babakonkele mpaka ku Dani. <verse eid="GEN 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 14:15" />Musita wa busiku, Abramu waabasalanghaniizie bantu bakue mu mabumba mabumba ni kuya kusakukila balwani babo. Waaboomine ni kubakumba mpaka ku Hoba, ku nkungua ya Damaski. <verse eid="GEN 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 14:16" />Ni pakako, waabweziizie bintu byonse, ni kumubwezia Loti mwina mwalawakue pamo ni bintu byakue byonse. Kabili waabweziizie banakazi pamo ni bange bantu.<verse eid="GEN 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Melkisedeki wamupaala Abramu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 14:17" />Abramu lu-aafumine ku kuuma balwani bakue, Kedori-Laomeri pamo ni ange makolo a-aunvwene nao, likolo wa ku Sodoma waile kusensekela Abramu mu lulambe lwa Sawe (ao Lulambe lwakua Likolo). <verse eid="GEN 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 14:18" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 7:1-10">Bae 7.1-10</ref></char></note>Ni Melkisedeki waali likolo wa ku Salemu, kabili waali kitambua wakua Leza Kabezia Mpungu, waatwele mukate ni divai kuli Abramu, <verse eid="GEN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 14:19" />ni kumupaala walimukulanda nangue, “Abramu apaalue na Leza Kabezia Mpungu, Kalenga wa lyulu ni kyalo! <verse eid="GEN 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 14:20" />Alumbue Leza Kabezia Mpungu waakupeele maka a kuuma balwani bobe!” Abramu ni ye waamupeele Melkisedeki kamo ka pa lyanondo ka pa bintu byonse.<verse eid="GEN 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 14:21" />Likolo wa ku Sodoma waamwanine Abramu, “N'mpeeleko sie bantu we usyale ni bobo bunonsi.”<verse eid="GEN 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 14:22" />Abramu wa-anine likolo wa ku Sodoma nangue, “Nene nalapa ntanzi yakua Yawe Leza Kabezia Mpungu, Kalenga wa lyulu ni kyalo <verse eid="GEN 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 14:23" />nangue, nene nsitwamapo kantu pa bintu byobe byonse, anzia kine ni nyunzi ao mukonda wa pa nkwabilo, evi tekuti ukalande nangue, ‘Nene i waamunonsiizie Abramu.’ <verse eid="GEN 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 14:24" />Inzi wewe lipako sie bilio byaaliile balukale ni kulipa bantu bankwasiizie: Aneri, ni Eskoli, pamo ni Mamure, evi baye nabio.”<verse eid="GEN 14:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="GEN 15" />
  <para style="s1">Leza wakita kipingo ni Abramu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 15:1" />Bebio byonse lubyaapitile, Yawe waamwanine Abramu mu kimonua nangue, “Tekutiina pantu nene ndi kisoolelo kyobe ni kilambu kyobe kikata.”<verse eid="GEN 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 15:2" />Abramu waipuziizie evi, “We Yawe Kabezia Mpungu, waakan'mpeelaki? Pantu nene nsili na mwana. Kubako Eliezeri wa ku Damaski i waakapyana bintu byane?” <verse eid="GEN 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 15:3" />Abramu waalandile evi, “Mona nene tewan'mpeele luvyalo. Kansi ozu mubombi wa mu nghanda yane i waakaba mupyani wa bintu byane!”<verse eid="GEN 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 15:4" />Yawe waamwanine Abramu nangue, “Ozu mubombi takaba mupyani wa bintu byobe, inzi mwana obe mwalalume wakwivyalila i waakaba mupyani wa bintu byobe!” <verse eid="GEN 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 15:5" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 4:18">Bar 4.18</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 11:12">Bae 11.12</ref></char></note>Yawe waamufumiiziizie Abramu panze ni kumwana nangue, “Ale kenta mu lyulu upende ntanda kine uli kuvinda kupenda.” Kabili wamwana nangue, “Evi nvyalo yobe i viyaakaba yavulile.”<verse eid="GEN 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 15:6" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15.6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 4:3">Bar 4.3</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 3:6">Bag 3.6</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 2:23">Yak 2.23</ref></char>
    </note>Abramu waamuketekeele Yawe. Ni pakako, Yawe waamumwene wali mulunghami.<verse eid="GEN 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 15:7" />Kabili waamwanine evi, “Mona nene ndi Yawe waakufumiizie mu Uri mu kyalo kya Bakaldayo ni kukupeela keki kyalo kuti kibe kyobe.”<verse eid="GEN 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 15:8" />Abramu waipuziizie evi, “We Yawe Kabezia Mpungu! Ale kuti namana syani nangue kyaakaba kyane?”<verse eid="GEN 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 15:9" />Yawe waamwasukile evi, “Ale n'mpeelepo nghombe musoka wa myaka itatu, ni mbuzi mukota wa myaka itatu, ni mpanga wa myaka itatu, ni kibondo kya nkunda pamo ni kya kipeele.” <verse eid="GEN 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 15:10" />Abramu waatweme nama, waibazula pa bukata, ni kubiika bibazu byakenteene. Inzi byoni byene taabibazwile. <verse eid="GEN 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 15:11" />Ni makubi lu-aakookeele pa bibazu bya nama, Abramu wa-akumbile.<verse eid="GEN 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 15:12" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15.12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 4:13">Yob 4.13</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 14">14</ref></char>
    </note>Koba lukaali kasyazimina, Abramu waonene tulo tukata, kabili waunvwile mwezo wa nfinzi ikata. <verse eid="GEN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 15:13" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 1:1-14">Kuf 1.1-14</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:6">Mii 7.6</ref></char></note>Yawe waamwanine evi, “Nvyalo yobe yaakaba yeni mu kyalo nghwana, kabili baakaba bazia ba bene kyalo, ni bo baakeemiwa na bene kyalo myaka 400. <verse eid="GEN 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 15:14" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:40-41">Kuf 12.40-41</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:7">Mii 7.7</ref></char></note>Naakakanda ntundu yaakabateeka buzia, ni pa kyamba, baakafuma batweme bunonsi bwingi. <verse eid="GEN 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 15:15" />Inzi wewe waakafua wali ni mutende. Kabili waakaziikua wali ni bukote buweme. <verse eid="GEN 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 15:16" />Ni luvyalo lwa buna lwaakabwelela pano pantu bubi bwa Ba-amori tebunaakumane.”<verse eid="GEN 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 15:17" />Koba lukaazimiine, paizile nfinzi ikata. Kyunsi kikata pamo ni libeebe lyaamwenekele lyalimukupita pa bukata bwa bibazu bya nama. <verse eid="GEN 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 15:18" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:5">Mii 7.5</ref></char></note>Bobo busiku Yawe waakitile kipingo ni Abramu ni kumwana nangue, “Napeela keki kyalo ku nvyalo yobe kutula ku lyezi lya ku Misri mpaka ku mwenzi ukata wa Efrati, <verse eid="GEN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 15:19" />pamo ni ku kyalo kya Bakeni, ni kya Bakenesi, ni kya Bakadmoni, <verse eid="GEN 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 15:20" />ni kya Bahiti, ni kya Baperizi, ni kya Barefaimu, <verse eid="GEN 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 15:21" />ni kya Ba-amori, ni Kya Bakanaani, ni kya Bagirgasi, pamo ni kya Bayebusi.”<verse eid="GEN 15:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="GEN 16" />
  <para style="s1">Hagari wavyala Isimaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 16:1" />Sarai muka Abramu waali wali nghumba. Inzi abanga wali ni mubombi umo mukazyana Mumisri liina lyakue Hagari. <verse eid="GEN 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 16:2" />Sarai waamwanine Abramu nangue, “Unvua, Yawe tan'mpeele luvyalo lwa kuvyala baana, kansi laala sie na ozu mubombi wane pantu pange waakanvyalila mwana.” Abramu waitabiile. <verse eid="GEN 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 16:3" />Sarai muka Abramu waabuulile mubombi wakue Hagari wa ku Misri ni kumupeela Abramu kuti aye wali mukazi mwanike. Bebi bintu byaakitikile Abramu lu-aali wasyaikeele myaka lyanondo mu Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 16:4" />Abramu waaleele na Hagari, ni ye waimita. Hagari lu-ainikile nangue waimita, Sarai waamwenekele wa mpuni kuli Hagari.<verse eid="GEN 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 16:5" />Sarai waamwanine Abramu, “Bubi bwane bube pali wewe. Nene naakupeele mubombi wane mu nkulo yobe. Inzi lu-akimona nangue waimita, wakin'mona wampuni. Yawe atupingule, nene ni wewe!”<verse eid="GEN 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 16:6" />Abramu ni ye waamwanine Sarai, “Mona mubombi obe ali mu minue yobe, mukitile muutoneene.” Sarai waamwemizie, ni ye mpaka wamubutuka.<verse eid="GEN 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 16:7" />Malaika wakua Yawe waamusangile Hagari mu kaseeba pa kasulo ka menda, kasulo kaali mumbali nzila yaali yaile ku Suri <verse eid="GEN 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 16:8" />ni kumwana nangue, “We Hagari mubombi wakua Sarai, ulimukufuma pi? Kabili ulimukuya pi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 16:8">Wene wa-asukile evi, “N'mbutukile yangulenzi Sarai.”<verse eid="GEN 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 16:9" />Malaika wakua Yawe waamwanine evi, “Bwela uye umunakile nokolenzi.” <verse eid="GEN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 16:10" />Kabili malaika wakua Yawe waamwanine evi, “Naakasandulula nvyalo yobe, ni yo teikapendeka kukonkana ni viyaakaba yavulile.” <verse eid="GEN 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 16:11" />Malaika wakua Yawe waamwanine evi, “Mona wewe wimisi, wakaba kuvyala mwana mwalalume, kabili wakaba kumwinika liina lyakue Isimaeli pantu Yawe wakyunvua malilo a maavia obe. <verse eid="GEN 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 16:12" />Ni ye waakaba nga punda wa mu kisonso pakati ka bantu. Waakaba mulwani wa bantu bonse, ni bantu bonse baakaba balwani bakue, ni bwikazi bwakue bwaakaba bwa bulwani ku lupwa lwakue lonse.”<verse eid="GEN 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 16:13" />Hagari waakuutile Liina lyakua Yawe u aalandile nakue. “Wewe uli Leza Aliwan'mona.” (Mu Kiebrania ni El-Roi) Pantu waalandile evi, “Na mumona aliwan'mona.” <verse eid="GEN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 16:14" />Ni pakako, keki kiina kya menda i kikilikyakuutilua Beer-Lahai-Roi,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16.14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Beer-lahai-roi </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">I kulanda nangue, “Kiina kya menda kyakua Mukose aliwan'mona”</char></note> ni kyo kili pa bukata bwa Kadesi ni Beredi.<verse eid="GEN 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 16:15" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16.15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GAL 4:22">Bag 4.22</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Hagari waamuvyaliile Abramu mwana mwalalume, Abramu waamwinikile Isimaeli olia mwana waavyelue na Hagari. <verse eid="GEN 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 16:16" />Abramu waali na myaka 86 lu-aavyaliilue Isimaeli na Hagari.<verse eid="GEN 16:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="GEN 17" />
  <para style="s1">Yando, kalangi ka kipingo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 17:1" />Abramu lu-aakumaniizie myaka 99, Yawe waamumonekeele ni kumwana nangue, “Nene ndi Leza wa Maka onse, enda ku ntanzi yane ni kuba wapwililikile. <verse eid="GEN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 17:2" />Ni ne naakakita kipingo kyane pakati kane ni wewe, kabili naakakila kusandulula nvyalo yobe.” <verse eid="GEN 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 17:3" />Kupwako, Abramu walaala kyuba, ni Leza waamwana nangue, <verse eid="GEN 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 17:4" />“Nene nakita kipingo ni wewe, ni we waakaba kikolue wa ntundu ingi. <verse eid="GEN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 17:5" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 4:17">Bar 4.17</ref></char></note>Teukikakuutua kabili Abramu, inzi waya wasyakuutua Abrahamu pantu nakukita kuba kikolue wa ntundu ingi. <verse eid="GEN 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 17:6" />Naakavuzia nvyalo yobe, naakakukita kuba ntundu, ni makolo aakafuma muli wewe.<verse eid="GEN 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 17:7" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17.7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 1:55">Lk 1.55</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Naakeemika kipingo pakati kane ni wewe, ni pakati ka nvyalo yobe ya ku ntanzi pamo ni nvyalo yabo kuti kikabe kipingo kya muyayaya. Pantu naakaba Leza obe, ni Leza wa luvyalo lobe lwa ku ntanzi. <verse eid="GEN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 17:8" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:5">Mii 7.5</ref></char></note>Keki kyalo kimwikeelemo mwali baeni, kyalo kyonse kya Kanaani, naakakupeela wewe pamo ni luvyalo lobe lwa ku ntanzi kuba bupyani bwa muyayaya, ni nene naakaba Leza wabo.”<verse eid="GEN 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 17:9" />Leza waamwanine Abrahamu, “Ni we ukasunge bwino kipingo kyane, wewe pamo ni luvyalo lobe lwa ku ntanzi pamo ni nvyalo yabo. <verse eid="GEN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 17:10" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:8">Mii 7.8</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 4:11">Bar 4.11</ref></char></note>Ni keki i kipingo kimwakaba kusunga pakati kenu, wewe ni luvyalo lobe lwa ku ntanzi. Kubalua mwalalume pakati kenu apalile kuteetua yando. <verse eid="GEN 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 17:11" />Mukabe mwateeta yando. Kaka i kaakaba kalangi ka kipingo pakati kane ni mwemue. <verse eid="GEN 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 17:12" />Mwana mwalalume wa nsiku mwanda pakati kenu apalile kuteetua yando, pamo ni olia avyelue mu nghanda yobe ao asitilue na nfolanga, ni kubalua mweni asili wa mu luvyalo lobe. <verse eid="GEN 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 17:13" />Olia avyelue mu nghanda yobe, ni asitilue na nfolanga yobe apalile kuteetua yando, kako i kalangi kaakaba ku mibili yenu, kalangi ka kipingo kyane kya muyayaya. <verse eid="GEN 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 17:14" />Ni mwalalume asiteetelue yando, waakafumiiwa pa ba kwakue pantu enoonene kipingo kyane.”<verse eid="GEN 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 17:15" />Leza waamwanine Abrahamu nangue, “Sarai mukazi obe teukiya wamukuuta Sarai, inzi waya wasyamukuutua Sara. <verse eid="GEN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 17:16" />Naakamupaala, kabili naakakupeela mwana kupitila muli wene. Naakamupaala, ni ye waakaba nghina wa ntundu, ni makolo a bantu aakafuma muli wene.”<verse eid="GEN 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 17:17" />Abrahamu waaponene kyuba, waasekele ni kulandila mu mutima nangue, “Ati emwe! Ni kiine muntu wasyali na myaka 100 kuti wavyala ni mwana? Ni Sara ozu asyali na myaka 90 kuti wavyala?” <verse eid="GEN 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 17:18" />Abrahamu waamwanine Leza nangue, “Kansi nga wamuleka Isimaeli apokelele bulayo bobe.”<verse eid="GEN 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 17:19" />Inzi Leza waamwanine evi, “Ata, mukazi obe Sara waakakuvyalila mwana mwalalume, ni wewe waakamwinika liina lyakue Izaaki. Naakeemika sinta kipingo kyane pali wene ni nvyalo yakue kuti kikabe kya muyayaya. <verse eid="GEN 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 17:20" />Ni palwakua Isimaeli, nakikunvua. Naakamupaala ni kumusandulula. Kabili naakakila kumuvuzia. Waakavyala bakulu lyanondo ni babili, kabili naakamukita kuba mutundu ukata. <verse eid="GEN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 17:21" />Inzi keki kipingo kyane naakakiimika sinta na Izaaki uwaakavyalilua na Sara pa musita nga ono ozu mwaka ulimukwiza.” <verse eid="GEN 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 17:22" />Kupwako, Leza walekela kulanda na Abrahamu, wamusia.<verse eid="GEN 17:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 17:23" />Bobo bwenka busiku, Abrahamu waamutweme Isimaeli pamo ni bonse baavyaliilue mu nghanda yakue, ni bonse baasitilue na nfolanga yakue, balalume bonse ba mu nghanda yakua Abrahamu, ni kuya kubateeta yando nga mwa-aniinue na Leza. <verse eid="GEN 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 17:24" />Abrahamu waateetelue yando wasyali na myaka 99. <verse eid="GEN 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 17:25" />Mwana wakue Isimaeli ni ye waateetelue yando wasyali na myaka 13. <verse eid="GEN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 17:26" />Bobo bwenka busiku Abrahamu ni Isimaeli mwana wakue baateetelue yando. <verse eid="GEN 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 17:27" />Bantu bonse ba mu nghanda yakue, pamo ni baavyaliilue mu nghanda yakue, ni baasitilue na nfolanga ku baeni, baateetelue yando pamo nakue busiku bumo.<verse eid="GEN 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="GEN 18" />
  <para style="s1">Bulayo bwa kuvyalua kwakua Izaaki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 18:1" />Kabili Yawe waamumonekeele Abrahamu lya ku bimuti bikata byakua Mamure lu-aali waikeele mu mulyango wa liema koba lukaali kazangukile. <verse eid="GEN 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 18:2" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 13:2">Bae 13.2</ref></char></note>Abrahamu waakentele ni kumona bantu batatu baimeene ku ntanzi yakue. Ni lu-aabamwene, waafumine lubilo mu mulyango wa liema ni kuya kusaakaana nabo. Kupwako, wafwinamina pansi <verse eid="GEN 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 18:3" />ni kulandapo na umo nangue, “We mulopue wane, kine kuti wangitabizia, nakulomba tekuti mupitilile pa mubombi wenu. <verse eid="GEN 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 18:4" />Pembelenke muleetelue menda aniini a kusamba ku makasa enu mane mutuuzie mwinsina kimuti, <verse eid="GEN 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 18:5" />n'mileetele ni ka kulia evi muteekieko mitima yenu, pa kyamba mane mulunduluke ni lwendo lwenu pantu mwaizanga kuli mubombi wenu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:5">Ni bo baalandile evi, “Ale kita muwalandila.”<verse eid="GEN 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 18:6" />Kupwako, Abrahamu waya lubilo lubilo mu liema ni kumwana Sara nangue, “Ewe, lenga uye uleete kilo 25 ya bunga buwamiisie ulenge ukite mikate.” <verse eid="GEN 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 18:7" />Kabili penka papo, wakundukila koko kwaali kisepe kya nghombe, watwamapo nghombe musoka enine ni kumutwala ku babombi balenge bamusinze. <verse eid="GEN 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 18:8" />Waabuulile mafuta ali afuma ku mabeele a nghombe, ni mabeele a kumina pamo ni bipusa byeleke, waya kubatwalila ku baali baikeele. Lubaali balimukulia, Abrahamu waali waimeene pambali mwinsina kimuti.<verse eid="GEN 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 18:9" />Baamwipuziizie Abrahamu, “Ewe, mukazi obe ali pi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:9">Wa-asukile nangue, “Ali mu liema.”<verse eid="GEN 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 18:10" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18.10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 9:9">Bar 9.9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yawe waalandile evi, “Kisinka nakaba kwiza kabili ozu mwaka waiza pa ono wenka musita, ni Sara mukazi obe wakaba kuvyala mwana mwalalume.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:10">Sara ni ye waali waimeene ku kyamba kyakue lya ku mulyango watwiliziizie. <verse eid="GEN 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 18:11" />Abrahamu ni Sara baali basyakilile kukota, ni musita wakuvyala waali wasyapitile. <verse eid="GEN 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 18:12" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 3:6">1 Pet 3.6</ref></char></note>Sara lu-aunvwile evio, waasekeele sie mu mutima walanda nangue, “Kubako nasyakotele evi kuti nawaminua kulaala ni mulume wane mukote?”<verse eid="GEN 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 18:13" />Yawe waamwipuziizie Abrahamu, “Sara, wasekelaki evi ni kulanda nangue, ‘Kubako evi kuti navyala ni mwana nasyakotele?’ <verse eid="GEN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 18:14" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1:37">Lk 1.37</ref></char></note>Eba, kuli ni kintu kili kya-anda kuli Yawe? Naakeeza kabili ozu mwaka waiza nga munalandilanga. Naakeeza kusanga mukazi obe Sara wavyele mwana mwalalume.”<verse eid="GEN 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 18:15" />Sara waakeene walanda nangue, “Nsisekele.” Pantu waali waunvwile mwezo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:15">Inzi Yawe waamwanine evi, “Wasekanga.”<verse eid="GEN 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abrahamu wapaapaatila Sodoma.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 18:16" />Balia bantu baafumine papo ni kulunghama lya ku Sodoma. Abrahamu waile kubaseekezia. <verse eid="GEN 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 18:17" />Yawe waalandile evi, “Nene nsivinda kumufiika Abrahamu bintu binghumiine kukita. <verse eid="GEN 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 18:18" />Pantu kulanda kisinka Abrahamu waakaba mutundu ukata waakaba walumine, ni muli wene ntundu yonse ya pa kyalo yaakapaaliluamo. <verse eid="GEN 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 18:19" />Pantu naamusaakwile kuti akabaane baana bakue pamo ni nghanda yakue pa kyamba kyakue kuti bakasunge nzila yakua Yawe, ni kukita nsambu pamo ni bupinguzi, pakuti Yawe ni ye akafikilizie bintu byonse bi-aamulaile Abrahamu.”<verse eid="GEN 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 18:20" />Yawe waalandile evi, “Pantu malilo a mu Sodoma ni mu Gomora akila, ni bibalo byabo byakila kuvula, <verse eid="GEN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 18:21" />ndikukookelako ngie n'mone kine kibalimukukita kipaleene ni malilo anakyunvua, kine te evio nakaba kumana.”<verse eid="GEN 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 18:22" />Babo bantu babili baafuminepo ni kuya lya ku Sodoma, inzi Abrahamu waali wakiimeene ni Yawe. <verse eid="GEN 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 18:23" />Abrahamu waamupaleeme walanda nangue, “Ati, ni kiine wakaba kulovia bonse mulunghami ni mubi? <verse eid="GEN 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 18:24" />Kine mu muzi muli balunghami 50, wakaba kulovia muzi onse? Teukaba kubeeleela pa mulandu wa babo balunghami 50? <verse eid="GEN 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 18:25" />Nakupaapaata tekuti uye wipailile mulunghami pamo ni mubi, evi mulunghami tekuti aye wali nga mubi. Tekuti ukabe kukita evio. Eba, Mupinguzi wa kyalo kyonse tavinda kupingula mu nsambu?”<verse eid="GEN 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 18:26" />Yawe wa-asukile evi, “Kine naya kusangamo balunghami 50 mu Sodoma, nakaba kweleela muzi onse pa mulandu wabo.”<verse eid="GEN 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 18:27" />Abrahamu waalandile evi, “Natwalilila kulanda na Mulopue ne ali sie lufunko, kabili nali mito. <verse eid="GEN 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 18:28" />Ale kine pabula basaano pa balia balunghami 50, wakaba kulovia muzi onse pantu papusa bantu basaano?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:28">Mulopue wa-asukile evi, “Kine naya kusangamo balunghami 45 nene nsikaba kulovia muzi.”<verse eid="GEN 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 18:29" />Kabili Abrahamu waipuziizie evi, “Ale kine bali sie 40?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:29">Waamwasukile, “Kine bakabe 40, nsikakita kantu pa mulandu wa baba bantu 40.”<verse eid="GEN 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 18:30" />Abrahamu waalandile evi, “We Mulopue, tekufiitua. Ntonene nandepo kabili. Ale kine bali sie balunghami 30?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:30">Waamwasukile, “Nsikakita kantu pa mulandu wa baba bantu 30.”<verse eid="GEN 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 18:31" />Abrahamu waalandile evi, “Natwalilila kulanda na Yawe, ale kine bali sie 20?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:31">Waamwasukile, “Kine bali 20 nene nsikaba kubalovia.”<verse eid="GEN 18:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 18:32" />Abrahamu waalandile evi, “We Yawe, napaapaata tekufiitua. N'mpeleeziepo sie limo. Ale kine bali sie lyanondo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:32">Waamwasukile, “Kine bali lyanondo nsikaba kubalovia.” <verse eid="GEN 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 18:33" />Yawe lu-aapwile kulanda na Abrahamu, Waile. Abrahamu ni ye waabwelele kwakue.<verse eid="GEN 18:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="GEN 19" />
  <para style="s1">Bubi bwa bantu ba mu Sodoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 19:1" />Bobo bwenka busiku kyungulo, balia bamalaika babili baafikile mu Sodoma. Loti waali waikeele pa mulyango wa muzi wa Sodoma. Lu-aabamwene, waile kubasensekela. Lu-aafikile pa baali, waaleele kyuba <verse eid="GEN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 19:2" />ni kubaana nangue, “Mwe balopue bane, namipaapaata twende mwingile mu nghanda yakua mubombi wenu, mulaale musambe ni ku makasa, mane lukeele lukeelekeele paakili mukatwalilile mu lwendo lwenu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 19:2">Ba-asukile evi, “Abe, fwefue tulikupunga sie pano penka panze.”<verse eid="GEN 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 19:3" />Inzi Loti waatwaliliile kubapaapaata mpaka bamwitabila ni kuya kwingila mu nghanda yakue. Loti waateaniizie matebeto, wabaapikila mikate isiliko ntutumusi. Ni bo balia.<verse eid="GEN 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 19:4" />Babo baeni lubaali tebanalaale, bantu ba mu Sodoma, balumendo ni bakote, baizile kuzyungulukila nghanda yaalimo baeni. <verse eid="GEN 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 19:5" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 19:22-24">Bap 19.22-24</ref></char></note>Baamwipuziizie Loti, “Balia baeni bawapokelanga keno kyungulo bali pi? Bafumiizie pano tupungule nabo.”<verse eid="GEN 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 19:6" />Loti waafumiine panze ni kusia waizalako. <verse eid="GEN 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 19:7" />Loti waabapaapaatile walanda nangue, “Mwe ba kwane, tekubakitile bintu bibiipile evio! <verse eid="GEN 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 19:8" />Unvue, ndi ni babinundue bane babili. Namipaapaata n'mbaleete kuli mwemue kuti mubakitile mumutoneene. Inzi tekuti mupungule na baeni, pantu basungilue bwino mu nghanda yane.”<verse eid="GEN 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 19:9" />Bene baalandile evi, “Wewe uli mweni mu ono muzi wetu! Eba, tewakeba kutupingula? Tupisie, kine wakaana, fwefue tulikukukitila kibiipile kukila baeni bobe.” Baamutintiile ku mulyango bakebele kupantula mulyango. <verse eid="GEN 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 19:10" />Inzi baeni bakua Loti baizwile mulyango, bamukulila Loti mukati ni kwizalako. <verse eid="GEN 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 19:11" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 6:18">2 Mak 6.18</ref></char></note>Babo bantu baali panze, bakulu ni banike, bauminue kafiifi na baeni bakua Loti mpaka ba-andua kumona mulyango.<verse eid="GEN 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Loti wafuma mu Sodoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 19:12" />Balia bantu babili baamwanine evi, Loti, “Kine mu ono muzi ulimo ni baana balalume ni baana banakazi, pamo ni bako bobe ao bantu ba kobe, baane bafumemo <verse eid="GEN 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 19:13" />pantu fwefue tulikwinoona ono muzi. Yawe wakyunvua malilo a ono muzi. Ni pakako, wakitwana kwiza kwinoona ono muzi.”<verse eid="GEN 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 19:14" />Loti waile kubaana balumendo baali basakile baana bakue nangue, “Lenge mufume mu ono muzi pantu Yawe alikwinoona ono Muzi.” Inzi bene baali baizi nangue alimukubasekia sie.<verse eid="GEN 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 19:15" />Lubwaali bwasyakia, bamalaika baamwanine evi, Loti, “Lenga ufumie mukazi obe ni baana bobe banakazi mukeeza kulobelela mu bubi bwa ono muzi.” <verse eid="GEN 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 19:16" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 2:7">2 Pet 2.7</ref></char></note>Loti lu-aali wasyatuubatuuba, bamalaika baamusakatiile ku kuboko kwakue ni kwa kwakua mukazi wakue pamo ni ku maboko a baana bakue banakazi babili pantu Yawe waamunvwiliile nkumbu. Baabafumiiziizie kunze ya muzi. <verse eid="GEN 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 19:17" />Kupwako, malaika umo wamwana nangue, “Butuka wipususie, tekwikebuka ao kwimana mu lulambe, butukila ku mpili ukeeza kuloba.”<verse eid="GEN 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 19:18" />Inzi Loti wa-asukile evi, “We mulopue, evio abe. <verse eid="GEN 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 19:19" />Mona, mubombi obe wamulanga buwame ni kumunvwila nkumbu mu kumupususia. Ni pakako, nsibutukila ku lupili nkakitikilua na kibiipile ni kufua. <verse eid="GEN 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 19:20" />Mona muzi uniini ozu uli papa pepi wa kubutukilamo. Eba, te uniini? Nakupaapaata ungitabizie, n'mbutukilemo, ngiipususie.”<verse eid="GEN 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 19:21" />Waamwasukile, “Ni makola, nakwitabizia nsikaba kwinoona ozo muzi. <verse eid="GEN 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 19:22" />Malaika waamwanine evi, Ale lenga ubutukilemo pantu nsivinda kukita kantu lu-usinafike ku ozo muzi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 19:22">Ni pakako, ozo muzi wainikilue Zoari. I kulanda nangue “kaniini.”<verse eid="GEN 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Muzi wa Sodoma ni Gomora wainoonua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 19:23" />Loti lu-aafikile ku Zoari, koba kaali kasyatulile. <verse eid="GEN 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 19:24" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:15">Mat 10.15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 11:23-24">11.23-24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:12">Lk 10.12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:29">17.29</ref>; <ref loc="2PE 2:6">2 Pet 2.6</ref>; <ref loc="JUD 1:7">Yud 7</ref></char></note>Kupwako, Yawe wanokia nvula ya mulilo mu muzi wa Sodoma ni wa Gomora, mulilo wa kibiliti kufuma mwiulu mwa Yawe. <verse eid="GEN 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 19:25" />Ni kulovia ezio mizi pamo ni lulambe lonse, ni bantu bonse baali balimo pamo ni byonse byaali byamenenemo. <verse eid="GEN 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 19:26" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 17:32">Lk 17.32</ref></char></note>Inzi muka Loti waali pa kyamba, waikebukile ni kwaluka lipumpu lya mukele.<verse eid="GEN 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 19:27" />Lukeele lwakue lukeelekeele, Abrahamu waile pa kifuka pa-aali waimeene ntanzi yakua Yawe. <verse eid="GEN 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 19:28" />Waakentele lya ku Sodoma ni lya ku Gomora ni mu lulambe lonse, waamwene kyunsi kyaafutumuka nga kyunsi kya mu kikuka kya mulilo. <verse eid="GEN 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 19:29" />Leza lu-ainoonene mizi ya mu lulambe yaali yaikeelemo Loti, Leza waalangulukile Abrahamu ni kumupususia Loti.<verse eid="GEN 19:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ntuntuko ya Bamoabu ni Ba-amoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 19:30" />Loti ni baana bakue banakazi babili baile kwikala ku mpili mu lisele pantu waatiinine kwikala mu Zoari. <verse eid="GEN 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 19:31" />Mwana mukulu waamwanine mwalawakue nangue, “Situe wakota, kabili kono kutuli tekuli mwalalume wakutuupa kukonkana ni mibeele ya pa kyalo. <verse eid="GEN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 19:32" />Kansi tumuminie situe divai, ni fwe tulaale nakue pakuti tumusungile situe luvyalo.” <verse eid="GEN 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 19:33" />Baamuminizie sibo divai bobo busiku, mwana mukulu waingiile ni kukumana nakue. Inzi Loti wene taamanine lwaaleele mwana ni lu-aabuukile.<verse eid="GEN 19:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 19:34" />Busiku bwaakonkelepo, mwana mukulu waamwanine mwalawakue, “Mona lukeele naakilaala ni tawe, kansi kabili tumuminie situe divai bono busiku, evi ni wewe uye ulaale nakue evi tusunge luvyalo lwakua situe.” <verse eid="GEN 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 19:35" />Baamuminiizie sibo divai, ni bobo busiku, mwana mwanike ni ye waile kulaala na se. Loti taamanine lwaleele mwana ni lu-aabuukile. <verse eid="GEN 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 19:36" />Evi i vyaimitile baana banakazi babili kuli sibo. <verse eid="GEN 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 19:37" />Mwana mukulu mwina Loti waavyele mwana mwalalume ni kumwinika Moabu. Ozo mwana i kikolue wa Bamoabu ni lenu kumo. <verse eid="GEN 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 19:38" />Mwana mwanike mwina Loti ni ye waavyele mwana mwalalume ni kumwinika Beni-Ami. Ozo mwana i kikolue wa Ba-amoni ni lenu kumo.<verse eid="GEN 19:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="GEN 20" />
  <para style="s1">Abimeleki wamutwama Sara kuti abe mukazi wakue</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 20:1" />Abrahamu waafumine papo ni kuya ku kyalo kya Negebu, waile kwikala pa bukata bwa Kadesi ni Suri. Pa kyamba waile kwendela mu Gerari. <verse eid="GEN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 20:2" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:13">Kut 12.13</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 26:7">26.7</ref></char></note>Abrahamu waalandile palua mukazi wakue Sara nangue, “Ozu ni nkazyamwine.” Abimeleki Likolo wa mu Gerari wa-anine bantu bamuleetele Sara. <verse eid="GEN 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 20:3" />Inzi Leza waamumonekeele Abimeleki busiku mu kilooto ni kumwana nangue, “Unvua, wafua wewe! Pantu watwamanga muka nghwana.”<verse eid="GEN 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 20:4" />Abimeleki ni ye waali tanapalamane nakue. Waamwanine evi, “Ati we Mulopue, ulikwipaya ntundu isili na mulandu? <verse eid="GEN 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 20:5" />Wene wakinghana nangue, Sara ni nkaziize. Mwanakazi ni ye wakinghana nangue, Abrahamu ni ndumeze. Nakikita evi na mutima waswetele.”<verse eid="GEN 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 20:6" />Leza waamwanine Abimeleki mu kilooto nangue, “Ee, n'manine nangue wewe wakikita evi na mutima waswetele, ni ne nakikukingilila tekuti ubale. Ni pakako, nsyakikulekeela kuti umukumie. <verse eid="GEN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 20:7" />Ale kansi mubwezie ozu mwanakazi ku mulume wakue Abrahamu, pantu Abrahamu ni kabika, ni ye alikukulombela pantu wene ni kabika, ni we uli kuba mukose. Inzi kine teumubweziizie, umane nangue kisinka wakaba kufua pamo ni bonse bauli nabo.”<verse eid="GEN 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abrahamu wabweziiziwa mukazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 20:8" />Abimeleki waabuukile paakili ni kukuuta babombi bakue bonse ni kubabwila milandu yonse. Ni babo bantu baatiinisie. <verse eid="GEN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 20:9" />Kupwako, Abimeleki wamukuuta Abrahamu ni kumwipuzia nangue, “Ewe, ni kiki kiwaakitukitila? Ati, nene nakikuluviaki pakuti uleete kibalo kikata pali nene ni pa bukolo bwane? Waakinkitila bintu bisipalile.” <verse eid="GEN 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 20:10" />Kabili Abimeleki waamwipuziizie Abrahamu nangue, “Ati, wakilengiwa naki pakuti ukite evi?”<verse eid="GEN 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 20:11" />Abrahamu wa-asukile evi, “Nene nakimona nangue, kisinka pano tepali muntu aliwatiina Leza, kuti bangipaya pa mulandu wa mukazi wane. <verse eid="GEN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 20:12" />Inzi kulanda kisinka ozu mwanakazi ni nkazyamwine pantu situe ni umo sie, inzi banghinetue i balekenkeene. Anzia kine kili evio, ozu ni mukazi wane. <verse eid="GEN 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 20:13" />Leza lu-aanghenziizie kufuma mu nghanda yakua tawe, naamwanine Sara nangue, ‘Konse kutwaakaba twaya ukabe wanandila biweme nangue nene ndi ndumezo.’”<verse eid="GEN 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 20:14" />Abimeleki waabuulile mikooko ni nghombe ndume pamo ni babombi balalume ni banakazi, wamupeela Abrahamu ni kumubweziizia mukazi. <verse eid="GEN 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 20:15" />Abimeleki waalandile evi, “Mona, keki kyalo kyonse kiumwene ni kyane, kuti waikala konse ku ulikutona.” <verse eid="GEN 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 20:16" />Kabili Abimeleki waamwanine Sara nangue, “Mona namupeela ndumezo nfolanga 1,000 kuti iye yali nfuto pa menso a bonse bauli nabo. Ni pakako, teuli na mulandu.”<verse eid="GEN 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 20:17" />Abrahamu waamulombele Leza, Leza wamukosia Abimeleki ni mukazi wakue pamo ni babombi bakue banakazi. Ni bo baavyele baana <verse eid="GEN 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 20:18" />pantu Yawe waali waimikile luvyalo lwa bantu ba mu nghanda yakua Abimeleki pa mulandu wakua Sara muka Abrahamu.<verse eid="GEN 20:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="GEN 21" />
  <para style="s1">Kuvyalua kwakua Izaaki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 21:1" />Yawe waizile kuli Sara nga mu-aalandiile. Yawe waamukitiile Sara nga mu-aalandiile. <verse eid="GEN 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 21:2" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:11">Bae 11.11</ref></char></note>Sara waimitile ni kumuvyalila Abrahamu mwana mwalalume wa mu bukote bwakue. Sara waavyele pa olia wenka musita waalandiilepo Leza. <verse eid="GEN 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 21:3" />Mwana waavyaliilue Abrahamu na Sara, Abrahamu waamwinikile liina lya Izaaki. <verse eid="GEN 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 21:4" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:12">Kut 17.12</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:8">Mii 7.8</ref></char></note>Izaaki lu-aakumaniizie nsiku mwanda, Abrahamu waamuteetele yando nga vya-aninue na Leza. <verse eid="GEN 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 21:5" />Izaaki lu-aavyelue, Abrahamu waali wasyali na myaka 100. <verse eid="GEN 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 21:6" />Sara waalandile evi, “Leza wane wanengia kuseka. Kubalua muntu wakaba kunvuako ezi mpunda, wakaba kuseka pamo nane.” <verse eid="GEN 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 21:7" />Kabili waatwaliliile kulanda nangue, “Emwe, nani waali wamanine nangue Abrahamu waakavyalilua baana na Sara! Inzi evi namuvyalila mwana mwalalume wa mu bukote bwakue.”<verse eid="GEN 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 21:8" />Mwana waakulile mpaka wasumunua. Busiku bwaasumwinue Izaaki, Abrahamu waakitile nsikunkulu ikata.<verse eid="GEN 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hagari pamo ni mwana wakue bakumbua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 21:9" />Sara waamwene mwana mwalalume mwina Hagari wa ku Misri waavyaliilue Abrahamu walimukumupunika mwana wakue Izaaki. <verse eid="GEN 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 21:10" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 4:29-30">Bag 4.29-30</ref></char></note>Sara waamwanine Abrahamu nangue, “Mukumbe ozu mwanakazi muzia pamo ni mwana wakue Isimaeli, pantu ozu mwana wakue takapyana pamo ni mwana wane Izaaki.” <verse eid="GEN 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 21:11" />Ozo mulandu waakilile kumubipila Abrahamu pantu Isimaeli ni ye waali mwana wakue. <verse eid="GEN 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 21:12" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 9:7">Bar 9.7</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 11:18">Bae 11.18</ref></char></note>Leza waamwanine Abrahamu, “Tekufiitua palwakua Isimaeli ni nghina Hagari, inzi konka sie twebo tonse twakwana Sara, pantu muli Izaaki i mwaakafuma nvyalo yobe. <verse eid="GEN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 21:13" />Mwana mwalalume mwina mwanakazi muzia naakamukita kuba mutundu ukata, pantu ni ye ni mwana obe.”<verse eid="GEN 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 21:14" />Lukeele lwakue paakili, Abrahamu waabuukile ni kumupailila Hagari bilio ni menda a kumina mu mbukulu ya mpapa ya nama, wamutwika pa nkombe, ni kumwana ailepo ni mwana wakue. Ozo mwanakazi waile wazeezooka sie mu kaseeba ka Beri-Seba. <verse eid="GEN 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 21:15" />Menda a kumina lu-aapwile mu mbukulu ya mpapa ya nama, waamulaalikile mwana wakue mwinsina kavuule <verse eid="GEN 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 21:16" />ni kuya kwikala pa nkendo imo paleepele mu pepi metre 100 ni kulanda nangue, “Nsitonene kumona kufua kwa mwana wane.” Hagari lu-aali waikeele papo, waatendekele kulila wa-angwile.<verse eid="GEN 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 21:17" />Mwana ni ye waali walimukulila. Leza lu-aunvwile kulila kwa mwana, malaika wakua Leza kufuma mu mulu waamukuutile Hagari ni kumwana nangue, “Ati Hagari, wasakamanapoki papa? Unvua, tekutiina pantu Leza waunvwanga kulila kwa mwana obe. <verse eid="GEN 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 21:18" />Ale endo ubuusie mwana umusungilile, pantu naakamukita kuba mutundu ukata.” <verse eid="GEN 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 21:19" />Leza waamwizwile Hagari menso, ni ye waamwene kiina kya menda. Kupwako, waya kwizuzia menda mu mbukulu ya mpapa ya nama ni kumunwinsia. <verse eid="GEN 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 21:20" />Leza waali wali pamo ni ozo mwana, ni ye waakulile. Waile kwikala mu kaseeba ni kwaluka mbwela wa nama mu kubombia buta ni mivui. <verse eid="GEN 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 21:21" />Lu-aali waikeele mu kaseeba ka Parani, nghina waamukebeele mukazi wa ku Misri.<verse eid="GEN 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abrahamu wakita kipingo ni Abimeleki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 21:22" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21.22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 26:26">Kut 26.26</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Pa ozo musita, Abimeleki ni Fikoli mukulu wa balukale bakue, baile kumwana Abrahamu nangue, “Leza obe ali pamo ni wewe mu bintu byonse bi-uliwakita. <verse eid="GEN 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 21:23" />Ale lapa mu kyeni kyakua Leza nangue teukikan'mbeepa ao kubeepa mwana wane, ao kubeepa mwinzikulu wane, inzi ukankitile biweme pamo ni keki kyalo kiwikeelemo nga evelia vinaakukitiile.”<verse eid="GEN 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 21:24" />Abrahamu waalandile evi, “Ee, ndikulapa.”<verse eid="GEN 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 21:25" />Kabili Abrahamu waamwanine Abimeleki nangue, “Nene nsiwamiinue pa mulandu wa kiina kya menda kyaapokelue na babombi bobe.” <verse eid="GEN 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 21:26" />Abimeleki waamwasukile evi, “Ewe, nene nsimanine muntu waakitile evio, ni we kumo tewan'mbwilileko, kabili nsinaunvuepo, ni evi vyenka lelo i kunvua.” <verse eid="GEN 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 21:27" />Kupwako, Abrahamu wabuula mikooko ni nghombe, wamupeela Abimeleki. Babo babili baakitile kipanghano. <verse eid="GEN 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 21:28" />Abrahamu waabuulile misoka kilooba ya mikooko ikota ni ku-ibiika pambali. <verse eid="GEN 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 21:29" />Abimeleki waamwipuziizie Abrahamu, “Ewe, ale ezi misoka kilooba ya mikooko ikota iwabiika pambali i kulanda syani?”<verse eid="GEN 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 21:30" />Abrahamu wa-asukile evi, “Ezi misoka ya mikooko ni ya kukupeela wewe, evi kiye kyali kisininkizizio kya kusininkizia nangue nene i mwine waimbile keki kiina kya menda.” <verse eid="GEN 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 21:31" />Ni pakako, pa ezio nkendo paakuutilue Beri-Seba i kulanda nangue, “Kiina kya menda kya kilooba ao kiina kya mulapo.” Pantu babo babili i pa baakitiile kipanghano.<verse eid="GEN 21:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 21:32" />Pa kyamba kya kwitabizyania ku Beri-Seba, Abimeleki ni Fikoli, mukulu wa balukale bakue, baabweleele ku kyalo kya Bafilistini. <verse eid="GEN 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 21:33" />Abrahamu waalimbilemo kamuti ka tamariski ni kukuutilapo Liina lyakua Yawe Leza wa muyayaya. <verse eid="GEN 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 21:34" />Abrahamu waikeele nsiku ingi mu kyalo kya Bafilistini wali mweni.<verse eid="GEN 21:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="GEN 22" />
  <para style="s1">Leza wamwezia Abrahamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 22:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22.1</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HEB 11:17-19">Bae 11.17-19</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Pa kyamba, Leza waamweziizie Abrahamu. Leza waamukuutile, Abrahamu, Abrahamu ni ye waiteebe, “Ne ono pano.”<verse eid="GEN 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 22:2" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22.2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 3:1">2 Mil 3.1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Leza waamwanine Abrahamu, “Ale twama mwana obe lyonga Izaaki, mwana u-utoneesie uye nakue mu kyalo kya Moria, uye umukite ngelelo ya kuzizia pa lupili lundikukulangilila.”<verse eid="GEN 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 22:3" />Abrahamu waabuukile paakili, waateania punda wakue, watwama babombi bakue babili pamo ni mwana wakue Izaaki, ni kutyaba nkuni ya ezio ngelelo ya kuzizia, watendeka lwendo waya mpaka kolia kwa-aninue na Leza. <verse eid="GEN 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 22:4" />Busiku bwa butatu, Abrahamu waamwene ku nkendo ku-aali walimukuya wakili kule. <verse eid="GEN 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 22:5" />Abrahamu waabaanine babombi bakue, “Syale pano ni ozu punda, nene ni ozu mulumendo tulikuya ku kupupa, pa kyamba mane tubwele.”<verse eid="GEN 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 22:6" />Kupwako, Abrahamu wamutwika mwana wakue Izaaki nkuni ya kuziziiziako ngelelo, ni ye watwamako mwele ni mulilo, bonse babili baya. <verse eid="GEN 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 22:7" />Izaaki waamukuutile se, “We tawe!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 22:7">Se wa-asukile evi, “We mwana wane, ne ono pano.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 22:7">Izaaki waamwipuziizie se, “Nkuni ni mulilo bebi. Ale musoka wa mukooko wakuti tukite ngelelo ya kuzizia ali pi?”<verse eid="GEN 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 22:8" />Abrahamu waamwasukile evi, “We mwana wane, Leza mwine alikwipeela musoka wa mukooko wa ngelelo ya kuzizia.” Kupwako, bonse babili batwalilila kuya.<verse eid="GEN 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 22:9" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22.9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JAS 2:21">Yak 2.21</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Lubaile kufika kolia ku-aalangilue na Leza, Abrahamu waakuulile kitale, ni kulongapo nkuni, wamukaka mwana wakue Izaaki ni kumubiika pa kitale peulu nkuni. <verse eid="GEN 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 22:10" />Kupwako, Abrahamu wabuula mwele kuti amusinze mwana wakue. <verse eid="GEN 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 22:11" />Inzi malaika wakua Yawe kufuma mu muulu waamukuutile, “Abrahamu, Abrahamu!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 22:11">Ni ye waitaba, “Ne ono pano.”<verse eid="GEN 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 22:12" />Malaika wamwana nangue, “Tekumukitila kintu kibiipile ao kumwipaya mwana obe. Evi nainika nangue ni kiine wewe umukindikile Leza, kabili umunakiile pantu tewakikaana kwelela mwana obe lyonga.”<verse eid="GEN 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 22:13" />Abrahamu lu-aikebukile, waamwene mpanga wakobelue na binkobankoba ku masengo akue. Waile kumukwata ni kwiza kumupyanika pa mwana wakue kuti aye wali ngelelo ya kuzizia. <verse eid="GEN 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 22:14" />Pa kekio kifuka Abrahamu wainikilepo liina lya “Yawe-Yire.” <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">22.14</char> <char style="fq">Yawe-Yire</char>i kulanda nangue Leza alikwipeela<char style="ft" closed="false">; Ao</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Aliwamona.</char></note> Ni pakako, i kikilikyalandilua nangue, “Pa lupili lwakua Yawe i payaakamoneka.”<verse eid="GEN 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 22:15" />Malaika wakua Yawe kufuma mu muulu waamukuutile Abrahamu lya bubili. <verse eid="GEN 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 22:16" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 6:13-14">Bae 6.13-14</ref></char></note>Ni kumwana nangue, “Yawe walanda nangue nalapa mu Liina lyane ne mwine nangue naakakupaala pantu tewakikaana kungelela mwana obe lyonga. <verse eid="GEN 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 22:17" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:12">Bae 11.12</ref></char></note>Kisinka naakakupaala, ni kusandulula nvyalo yobe, evi ikabe ingi nga ntanda ya mu lyulu, kabili nga musenga wa mumbali lyezi. Nvyalo yobe yaakanzia balwani babo. <verse eid="GEN 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 22:18" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 3:25">Mii 3.25</ref></char></note>Kupitila mu nvyalo yobe, ntundu yonse ya pa kyalo yaakapaalua pantu waanakiile mwano wane.” <verse eid="GEN 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 22:19" />Kupwako, Abrahamu wabwelelamo ku babombi bakue. Wabatwama ni kuya nabo ku Beri-Seba. Abrahamu waikeele koko ku Beri-Seba.<verse eid="GEN 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nvyalo yakua Nahori</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 22:20" />Pa kyamba kya bebi byonse, Abrahamu waaleeteelue mpunda nangue, “Milka wakimuvyalila mwaobe Nahori baana.” <verse eid="GEN 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 22:21" />Libeli wakue waali wakuutua Uzi, wa bubili waali wakuutua Buzi, waakonkelepo waali wakuutua Kemueli ozo waavyele Ba-aramu, <verse eid="GEN 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 22:22" />ni Kesedi, ni Hazo, ni Pildasi, ni Idilafu, pamo ni Betueli. <verse eid="GEN 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 22:23" />Betueli i waavyele Rebeka. Milka waamuvyaliile Nahori mwalawakue kwa Abrahamu baana balalume mwanda, <verse eid="GEN 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 22:24" />ni Reuma mukazi wa bubili waavyele Teba, ni Gahama, ni Tahasi, pamo ni Maaka.<verse eid="GEN 22:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="GEN 23" />
  <para style="s1">Kufua ni kuziikua kwakua Sara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 23:1" />Sara waikeele pa kyalo myaka 127 <verse eid="GEN 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 23:2" />Sara waafwiliile ku Kiriati-Arba (i kulanda nangue Hebroni) mu kyalo kya Kanaani, ni Abrahamu waile paali mubili wakua Sara walimukulila ni kuloosia.<verse eid="GEN 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 23:3" />Abrahamu waafumine paali pabiikilue mubili wakua mukazi wakue, waya kubaana baana bakua Heti nangue, <verse eid="GEN 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 23:4" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:9">Bae 11.9</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 13">13</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:16">Mii 7.16</ref></char></note>“Nene kono ndi mweni ni mulendo pakati kenu, n'mpeeleko nkendo imulimwaziikapo, ni ne nziikepo mukazi wane evi aye wali kule ni nene.”<verse eid="GEN 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 23:5" />Bahiti baamwasukile Abrahamu. <verse eid="GEN 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 23:6" />“We mwinzio, unvua! Wewe uli mulombozi mukulu pakati ketu, tepali muntu alikukaana kukupeela kilibu kya kuziikamo mukazi obe. We muziike sie mu kilibu ki-ulikusaakulapo.”<verse eid="GEN 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 23:7" />Kupwako, Abrahamu wafwinamina bekala kyalo ni baana bakua Heti <verse eid="GEN 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 23:8" />ni kubaana nangue, “Mwe bamwinzio, kine mwangitabila kuziika mukazi wane kono, namilomba mumwane Efuroni mwana mwalalume mwina Zohari <verse eid="GEN 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 23:9" />ansisie lisele lya ku Makipela lili ku nkingo ya bukaba bwakue. Mumwane alande mutengo wa bolia bukaba pa menso enu, evi ikabe nkendo yane ya kuziikamo.”<verse eid="GEN 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 23:10" />Efuroni Muhiti waali waikeele pa bukata bwa baana bakua Heti, waamwasukile Abrahamu ntanzi ya baana bakua Heti pamo ni bonse baali baingila mu ozo muzi nangue, <verse eid="GEN 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 23:11" />“We mwinzio, unvua, nene nakupeela bukaba bonse pamo ni lisele lilimo, nakupeela bebi byonse pa menso a bantu bane. Ziikamo mukazi obe.”<verse eid="GEN 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 23:12" />Abrahamu waakontamiine ku bekala kyalo <verse eid="GEN 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 23:13" />ni kumwana Efuroni pa menso a bekala kyalo walanda nangue, “Inzi kine watona, nakulomba untwilizie. Ndikukusita bukaba. Ale twama nfolanga, ni ne ndikuziikamo mukazi wane.”<verse eid="GEN 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 23:14" />Efuroni waamwasukile Abrahamu nangue, <verse eid="GEN 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 23:15" />“We mwinzio, unvua, bobu bukaba kine bwasitua na shekeli 400, kuti byatukitaki nene ni wewe? Ni pakako, ziika sie mukazi obe.” <verse eid="GEN 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 23:16" />Abrahamu waamwitabiizie Efuroni, Abrahamu waamupendeele Efuroni nfolanga i-aalandile ntanzi ya baana bakua Heti shekeli 400 ya mutofue mu kipendo kya basulu.<verse eid="GEN 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 23:17" />Bukaba bwakua Efuroni bwa ku Makipela bwaali bwali lya ku kabanga ka Mamure, ni bimuti byonse, ni lisele, byaamanikile kuba <verse eid="GEN 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 23:18" />byakua Abrahamu ntanzi ya baana bakua Heti ni ntanzi ya bonse baali baingila pa mulyango wa muzi wakue.<verse eid="GEN 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 23:19" />Pa kyamba, Abrahamu waamuziikile mukazi wakue Sara mu lisele lya mu bukaba bwa ku Makipela bwaali bwali lya ku kabanga ka Mamure, (i kulanda nangue Hebroni) mu kyalo kya Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 23:20" />Bukaba ni lisele lyaalimo byaamaniiziwe na baana bakua Heti kuba byakua Abrahamu, kuti biye byaali bunonsi bwakue ni nkendo ya kuziikamo.<verse eid="GEN 23:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="GEN 24" />
  <para style="s1">Abrahamu wasaakula muntu wa kuya kukeba wa kuupua na Izaaki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 24:1" />Abrahamu waali wasyali mukote wa nsiku ingi, Yawe waali wamupaalile Abrahamu mu byonse. <verse eid="GEN 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 24:2" />Abrahamu waamwanine mubombi wakue mukulu wa mu Nghanda yakue, waali mukulu pa byonse bi-aali nabio nangue, “Biika kuboko kobe kwinsina litanta lyane. <verse eid="GEN 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 24:3" />Ndikukulapia kuli Yawe Leza wa mwiulu ni wa pa kyalo nangue, tekuti ukasaakwile mwana wane mukazi pa babinundue ba Bakanaani bangikeele nabo. <verse eid="GEN 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 24:4" />Inzi ukabe kuya ku kyalo kyane ni ku lupua lwane, umusaakwile mwana wane Izaaki mukazi.”<verse eid="GEN 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 24:5" />Mubombi waipuziizie evi, “Ale kine ozo mukazyana wakaana kwiza mu keno kyalo naakakita syani? Kuti namutwala mwana obe ku kyalo ku waafumine?”<verse eid="GEN 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 24:6" />Abrahamu waalandile evi, “Kengela, tekukeezia kubwezia mwana wane ku kyalo kunaafumine. <verse eid="GEN 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 24:7" />Yawe Leza wa mwiulu wanfumiizie mu nghanda yakua tawe ni mu kyalo kinaavyaliiluemo, ozo wandaile ni kulapa nangue waakapeela keki kyalo ku nvyalo yane, waakatangizia malaika ku ntanzi yobe kuti ukamusaakwila mwana wane mukazi wakue. <verse eid="GEN 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 24:8" />Kine ozo mukazyana wakaana kwiza pamo nobe, teukaba na mulandu pa keki kilapo. Inzi tekukeezia kubwezia mwana wane ku kelia kyalo.” <verse eid="GEN 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 24:9" />Kupwako, mubombi wabiika kuboko kwakue kwinsina litanta lyakua Abrahamu selenzi ni kulapa palua ozu mulandu.<verse eid="GEN 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 24:10" />Mubombi waatweme nghamia lyanondo yakua selenzi, watwama ni bintu biweme waya nabio lya ku Aramu-Naharaimu, ku muzi kwaali kwaikeele Nahori. <verse eid="GEN 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 24:11" />Lu-aafikile, waafukamikile nghamia lya ku kiina kya menda kyaali kumbali muzi. Ozo, waali musita wa kyungulo waali wailapo banakazi ku kutapa menda. <verse eid="GEN 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 24:12" />Waalombele evi, “We Yawe Leza wakua tawelenzi Abrahamu, nakulomba lelo un'mpaale ni kumulangisia tawelenzi buwame. <verse eid="GEN 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 24:13" />Mona ndi pano pa kiina kya menda palipaiza kutapa menda bakazyana bena bantu ba mu muzi. <verse eid="GEN 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 24:14" />Mukazyana undikwana atuule katondo kakue ka menda ni kumulomba n'minemo, alande nangue, ‘Mina, kabili ndikunwinsia ni nghamia yobe,’ ozo i wakuti uye wasaakwiliile mubombi obe Izaaki. Keki i kindikwinikilako nangue wamukitila tawelenzi buwame.”<verse eid="GEN 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 24:15" />Lu-aali tanapwililile kulanda, Rebeka mwina Betueli waizile watweme katondo ka menda pa nkombe. Ozo Betueli waali mwina Nahori mwalawakue kwa Abrahamu. Nahori waali waupile Milka. <verse eid="GEN 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 24:16" />Rebeka waali ni lukebu lwakilile kuwama, kabili waali wakili kinundue. Waakookeele ku kutapa menda, waizuzia katondo ni kusela. <verse eid="GEN 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 24:17" />Olia mubombi waile lubilo kumusensekela ni kumwana nangue, “Nakupaapaata un'mpeeleko menda aniini a mu katondo kobe n'mine.”<verse eid="GEN 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 24:18" />Waalandile evi, “We mwinzio, menda aza umine.” Penka papo watuula kale katondo ka-aali watweme pa nkombe ni kumupeela. <verse eid="GEN 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 24:19" />Lu-aapwile kumina, mukazyana waalandile evi, “Ndikuya kutapa ni ange menda a kunwinsia nghamia mpaka pailikupwila kumina.” <verse eid="GEN 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 24:20" />Penka papo wapongwela kale menda mu kiina kya kumininamo nama ni kuya lubilo ku kutapa ange, watapila nghamia yakue yonse. <verse eid="GEN 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 24:21" />Ozo mubombi mukulu waamutonokeele wataleele amone kine Yawe wakipaala lwendo lwakue ao abe.<verse eid="GEN 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 24:22" />Nghamia luyaapwile kumina, ozo mubombi waabuulile kazele ka oro kaali kafinine shekeli mutanda ni bikano bya oro bibili bya ku maboko byaali byafinine shekeli 120. <verse eid="GEN 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 24:23" />Ozo mubombi mukulu waamwanine evi, “Nakulomba unghane, wewe uli mwina ni? Ku nghanda yakua so kuli ni nkendo kwa kulaala busiku?”<verse eid="GEN 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 24:24" />Rebeka waamwanine evi, “Nene ndi mwina Betueli waavyelue na Milka muka Nahori.” <verse eid="GEN 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 24:25" />Kabili waamwanine evi, “Tukwete bikusi bingi pamo ni binge bilio, ni nkendo ya kulaalako.”<verse eid="GEN 24:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 24:26" />Ozo mubombi mukulu waafukeeme ni kumupupa Yawe. <verse eid="GEN 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 24:27" />Waalandile evi, “Yawe Leza wakua tawelenzi Abrahamu atasiiwe, pantu bukisinka ni bulayo bwakue bitwaliliile pali tawelenzi. Yawe wakinombola mu nzila mpaka ku nghanda ya balupua bakua tawelenzi.”<verse eid="GEN 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 24:28" />Rebeka waile lubilo ku nghanda yakua nghina ni kubabwila lyasi lyonse. <verse eid="GEN 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 24:29" />Labani ndumeze kwa Rebeka lu-aunvwile, waile lubilo ku ozo mubombi ku kiina kya menda. <verse eid="GEN 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 24:30" />Labani lu-aamwene kazele ni bikano byaali byavwele nkaziize Rebeka, ni kunvua vi-aalandile, waile lubilo kuli mubombi waali waimeene pepi ni nghamia ku kiina kya menda. <verse eid="GEN 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 24:31" />Labani waamwanine evi, “Twende ku nghanda we apaalilue na Yawe. Ale wimaniineki kono? Pantu nene nateanianga nghanda ni nkendo ya nghamia.”<verse eid="GEN 24:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 24:32" />Mubombi mukulu ni ye waingiile mu nghanda, ni Labani wakakula bitwamo pa nghamia, wapeela nghamia bikusi ni binge bilio, kabili waamuleeteele ozo muntu menda a kusamba ku makasa, wene, pamo ni bantu bakue. <verse eid="GEN 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 24:33" />Bilio lubyaaleetelue, mubombi wakua Abrahamu waalandile evi, “Nene nsilia kale kine nsinalandenke ka nghendeele.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:33">Labani waamwanine evi, “Ale landa.”<verse eid="GEN 24:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 24:34" />Waalandile evi, “Nene ndi mubombi mukulu wakua Abrahamu.” <verse eid="GEN 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 24:35" />Yawe waakilile kumupaala tawelenzi, ni ye wakyaluka mukindami. Waamupeele mikooko ni nghombe, ni nfolanga, ni oro, ni babombi balalume ni banakazi, ni nghamia pamo ni punda. <verse eid="GEN 24:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 24:36" />Sara muka tawelenzi Abrahamu lu-aali wasyali mukote, waamuvyaliile Abrahamu mwana mwalalume wa mu bukote bwakue. Se waamupeele bintu byonse bi-aali nabio. <verse eid="GEN 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 24:37" />Tawelenzi wandapiizie walanda nangue, “Tekuti ukasaakwile mwana wane mukazi pa bakazyana ba Bakanaani ba mu kyalo kingikeelemo. <verse eid="GEN 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 24:38" />Inzi ukaye ku nghanda yakua tawe ni ku lupua lwane, ukaye kumusaakwila mwana wane mukazi wakue.” <verse eid="GEN 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 24:39" />Naamwipuziizie tawelenzi, “Ale kine mukazyana wakaana kwiza kono?” <verse eid="GEN 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 24:40" />Wangasukule, “Yawe undinanakila i waakatangizia malaika wakue ku waakaya, ni ye waakapaala nzila yobe, ni we waakasaakwila mwana wane mukazi wa mu lupua lwane ni wa mu nghanda yakua tawe. <verse eid="GEN 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 24:41" />Inzi paukaya kwana bantu bane, kine bakakaane kukupeela mukazyana, kupwako, wewe teukaba na mulandu.<verse eid="GEN 24:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 24:42" />“Lunafikanga ku kiina kya menda, nalombanga Yawe Leza wakua tawelenzi Abrahamu, namupaapaata ankwasie mu keki kindimukukita. <verse eid="GEN 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 24:43" />Mona ndi pano pa kiina kya menda. Kansi mukazyana alikwiza ku kutapa menda, ni undikulomba menda aniini a kumina mu katondo kakue, <verse eid="GEN 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 24:44" />kine waitabila kun'mpeela ni kunwinsia nghamia yane, i wakuti uye wasaakwile kuya wali muka mwana wakua tawelenzi. <verse eid="GEN 24:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 24:45" />Lunaba nasyapwililila mapepo ane a mukansongia, Rebeka wakookelanga ku kiina ku kutapa menda watweme katondo pa nkombe. Namwananga mukazyana, napaapaata kuti an'mpeeleko menda a kumina. <verse eid="GEN 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 24:46" />Penka papo watuula kale katondo ka menda, walanda nangue, ‘Poka umine, kabili ndikunwinsia ni nghamia yobe.’ Nene naminanga, kabili wanwisyanga ni nghamia yane. <verse eid="GEN 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 24:47" />Namwipuzyanga evi, ‘So nani?’ Wangasukanga nangue, ‘Tawe ni Betueli waavyelue na Milka muka Nahori.’ Kupwako, nabuula kazele namuvwika ku moona ni bikomo namuvwika ku maboko. <verse eid="GEN 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 24:48" />Namufukaminanga Yawe ni kumupupa. Namutasyanga Leza wakua tawelenzi Abrahamu wakinombola mu nzila iweme kwiza ku bantu bakua tawelenzi, kono kunaiza kusanga mwana mukazyana mwina wa kwakue kwa tawelenzi wa kuupua na mwina tawelenzi. <verse eid="GEN 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 24:49" />Kansi kine mulikwitabila ni kukita mwanghaniine tawelenzi, nghane. Kabili kine mulikukaana, nghane n'mane kwa kulunghama, kine ni kulio ao kuso.”<verse eid="GEN 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 24:50" />Labani ni Betueli ba-asukile, “Fwefue tetuli na kakulandapo pantu ozu mulandu ufumine kuli Yawe. <verse eid="GEN 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 24:51" />Rebeka ozu, mutwame aye oopue na mwina solenzi nga mwakilandila Yawe.” <verse eid="GEN 24:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 24:52" />Mubombi mukulu wakua Abrahamu lu-aunvwile evio, waakonteeme pansi ni kumupupa Yawe. <verse eid="GEN 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 24:53" />Ozo mubombi mukulu waafumiizie tuzele twa mutofue ni twa oro pamo ni ngubo, wamupeela Rebeka. Kabili waafumiizie byabupe bya mponvu ni kubapeela ba kwakue kwa mukazyana pamo ni nghina.<verse eid="GEN 24:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 24:54" />Mubombi mukulu wakua Abrahamu pamo ni bantu baizile nakue baaliile ni kumina, ni kulaala koko kwenka. Lubwaakiile, baabuukile. Mubombi mukulu wakua Abrahamu waalandile evi, “Emwe, n'mpeele nsambu ya kuti n'mbwelelemo kuli tawelenzi.”<verse eid="GEN 24:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 24:55" />Labani pamo ni nghina kwa Rebeka baalandile evi, “Ata, mulekenke twikale nakue mulungu umo ao nsiku lyanondo, mane akabe kuya.”<verse eid="GEN 24:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="GEN 24:56" />Inzi wene waalandile evi, “Emwe, tekunkaanie pantu Yawe wakin'mpaala mu lwendo lwane, kansi ndeke n'mbwelelemo kuli tawelenzi.”<verse eid="GEN 24:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="GEN 24:57" />Baalandile evi, “Kansi tumukuute mukazyana tumwipuzie tunvue vi-alikulanda.” <verse eid="GEN 24:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="GEN 24:58" />Kupwako, bamukuuta Rebeka, bamwipuzia nangue, “Ati, utonene kuya pamo ni mubombi wakua Abrahamu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:58">Wa-asukile nangue, “Ee, ndikuya nakue.”<verse eid="GEN 24:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="GEN 24:59" />Kupwako, bamupeela nsambu Rebeka kuti aye pamo ni mwanakazi wa mu nghanda waali wamusunga. Babo bonse babili baile pamo ni mubombi mukulu wakua Abrahamu pamo ni bantu baali baizile na mubombi mukulu wakua Abrahamu. <verse eid="GEN 24:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="GEN 24:60" />Baamupaalile Rebeka bamwana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 24:60">“We mukwetu, ube nghina wa nvyalo ingi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 24:60">Nvyalo yobe ikaanzie balwani babo!”<verse eid="GEN 24:60" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="GEN 24:61" />Rebeka pamo ni babombi bakue bakazyana baiteaniizie, basela pa nghamia ni kuya na mubombi mukulu wakua Abrahamu pamo ni bantu ba-aali nabo.<verse eid="GEN 24:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="GEN 24:62" />Izaaki waile mu nzila ya ku Beri-Lahai-Roi (i kulanda nangue, Kiina kya menda kyakua Mukose aliwan'mona), pantu waali waikeele ku Negebu. <verse eid="GEN 24:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="GEN 24:63" />Musita wa kyungulo Izaaki waile ku makaba ku kulangakana. Waakentele lwa kule ni kumona nghamia yalimukwiza. <verse eid="GEN 24:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="GEN 24:64" />Rebeka ni ye lu-aakentele lwa kule ni kumumona Izaaki, waakookele pa nghamia <verse eid="GEN 24:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="GEN 24:65" />ni kumwipuzia mubombi mukulu wakua Abrahamu, “Ale olia muntu alimukwenda mu bukaba waiza kutusensekela nani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:65">“Olia i tawelenzi Izaaki.” Kupwako, wabuula kiteebo ni kwikupilila pa menso.<verse eid="GEN 24:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="GEN 24:66" />Mubombi mukulu wakua Abrahamu waamwanine Izaaki bintu byonse bi-aakitile. <verse eid="GEN 24:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="GEN 24:67" />Izaaki waamwingiziizie Rebeka mu liema mwaali mwaikala nghina Sara. Kupwako, Rebeka wa-aluka mukazi wakue. Izaaki waamutonene Rebeka. Waakoseleziiziwe na kubapo kwakua Rebeka pantu nghina waali wasyafwile.<verse eid="GEN 24:67" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="GEN 25" />
  <para style="s1">Abrahamu waupa Ketura</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 1:32-33">1 Milandu Ya Nsiku 1.32-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 25:1" />Abrahamu waupile unge mwanakazi liina lyakue Ketura. <verse eid="GEN 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 25:2" />Baana baavyaliilue Abrahamu na Ketura meena abo ni aza: Simurani, ni Yokisani, ni Medani, ni Midiani, ni Isibaki pamo ni Sua. <verse eid="GEN 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 25:3" />Yokisani waavyele Seba ni Dedani. Dedani waavyele Asuri ni Letusi pamo ni Lumi. <verse eid="GEN 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 25:4" />Midani waavyele Efa, ni Eferi, ni Hanoki, ni Abida pamo ni Elda. Babo bonse i ba mu luvyalo lwakua Ketura.<verse eid="GEN 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 25:5" />Abrahamu waamupeele Izaaki bintu byonse bi-aali nabio. <verse eid="GEN 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 25:6" />Abrahamu lu-aali wakikosele, waabuulile byabupe ni kupeela baana bakue ba-aavyele mu bakazi banike. Babo baana waabaanine baye bekale ku kyalo kya ku kabanga, kule ni kwaali kwaikeele Izaaki.<verse eid="GEN 25:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abrahamu wafua ni kuziikua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 25:7" />Myaka yaikeele Abrahamu yaali 175. <verse eid="GEN 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 25:8" />Abrahamu waafwile wa wamiinue mu bukote bwakue ni kuya kwikala pamo ni babikolue bakue baamutangiliile. <verse eid="GEN 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 25:9" />Baana bakue, Izaaki ni Isimaeli, baamuziikile mu lisele lya ku Makipela, mu bukaba bwaali bwakua Efuroni mwina Zohari Muhiti, bukaba bwaali lya ku kabanga ka Mamure, <verse eid="GEN 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 25:10" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25.10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 23:3-16">Kut 23.3-16</ref></char></note>Bobo bukaba bwaasitilue na Abrahamu ku baana bena Heti. Mu bobo bukaba i mwaaziikilue Abrahamu ni mukazi wakue Sara. <verse eid="GEN 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 25:11" />Pa kyamba kya kufua kwakua Abrahamu, Leza waamupaalile Izaaki. Izaaki waakuukiile pa kifuka kyaali kyakuutua Beri-Lahai-Roi. Beri-Lahai-Roi i kulanda nangue kiina kya menda kyakua Mukose aliwan'mona.<verse eid="GEN 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nvyalo yakua Isimaeli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 1:28-31">1 Milandu Ya Nsiku 1.28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 25:12" />Nvyalo yakua Isimaeli mwina Abrahamu, mwana mwalalume u aavyaliilue na Hagari wa ku Misri, muzia wakua Sara, <verse eid="GEN 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 25:13" />meena abo ni aza mwaali mwabeleele nvyalo: Libeli wakue waali wakuutua Nebayoti. Balabakue ni bo meena abo ni aza: Kedari, ni Adibeli, ni Mibusani, <verse eid="GEN 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 25:14" />ni Misime, ni Duma, ni Masa, <verse eid="GEN 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 25:15" />ni Hadadi, ni Tema, ni Yeturi, ni Nafisi, pamo ni Kedema. <verse eid="GEN 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 25:16" />Babo i baali babikolue ba ntundu lyanondo ni ibili, ni mizi yabo yaali yakuutua azo enka meena, ni ku tutanda ni ko azo enka meena abo. <verse eid="GEN 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 25:17" />Myaka yaikeele Isimaeli pa kyalo yaali 137. Waafwile ni kuya kwikala pamo ni babikolue bakue baamutangiliile. <verse eid="GEN 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 25:18" />Baikeele kufuma ku Awila mpaka ku Suri ili ku ntanzi ya Misri kine ulimukuya mu nzila ya ku Asuria. Isimaeli waafwile ntanzi ya kufua ba kwakue bonse.<verse eid="GEN 25:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nvyalo yakua Izaaki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 25:19" />Nvyalo yakua Izaaki mwina Abrahamu ni ezi: <verse eid="GEN 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 25:20" />Izaaki waali na myaka 40 lu-aupile Rebeka mwina Betueli Muamea wa ku Padani-Aramu. Ndumeze kwa Rebeka waali wakuutua Labani. <verse eid="GEN 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 25:21" />Izaaki waamupepeele mukazi wakue Rebeka kuli Yawe pantu waali nghumba. Yawe waamwasukile, ni Rebeka waimitile. <verse eid="GEN 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 25:22" />Baana baabambile kulua munda. Rebeka waalandile evi, “Ale kyakitikilaki evi? Kine ni evi, ni kufua kwa wama.” Kupwako, waya kumwipuzia Yawe.<verse eid="GEN 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 25:23" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25.23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 9:12">Bar 9.12</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yawe waamwanine evi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 25:23">“Mu livumo lyobe muli ntundu ibili.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 25:23">Misango ibili ya bantu bali munda mobe yaakaba yapuseene.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 25:23">Mutundu umo waakaba wapamine kukila unge.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 25:23">Mukulu waakaba wabombela mwanike.”<verse eid="GEN 25:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 25:24" />Musita wa kuvyala kwakua Rebeka luwaakumeene, munda mwaali mwali bampundu. <verse eid="GEN 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 25:25" />Mwana wa mambo waavyelue wali wa kasi mubili onse ni bupipi nga ngubo ya masako a nama. Ni pakako, waanikilue Esau.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25.25 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Esau </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Leli liina lifumine ku liina lya Seiri, kyalo kyaizile kwikaluamo na nvyalo yakua Esau. Seiri mu Kiebrania i kulanda nangue “bunkupili bwa kasi.”</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 25:26" />Pa kyamba, wa kwakue waavyelue wakwete ku kasinghino kakua Esau, ni pakako, wainikilue Yakobo. Rebeka lu-aavyele babo bampundu, Izaaki waali wasyali na myaka 60.<verse eid="GEN 25:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Esau wasisia nsambu yakue ya bubeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 25:27" />Babo baana lubaakulile. Esau wa-alukile mbwela wa nama, muntu waali wapisia nsita ingi mu kisonso, inzi Yakobo waali wateekameene wazikia sie mu liema. <verse eid="GEN 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 25:28" />Izaaki waali wamutonene Esau pantu waali wamuleetela nama i-aali waipaya, inzi Rebeka waali wamutonene Yakobo.<verse eid="GEN 25:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 25:29" />Busiku bumo Yakobo waelekele nseepa. Esau lu-aabwelele kufuma mu kukumba nama, waali wasyaumiine kupenzuka na nzala. <verse eid="GEN 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 25:30" />Esau waamwanine Yakobo, “Ewe, napaapaata n'mpeeleko kilunzi kya nseepa kikasikile, lenga nafua nzala.” (Ni pakako, i ki-aakuutiilue Edomu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25.30 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Edomu</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Leli liina mu Kiebrania i kulanda nangue kukasika.</char></note>)<verse eid="GEN 25:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 25:31" />Yakobo waamwasukile evi, “Nsisienke nsambu ya bubeli bobe.”<verse eid="GEN 25:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 25:32" />Esau waalandile evi, “Kili sie bwino! Mona pasyanfue. Ale nsambu ya bubeli bwane ilikuya yali na kibweziaki?”<verse eid="GEN 25:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 25:33" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25.33: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HEB 12:16">Bae 12.16</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yakobo waamwanine evi, “Kansi lapanke.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 25:33">Esau waalapile ni kumusisia Yakobo nsambu ya bubeli bwakue. <verse eid="GEN 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 25:34" />Kupwako, Yakobo wamupeela Esau mukate pamo ni kilunzi kya nseepa. Esau lu-aaliile ni kumina, waafuminepo. Evi Esau i vi-aafuupwile nsambu ya bubeli bwakue.<verse eid="GEN 25:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="GEN 26" />
  <para style="s1">Izaaki wapaalua na Leza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 26:1" />Kabili pa kyalo paali kimina kya nzala kukila kimina kya nzala kyaali mu nsiku yakua Abrahamu. Izaaki waile kuli Abimeleki Likolo wa Bafilistini mpaka ku Gerari. <verse eid="GEN 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 26:2" />Yawe waamumonekeele Izaaki. Waamwanine evi, “Tekuya ku Misri, inzi nakaba kukulangisia kwa kuti ukabe kuya kwikala. <verse eid="GEN 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 26:3" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:16-18">Kut 22.16-18</ref></char></note>Ikala sie mu keki kyalo kya bweni, naakaba pamo nobe ni kukupaala pantu wewe pamo ni nvyalo yobe yonse nakaba kumipeela keki kyalo kyonse, kabili naakafikilizia kilapo kinaalapiile so Abrahamu. <verse eid="GEN 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 26:4" />Naakasandulula nvyalo yobe nga ntanda ya mu lyulu, kabili naakaipeela bebi byalo byonse. Ntundu yonse ya pa kyalo yaakapaalilua mu luvyalo lobe, <verse eid="GEN 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 26:5" />pantu Abrahamu waunvwiliile lizui lyane ni kusunga milao yane, ni mafunde ane, ni bupinguzi bwane pamo ni mizilo yane.”<verse eid="GEN 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 26:6" />Ni pakako, Izaaki waikeele mu Gerari. <verse eid="GEN 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 26:7" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26.7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:13">Kut 12.13</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 20:2">20.2</ref></char></note>Bantu ba mu Gerari lubaamwipuziizie palua mukazi wakue, waalandile nangue, “Ni nkazyamwine.” Taitabiile nangue waali mukazi wakue pantu waali watiina nangue pange bantu kuti bamwipaya ni kumutwama Rebeka, pantu Rebeka waali wa lukebu luweme. <verse eid="GEN 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 26:8" />Izaaki lu-aapwileko nsiku ingi, Abimeleki likolo wa Bafilistini waapuziizie menso pa nzota ni kumona Izaaki walimukusaapa na mukazi wakue Rebeka. <verse eid="GEN 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 26:9" />Abimeleki waamukuutile Izaaki ni kumwana nangue, “Kisinka nainika nangue Rebeka ni mukazi obe! Ale wakilandilaki nangue ni nkaziizo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 26:9">Izaaki waamwasukile evi, “Nandenge nangue ni mukazi wane, nga nakiipailuapo.”<verse eid="GEN 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 26:10" />Kabili Abimeleki waamwanine evi, “Wakitubeepelaki? Umo wa mu bantu bane akambulenge na mukazi obe, wewe nga i wakilengia bantu bane kuba ni kilubo.” <verse eid="GEN 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 26:11" />Ni pakako, Abimeleki waabasokele bantu bakue nangue, “Emwe, onse wakaba kumukitila ozu muntu pamo ni mukazi wakue bibiipile, wakaba kwipaiwa.”<verse eid="GEN 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 26:12" />Izaaki waabyele mbezu mu kekio kyalo, ni ozo mwaka, waazombwele mbezu ingi nghendo 100 kukila elia i-aabyele, pantu Yawe waamupaalile. <verse eid="GEN 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 26:13" />Izaaki waanonkele, ni bunonsi bwakue bwaatwaliliile mpaka wa-aluka munonsi mukata. <verse eid="GEN 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 26:14" />Bafilistini baamunvwiliile bunkua pantu waali ni bisepe bya mikooko, ni bya nghombe, pamo ni babombi bengi. <verse eid="GEN 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 26:15" />Ni pakako, Bafilistini baabiikiile bulongo mu biina byakue bya menda byaimbilue na babombi bakua se Abrahamu, Abrahamu lu-aali wakikosele.<verse eid="GEN 26:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 26:16" />Abimeleki waamwanine Izaaki, “Ewe, fuma pakati ketu pantu wa-aluka ni maka kukila fwefue.” <verse eid="GEN 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 26:17" />Izaaki waafumine papo, waya kwimika tutanda mu lulambe lwa Gerari, ni kwikala koko. <verse eid="GEN 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 26:18" />Izaaki waimbulwile biina bya menda byaali byaimbilue pa musita waali wakikosele Abrahamu, pantu Bafilistini baamubiikiilemo bulongo mu bebio biina bya menda Abrahamu lu-aali wasyafwile, kabili waabiinikile meena enka alia a byainikilue na se.<verse eid="GEN 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 26:19" />Babombi bakua Izaaki baimbile biina bya menda mu lulambe mpaka basanga tusulo twa menda. <verse eid="GEN 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 26:20" />Basungi ba ku Gerari baakankabwile na basungi bakua Izaaki. Basungi ba ku Gerari baalandile nangue, “Aza menda ni etu.” Ni pakako, keki kiina kya menda Izaaki waakiinikile “Mukanka.” Pantu baakankabwile nakue.<verse eid="GEN 26:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 26:21" />Kabili baimbile kinge kiina kya menda, inzi ni kyo baakankabwiliilepo. Ni pakako, Izaaki waakiinikile Sitina.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26.21 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Sitina </char><char style="ft" closed="false">I kulanda nangue</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Bulwani.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 26:22" />Izaaki waafumine papo ni kuya kwimba kinge kiina kya menda. Pa kekio kyene tebaakankabwiliilepo. Ni pakako, Izaaki waakiinikile Rehoboti.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26.22 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Rehoboti </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Leli liina i kulanda nangue </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Nkendo ikata. </char></note> Waalandile evi, “Pantu evi Yawe watupeela nkendo ni fwe twaakavula mu kyalo.”<verse eid="GEN 26:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 26:23" />Izaaki waafumine papo ni kusela waya ku Beri-Seba. <verse eid="GEN 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 26:24" />Bobo busiku musita wa busiku, Yawe waamumonekeele. Waamwanine evi, “Nene ndi Leza wakua so Abrahamu. Tekutiina, pantu ndi pamo nobe. Naakakupaala ni kusandulula nvyalo yobe pa mulandu wa mubombi wane Abrahamu.” <verse eid="GEN 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 26:25" />Izaaki waakuulilepo kitale ni kukuuta Liina lyakua Yawe. Kabili waimikilepo liema lyakue. Babombi bakue baimbileko ni kinge kiina kya menda.<verse eid="GEN 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Izaaki ni Abimeleki baunvwana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 26:26" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26.26: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 21:22">Kut 21.22</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Abimeleki, ni kibuza wakue Ahuzati, pamo ni Fikoli mukulu wa balukale, baafumine ku Gerari ni kuya kuli Izaaki. <verse eid="GEN 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 26:27" />Izaaki waabaanine evi, “Mwemue temuntonene, kabili mwankumbile kwenu. Eba, ale mwaiza mwankonkeeleki?”<verse eid="GEN 26:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 26:28" />Ba-asukile evi, “Evi i vitwainika nangue Yawe ali pamo nobe, kabili twakimona nangue tupalile kunvwana nobe. Ni pakako, tutonene tupinghane nobe <verse eid="GEN 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 26:29" />nangue teukatukitila kibiipile pantu ni fwefue tetwaakukitiile kibiipile, inga sie kiweme, pamo ni kukupeela nsambu ya kuti uilepo bwino. Wewe lenu upaalilue na Yawe.” <verse eid="GEN 26:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 26:30" />Izaaki waabatebetele, ni bo baaliile ni kumina. <verse eid="GEN 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 26:31" />Lukeele lwakue paakili lukeelekeele, bonse baunvwene ni kupinghana. Kupwako, Izaaki wabalaya nangue, “Ale ilepo bwino.”<verse eid="GEN 26:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 26:32" />Bobo bwenka busiku, babombi bakua Izaaki baizile kumwana palua kiina kya menda kibaali balimukwimba nangue, “Twasanganga menda.” <verse eid="GEN 26:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 26:33" />Izaaki waakiinikile, “Siba.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26.33 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Siba</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Leli </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Liina i kulanda nangue </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Mulapo </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ao </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Kilooba.</char></note> Ni ozo muzi i kiwakuutilua Beri-Seba ni lenu kumo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26.33 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Beri-Seba </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Leli liina lili mu Kiebrania i kulanda nangue </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Kiina kya menda kya Mulapo </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ao </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Kiina kya menda kya kilooba.</char></note><verse eid="GEN 26:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bakazi Bazima bakua Esau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 26:34" />Esau lu-aakumaniizie myaka 40, waupile Bahiti babili, Yuditi mwana mwanakazi mwina Beri, ni Basemati mwana mwanakazi mwina Eloni. <verse eid="GEN 26:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 26:35" />Babo banakazi baaletele bulanda kuli Izaaki ni Rebeka.<verse eid="GEN 26:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="GEN 27" />
  <para style="s1">Izaaki wamupaala Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 27:1" />Izaaki lu-aakotele ni kwaluka mpofu, waakuutile libeli wakue mwalalume Esau, “We mwana wane.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:1">Mwana wakue waiteebe, “Ne ono pano.”<verse eid="GEN 27:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 27:2" />Izaaki waamwanine evi, “Mona nene nakota, nsimanine busiku bwa kufua kwane. <verse eid="GEN 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 27:3" />Ale iisape utwame bilwilo byobe, buta pamo ni mivui, uye waya mu kisonso evi uye ungipailemo nama, <verse eid="GEN 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 27:4" />mane wize ungelekele muto mu musango untonene. Pauya kundeetela, ni ne nalia, naya nkupaale ntanzi ya kufua kwane.”<verse eid="GEN 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 27:5" />Izaaki lu-aali walimukulanda na Esau, Rebeka waali watwiliziizie. Esau lu-aile mu kisonso mu kukumba nama aleete, <verse eid="GEN 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 27:6" />Rebeka waamwanine Yakobo, “We mwana wane, nene naunvua so walimukulanda na mukuluubo Esau nangue, <verse eid="GEN 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 27:7" />‘Ndeetele nama ungelekele muto ndie, mane nkupaale pa menso akua Yawe lunsinafue.’ <verse eid="GEN 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 27:8" />Kabili Rebeka waamwanine evi, ‘Kansi we mwana wane, nakulomba ukite kindikukwana. <verse eid="GEN 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 27:9" />Endo utwamepo misoka ibili ya mbuzi iweme, evi ngize n'mwelekele so muto mu musango u-atoneenemo. <verse eid="GEN 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 27:10" />Ni we waya umutwalile so alie, ni kukupaala ntanzi ya kufua kwakue.’”<verse eid="GEN 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 27:11" />Yakobo waamwanine nghina Rebeka, “We yangu, Esau ali ni bunkupili bwingi, inzi nene mubili uteleele. <verse eid="GEN 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 27:12" />Pange tawe kuti wankumia ni kwinika nangue naibeepezia kuba Esau, ni pakako, kuti naileetelela ntiipu pa kifuka kya mapaalo.”<verse eid="GEN 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 27:13" />Nghina waamwanine evi, “Ntiipu yobe ibe pali nene. Wewe kita sie munakwanina. Endo undeetele mbuzi.” <verse eid="GEN 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 27:14" />Yakobo waile kutwama mbuzi ni kumuleetela nghina. Nghina waelekele muto mu musango waali watoneenemo se kwa Yakobo. <verse eid="GEN 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 27:15" />Nghina waabuulile ngubo iwamiisie yakua Esau mwana mukulu, ngubo i-aali wamusungiile mu nghanda ni kumuvwika Yakobo mwana mwanike. <verse eid="GEN 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 27:16" />Rebeka waamukupiliile Yakobo mpapa ya mbuzi ku maboko ni mu mukosi. <verse eid="GEN 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 27:17" />Waamupeele Yakobo muto pamo ni mukate bi aateaniizie.<verse eid="GEN 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 27:18" />Kupwako, Yakobo waya kumwana se nangue, “We tawe, naiza.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:18">Se waamwipuziizie evi, “We mwana wane, uli ni?”<verse eid="GEN 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 27:19" />Yakobo wa-asukile evi, “Ni nene libeli obe Esau. Nateania kale bintu biwanghananga. Ale buuka ulie minofu iwanghananga kuti nkuleetele, evi un'mpaale.”<verse eid="GEN 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 27:20" />Izaaki waamwipuziizie evi, “We mwana wane! Waipaya kale?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:20">Waamwasukile, “Yawe Leza obe i wankwasia kuti ndenge ngipaye nama.”<verse eid="GEN 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 27:21" />Izaaki waamwanine Yakobo, “Ale palama pano nkukumie nghunvue kine uli wenka mwana wane Esau ao abe.” <verse eid="GEN 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 27:22" />Kupwako, Yakobo wamupalama se, se ni ye wamukumia ni kumwana nangue, “Lizui ni lyakua Yakobo, inzi maboko ni akua Esau.” <verse eid="GEN 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 27:23" />Izaaki taamwinikile pantu maboko akue aali akupiliilue na mpapa yaali ni masako nga bunkupili bwakua Esau. Kupwako, wamupaala. <verse eid="GEN 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 27:24" />Izaaki waamwipuziizie Yakobo, “Ati, kubako ni kiine wewe uli mwana wane Esau?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:24">Yakobo wa-asukile evi, “Ee, i nene wenka.”<verse eid="GEN 27:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 27:25" />Izaaki waamwanine evi, “Ale n'mpalamikile minofu ya nama iwaipayanga ndie, evi nkupaale.” Yakobo waamupalamikiile bilio walia, wamuleetela ni bya kumina wamina. <verse eid="GEN 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 27:26" />Izaaki waamwanine evi, “We mwana wane, ale palama pano unkumbatile.” <verse eid="GEN 27:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 27:27" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27.27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:20">Bae 11.20</ref></char></note>Yakobo lu-aapaleeme ni kumukumbatila, Izaaki waunvwile bunu bwa ngubo yakue, wamupaala walanda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:27">“Bunu bwa mwana wane</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:27">buli nga bunu bwa kisonso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:27">kipaalilue na Yawe.<verse eid="GEN 27:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 27:28" />Leza akupeele lume lwa mwiulu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:28">ni bunonsi bwa pa kyalo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:28">bilio ni bya kumina bingi!<verse eid="GEN 27:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 27:29" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27.29: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 12:3">Kut 12.3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ntundu ikubombele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:29">ni mikowa ifwiname pa ntanzi yobe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:29">Ube mukulu pa ba kobe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:29">ni bena noko bafwiname pa ntanzi yobe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:29">Atiipue kubalua muntu aliwakutiipa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:29">ni aliwakupaala apaalue.”<verse eid="GEN 27:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Esau walomba mapaalo kuli Izaaki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 27:30" />Izaaki lu-aapwile kumupaala Yakobo, mu kufumapo sie, mukuluube Esau wafika wafuma mu kukumba nama. <verse eid="GEN 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 27:31" />Ni ye waelekele muto ni kumuleetela se walanda nangue, “We tawe, ale buuka ulie munani unakuleetela evi un'mpaale.”<verse eid="GEN 27:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 27:32" />Se Izaaki waamwipuziizie evi, “Eba! Ale wewe uli ni?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:32">Esau wa-asukile evi, “Ni nene libeli obe Esau.”<verse eid="GEN 27:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 27:33" />Izaaki waakilile kukwaka walanda nangue, “Emwe! Ale olia muntu wandetelanga munani ni kumuliila byonse nani? Pantu i wenka unapaalanga. Ni azo mapaalo nsivinda ku-apokolola. Mapaalo ni akue.”<verse eid="GEN 27:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 27:34" />Esau lu-aunvwile evio, waalilile malilo akata waunvwile bulanda. Waalandile evi, “We tawe, ale ni nene n'mpaale!”<verse eid="GEN 27:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 27:35" />Izaaki wa-asukile evi, “Mwalaobe waizanga kun'mbeepa. Wene i wakutwaminanga mapaalo.”<verse eid="GEN 27:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 27:36" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27.36: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 25:29-34">Kut 25.29-34</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Esau waalandile evi, “Kansi i ki-ainikiilue Yakobo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27.36 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Yakobo </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Leli liina mu Kiebrania i kulanda nangue kubeepa</char></note> pantu Lolu i lwendo lwa bubili kungibila. Lwendo lwa mambo wangibiile nsambu yane ya bubeli, kabili evi wangibila mapaalo ane. Ati we tawe, kubako tewansungilangapo mapaalo?”<verse eid="GEN 27:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 27:37" />Izaaki wa-asukile evi, “Unvua, namupeela kale nsambu ya kuba mukuluubo, ni ba kwakue bonse kuti baye bamubombela. Namupaalanga kuti aye wali ni bilio ni bya kumina bingi. Ni evi nsili na mapaalo a kuti nkupaale we mwana wane!”<verse eid="GEN 27:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 27:38" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27.38: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HEB 12:17">Bae 12.17</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Esau waamwanine se, “We tawe, Tekusyele ata kamo ka kuti un'mpaale ni nene?” Esau waali wapaapaata koku walimukulila.<verse eid="GEN 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 27:39" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27.39 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HEB 11:20">Bae 11.20</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Izaaki waamwanine evi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:39">“Wewe waakeekala kule ni musili ufukile,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:39">kule ni lume lwa mwiulu.<verse eid="GEN 27:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 27:40" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27.40: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 36:8">Kut 36.8</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 8:20">2 Mak 8.20</ref></char>
    </note>Bwikazi bobe bwaakaba bwa bului,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:40">inzi waakaba wabombela mwalaobe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:40">Luwaakamona kuti wilubule,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:40">waakatyona mupingo wa mu mukosi obe.”<verse eid="GEN 27:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 27:41" />Esau waamusuulile Yakobo pantu i waapaalilue na se. Waalandile evi, “Muleke sie, nsiku ya kumulila tawe ilimukuya yapalama, ni pa kyamba i panaakamwipaya mwalawane Yakobo.”<verse eid="GEN 27:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 27:42" />Rebeka lu-aunvwile palua mapange akua Esau, waamwanine Yakobo, “We mwana wane, mukuluubo Esau alimukwiteekia mutima palwakua wewe wakambila kukwipaya. <verse eid="GEN 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 27:43" />We mwana wane, unvua vindikukwana. Butukila ku Harani kuli ndumyamwine Labani, <verse eid="GEN 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 27:44" />evi uye wikaleko nsiku iniini mpaka kipuki kyakua mukuluubo kikapue <verse eid="GEN 27:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 27:45" />ni kukweleela kiwakimukitila, mane nkakulaizie ukeeze, pantu kuti kyakila kun'mbiipila kufwilua na bantu babili busiku bumo.”<verse eid="GEN 27:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Izaaki wamutuma Yakobo kuli Labani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 27:46" />Rebeka waamwanine Izaaki, “Nalwala, kabili napeleelua pa mulandu wa banakazi Bahiti. Kine Yakobo waupa umo wa pa baba banakazi Bahiti ba mu keno kyalo, kyawama sie ni kufua.”<verse eid="GEN 27:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="GEN 28" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 28:1" />Kupwako, Izaaki wamukuuta Yakobo. Wamupaala wamwana nangue, “Tekuti ukoope mwanakazi Mukanaani. <verse eid="GEN 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 28:2" />Inzi endo waya ku Padani-Aramu, ku nghanda yakua Betueli se kwa noko. Koko i kwa kuti ukaye kuupila. Ukoope mwana mwanakazi mwina mwinzyobo Labani. <verse eid="GEN 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 28:3" />Leza wa Maka onse akupaale ni kukusandulula ni kukuvuzia kuba libumba lya bantu! <verse eid="GEN 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 28:4" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28.4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:4-8">Kut 17.4-8</ref></char></note>Leza apaale nvyalo yobe nga vi-aapaalile Abrahamu, evi kyalo kiwikeelemo wali mweni kibe kyobe, kyalo kyaapeelue Abrahamu na Leza!” <verse eid="GEN 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 28:5" />Izaaki waamwanine Yakobo ailepo bwino ku Padani-Aramu kuli Labani waali mwana mwalalume mwina Betueli wa ku Aramea. Labani waali ndumeze kwa Rebeka nghinabo kwa Yakobo ni Esau.<verse eid="GEN 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Esau waupa unge mukazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 28:6" />Esau waamwene nangue Izaaki waamupaalile Yakobo ni kumutuma kuti aye oopile ku Padani-Aramu. Kabili waamwene nangue lu-aamupaalile, waamwanine tekuti akoope mwanakazi Mukanaani. <verse eid="GEN 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 28:7" />Esau waamwene nangue Yakobo waamunakiile se pamo ni nghina ni kuya ku Padani-Aramu. <verse eid="GEN 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 28:8" />Esau wainikile nangue se Izaaki taali wawamiinue na banakazi ba ku Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 28:9" />Ni pakako, Esau waile kuupilapo mukazi unge pa balia bakazi ba-aali nabo. Ozo mwanakazi waali wakuutua Mahalati mwana mwanakazi mwina Isimaeli. Isimaeli waali mwana mwalalume mwina Abrahamu. Ozo mukazyana waali nkaziize kwa Nebayoti.<verse eid="GEN 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kilooto kyakua Yakobo ku Beteli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 28:10" />Yakobo waafumine ku Beri-Seba waya ku Harani. <verse eid="GEN 28:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 28:11" />Waafikile pa nkendo imo, walaala pantu busiku bwailile. Waabuulilepo libue limo ni kusaaminapo mutue wakue. Papo i pa-aaleele ni kuona. <verse eid="GEN 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 28:12" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28.12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:51">Yoa 1.51</ref></char></note>Waalootele ni kumona kiselelo kyaimikilue pansi kyakumizie mwiulu, ni bamalaika bakua Leza balimukusela ni kukooka mu kiselelo. <verse eid="GEN 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 28:13" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28.13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 13:14-15">Kut 13.14-15</ref></char></note>Yawe waali waimeene peulu kiselelo ni kulanda nangue, “Nene ndi Yawe Leza wakua Abrahamu ni wakua Izaaki. Keki kyalo ki-uleelepo naakakupeela wewe pamo ni nvyalo yobe. <verse eid="GEN 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 28:14" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28.14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:3">Kut 12.3</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 22:18">22.18</ref></char></note>Nvyalo yobe yaakaba nga lufunko lwa pa kyalo. Kabili yaakakumana kufuma ku mboosi mpaka ku kabanga, kufuma ku nkungua mpaka ku nkungulua. Muli wewe pamo ni nvyalo yobe, ntundu yonse ya pa kyalo yaakapaaliluamo. <verse eid="GEN 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 28:15" />Nene ndi pamo nobe, naakakusunga konse ku waakaya, kabili naakakubweziizia mu keno kyalo, pantu nsikakusia mpaka nkafikilizie bulayo bunaakulaile.”<verse eid="GEN 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 28:16" />Yakobo lu-abuukile mu tulo waalandile evi, “Kisinka Yawe ali pano, nene nsyamananga!” <verse eid="GEN 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 28:17" />Yakobo waatiinine walanda nangue, “Iye, pano pantu pakila kutiinia! Pano te pange, inzi ni pa Nghanda yakua Leza, kabili i pa mulyango wa mwiulu.”<verse eid="GEN 28:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 28:18" />Lukeele lwakue paakili lukeelekeele, Yakobo waabuukile, wabuula libue li-aali wasaamiinepo, waliimika misiki nga lipumpu ni kupongwelapo mafuta. <verse eid="GEN 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 28:19" />Pa ezio nkendo waapeenikile Beteli.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28.19 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Beteli </char><char style="ft" closed="false">I kulanda nangue Nghanda yakua Leza.</char></note> Ozo muzi kale waali wakuutua Luzi. <verse eid="GEN 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 28:20" />Yakobo waalapile walanda nangue, “We Yawe, kine ulikunsunga mu lwendo lwane ni kun'mpeela bilio ni ngubo ya kuvwala, <verse eid="GEN 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 28:21" />ni kubwela nakosele ku nghanda yakua tawe, Yawe waakaba Leza wane. <verse eid="GEN 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 28:22" />Leli libue linaimika nga lipumpu lyaakaba Nghanda yakua Leza, ni pa byonse biwaakan'mpeela, naakafumiapo kamo ka pa lyanondo ni kukupeela.”<verse eid="GEN 28:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="GEN 29" />
  <para style="s1">Yakobo wafika kuli Labani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 29:1" />Yakobo waatwaliliile mu lwendo lwakue ni kuya kufika mu kyalo kya bantu ba ku kabanga. <verse eid="GEN 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 29:2" />Waamwene kiina kya menda mu bukaba pamo ni bisepe bitatu bya mikooko yaali yaleele mumbali. Bebi bisepe byaali byanwinsiiwa menda pa kekio kiina kya menda, ni po paali patupikilue libue likata. <verse eid="GEN 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 29:3" />Bisepe byonse lubyaali byaiza pa kumina menda, basungi baali batupukulapo libue pakuti mikooko imine menda. Luyaali yapua kumina, kabili basungi baali batupikilapo.<verse eid="GEN 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 29:4" />Yakobo waabeepuziizie basungi, “Ati mwe ba kwane, muli ba kupi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 29:4">Baamwasukile nangue, “Fwefue tuli ba ku Harani.”<verse eid="GEN 29:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 29:5" />Waabeepuziizie evi, “Mumumanine Labani mwinzikulu wakua Nahori?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 29:5">Baamwasukile nangue, “Ee, tumumanine.”<verse eid="GEN 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 29:6" />Kabili waabeepuziizie evi, “Ati, Labani akosele?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 29:6">Ba-asukile evi, “Ee, akosele, ni Rakeli mwana wakue mwanakazi olia alimukwiza ni mikooko.”<verse eid="GEN 29:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 29:7" />Yakobo waalandile evi, “Emwe, mone kakili koba, ono te musita wakukolonghania mikooko ni kwinwinsia menda. Ale nwinsie mikooko mwitwale ku kulia bikusi.”<verse eid="GEN 29:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 29:8" />Baamwanine evi, “Ata, tetuvinda kunwinsia kale ezi mikooko inge luisinakolonghaniwe. Mpaka ni inge ileetuenke mane tutupukule keki kilibue ni kwinwinsia.”<verse eid="GEN 29:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 29:9" />Yakobo lu-aali wakilimukulanda nabo, Rakeli waafikile ni mikooko yakua se pantu wene i waali musungi. <verse eid="GEN 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 29:10" />Yakobo lu-aamwene Rakeli mwina Labani ndumeze kwa nghina, ni mikooko yakua mwinzioye, waile pa kiina kya menda ni kutupukulapo kilibue. Kupwako, wabamba kunwinsia mikooko yakua mwinzioye. <verse eid="GEN 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 29:11" />Yakobo waamukumbatiile Rakeli ni kutendeka kulila wa-angwile. <verse eid="GEN 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 29:12" />Yakobo waamwanine Rakeli nangue, “Nene ndi wa mu lupua lwakua so, kabili ndi mwina Rebeka.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 29:12">Penka papo, Rakeli waya kale lubilo aye amubwileko se. <verse eid="GEN 29:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 29:13" />Labani lu-aunvwile sie nangue mwipua wakue waiza, waile kumusensekela wali lubilo. Luamusangile, waamukumbatiile. Kupwako, waingila nakue mu nghanda yakue, ni Yakobo waamulondolwela Labani byonse byaakitikile. <verse eid="GEN 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 29:14" />Labani waalandile evi, “Kisinka wewe uli lupua lwane, kabili tuli mubili umo ni mulopa umo.” Yakobo waikeele koko mwezi walingi.<verse eid="GEN 29:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yakobo waufiiwa Lea ni Rakeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 29:15" />Labani waamwanine Yakobo nangue, “Anzia kine uli mwipua wane, nsivinda kukubombia sie kya mpuni. Landa nsazio in'mpalile kuya nakusazia.” <verse eid="GEN 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 29:16" />Labani waali wali na baana babili bakazyana. Mukulu waali wakuutua Lea, ni mwanike waali wakuutua Rakeli. <verse eid="GEN 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 29:17" />Menso akua Lea aali atope, inzi Rakeli waali waweme mubili ni lukebu.<verse eid="GEN 29:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 29:18" />Yakobo waamutonene Rakeli. Waamwanine Labani nangue, “Naakakubombela myaka kilooba pa mulandu wakua Rakeli mwana obe mwanike.”<verse eid="GEN 29:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 29:19" />Labani waalandile evi, “Ee, kuti kyawama kukupeela wewe kukila unge. Ikala nane pamo.” <verse eid="GEN 29:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 29:20" />Yakobo waabombele myaka kilooba pa mulandu wakua Rakeli. Inzi yaamwenekele sie nga nsiku iniini pantu waali wamutoneesie.<verse eid="GEN 29:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 29:21" />Yakobo waamwanine Labani, “N'mpeele Rakeli abe mukazi wane, ndaale nakue pantu nsiku yane yakumana.” <verse eid="GEN 29:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 29:22" />Ni pakako, Labani waateaniizie matebeto ni kukupa bantu ba mu muzi. <verse eid="GEN 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 29:23" />Musita wa kyungulo, waamutweme Lea ni kumutwalila Yakobo, ni ye waleele nakue. <verse eid="GEN 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 29:24" />Labani waabuulile mubombi wakue mukazyana liina lyakue Silipa ni kumupeela Lea kuti aye wali mubombi wakue. <verse eid="GEN 29:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 29:25" />Lubwaakiile, Yakobo wainikile nangue waufiiziwe Lea. Yakobo waamwipuziizie Labani, “We mwinzio, ni syani? Ne naabombeele kuufiwa Rakeli. Ale wakin'mbeepelaki?”<verse eid="GEN 29:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 29:26" />Labani wa-asukile evi, “Kono kwetu tetuli na mibeele ya kuufianke mwanike kine mukulu tanaupue. <verse eid="GEN 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 29:27" />Pwilililanke mulungu umo wa nsikunkulu yakua Lea. Mane tukabe kukupeela Rakeli wakuti ukabombele inge myaka kilooba.”<verse eid="GEN 29:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 29:28" />Yakobo waitabiile. Lu-aapwile mulungu umo mu bwinga bwakue, Labani waufiizie Rakeli kuli Yakobo. <verse eid="GEN 29:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 29:29" />Labani waabuulile mubombi wakue mukazyana liina lyakue Biliha ni kumupeela Rakeli kuti aye wali mubombi wakue. <verse eid="GEN 29:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 29:30" />Yakobo waile kulaala ni Rakeli, kabili waali wamutoneesie Rakeli kukila Lea. Ni pakako, waamubombeele Labani inge myaka kilooba.<verse eid="GEN 29:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yakobo wavyalilua baana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 29:31" />Yawe lu-aamwene nangue Lea taali watonenue, waapeelue buvyazi, inzi Rakeli waali wali nghumba. <verse eid="GEN 29:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 29:32" />Lea lu-aimitile, waavyele mwana mwalalume. Lea waalandile evi, “Yawe Leza wamona maavia ane, evi mulume wane alikuntona.” Ni pakako, ozo mwana waamwinikile Rubeni.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">29.32 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Rubeni</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Leli liina mu Kiebrania i kulanda nangue </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Mona mwana mwalalume.</char></note> Kabili waalandile evi, “Wakimona bwavia bwane.” <verse eid="GEN 29:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 29:33" />Kabili lu-aimitile, waavyele mwana mwalalume. Lea waalandile evi, “Yawe Leza wan'mpeela ozu mwana mwalalume pantu wakyunvua nangue nene nsitonenue.” Ni pakako, ozo mwana waamwinikile Simeoni.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">29.33 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Simeoni </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Leli liina mu Kiebrania i kulanda nangue </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Kunvua.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 29:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 29:34" />Kabili lu-aimitile, waavyele mwana mwalalume. Lea waalandile evi, “Lono lwendo mulume wane alikukila kwampana ni nene pantu namuvyalila kale baana batatu balalumenke.” Ni pakako, ozo mwana waamwinikile Lawi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">29.34 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Lawi: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Leli liina i kulanda nangue </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kwampana</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 29:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 29:35" />Kabili lu-aimitile, waavyele mwana mwalalume. Lea waalandile evi, “Lono lwendo namutasia Yawe.” Ni pakako, ozo mwana waamwinikile Yuda.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">29.35 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Yuda</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Leli liina mu Kiebrania i kulanda nangue kutasia</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">.</char></note> Kupwako ni luvyalo lwapela.<verse eid="GEN 29:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="GEN 30" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 30:1" />Rakeli lu-aamwene nangue wene taamuvyaliile Yakobo baana, waamunvwiliile mukuluube bunkua. Rakeli waamwanine Yakobo nangue, “We Yakobo, n'mpeele baana, kine teun'mpeele ndikufua.”<verse eid="GEN 30:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 30:2" />Yakobo waamufiitiilue Rakeli. Waalandile evi, “Eba, nene i Leza waakulengiizie kuba nghumba?”<verse eid="GEN 30:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 30:3" />Rakeli waamwanine Yakobo, “Ndi ni mubombi wane Biliha. Laala nakue anvyalile baana, evi kupitila muli wene ngie nali ni luvyalo.” <verse eid="GEN 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 30:4" />Rakeli waamupeele mulume wakue nsambu ya kuupa Biliha. Yakobo waaleele nakue. <verse eid="GEN 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 30:5" />Biliha lu-aimitile, waamuvyaliile Yakobo mwana mwalalume. <verse eid="GEN 30:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 30:6" />Rakeli waalandile evi, “Leza wapingula mulandu wane, waunvua mapepo ane ni kun'mpeela mwana mwalalume.” Ni pakako, ozo mwana waamwinikile Dani.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30.6 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Dani: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Leli liina mu Kiebrania i kulanda nangue </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Leza wapingula mulandu wane</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 30:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 30:7" />Kabili Biliha mubombi wakua Rakeli lu-aimitile, waamuvyaliile Yakobo mwana mwalalume wa bubili. <verse eid="GEN 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 30:8" />Rakeli waalandile evi, “Bului bunalwana na mukuluamwine ni bukata, inzi namwanzia.” Ni pakako, ozo mwana waamwinikile Nafutali.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30.8 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Nafutali </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Leli liina mu Kiebrania i kulanda nangue, Bului.</char></note><verse eid="GEN 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 30:9" />Lea ni ye lu-aamwene nangue buvyazi bwapua, waufiizie mubombi wakue Silipa ku mulume wakue. <verse eid="GEN 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 30:10" />Silipa mubombi wakua Lea waamuvyaliile Yakobo mwana mwalalume. <verse eid="GEN 30:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 30:11" />Lea waalandile evi, “Nasyuka!” Ni pakako, ozo mwana waamwinikile Gadi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30.11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Gadi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Leli liina mu Kiebrania i kulanda nangue lisyuko.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 30:12" />Silipa mubombi wakua Lea waamuvyaliile Yakobo unge mwana mwalalume wa bubili. <verse eid="GEN 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 30:13" />Kabili Lea waalandile evi, “Nasansamuka! Pantu bakazyana balikuyabankuuta asyukile.” Ni pakako, ozo mwana waamwinikile Aseri.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30.13 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Aseri: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Leli liina mu Kiebrania i kulanda nangue “Nsansa.”</char></note><verse eid="GEN 30:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 30:14" />Musita wa kuseepa nghano, Rubeni waile mu bukaba, waya kusangamo kitwabalindu <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30.14 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kitwabalindu </char><char style="ft" closed="false">I miti ya luvyalo.</char></note>ni kumutwalila nghina. Rakeli waamwanine Lea, “N'mpeele miti ya luvyalo yakua mwana obe Rubeni.”<verse eid="GEN 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 30:15" />Lea waamwanine evi, “Eba, we wan'mpokele mulume, kabili tewakeba kun'mpoka ni miti yakua mwana wane Rubeni?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 30:15">Rakeli wa-asukile evi, “Lelo Yakobo alikulaala ku nghanda yobe pa mulandu wa miti ya luvyalo yakua mwana obe.”<verse eid="GEN 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 30:16" />Yakobo lu-aafumine ku makaba musita wa kyungulo, Lea waile kumusensekela ni kumwana nangue, “Lelo ulikulaala ku nghanda yane pantu nakusitanga kuli Rakeli na kitwabalindu kyakua mwana wane.” Ni pakako, bobo busiku waaleele ku nghanda yakua Lea.<verse eid="GEN 30:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 30:17" />Leza waunvwile mapepo akua Lea. Lea lu-aimitile, waamuvyaliile Yakobo mwana mwalalume wa busaano. <verse eid="GEN 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 30:18" />Lea waalandile evi, “Leza wanambula pantu naufiizie mubombi wane kuli mulume wane Yakobo.” Ni pakako, ozo mwana waamwinikile Isakari.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30.18 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Isakari </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Leli liina mu Kiebrania i kulanda nangue “kilambu.” </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 30:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 30:19" />Kabili Lea lu-aimitile, waamuvyaliile Yakobo mwana mwalalume wa mutanda. <verse eid="GEN 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 30:20" />Lea waalandile evi, “Leza wanambula kilambu kiweme. Evi mulume wane waya wasyankindika pantu namuvyalila baana mutanda.” Ni pakako, ozo mwana waamwinikile Zabuloni.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30.20 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Zabuloni </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Leli liina i kulanda nangue kukindikua.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 30:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 30:21" />Pa kyamba, waavyele mwana mwanakazi ni kumwinika Dina.<verse eid="GEN 30:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 30:22" />Kabili Leza waamulangulukile Rakeli. Leza lu-aunvwile mapepo akue, waizwile buvyazi bwakue. <verse eid="GEN 30:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 30:23" />Rakeli lu-aimititile, waavyele mwana mwalalume. Rakeli waalandile evi, “Leza wan'mpwisia busoni pantu wan'mpeela mwana mwalalume.” <verse eid="GEN 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 30:24" />Ni pakako, ozo mwana waamwinikile Yusufu,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30.24 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Yusufu </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Leli liina mu Kiebrania i kulanda nangue an'mpeele ni unge.</char></note> Kuti kyawama Yawe anundilepo ni unge mwana mwalalume.<verse eid="GEN 30:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yakobo waunvwana ni Labani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 30:25" />Rakeli lu-aamuvyele Yusufu, Yakobo waamwanine Labani, “N'mpeele nsambu ya kubwelela ku kyalo kyetu, <verse eid="GEN 30:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 30:26" />un'mpeele bakazi bane pamo ni baana banaakubombeele ngie nabo pantu umanine mwilo unaakubombeele.”<verse eid="GEN 30:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 30:27" />Labani waamwanine Yakobo nangue, “Kine wangitabila, ikala sie kwenka kono pantu nakibuka ni kumona nangue Yawe wakin'mpaala kupitila muli wewe.” <verse eid="GEN 30:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 30:28" />Labani waalandile evi, “Nghane nsazio yobe ni ne ndikukusazia.”<verse eid="GEN 30:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 30:29" />Yakobo waamwanine evi, “We mwine umanine vinakikubombela ni nghombe viyakivula kuli nene. <verse eid="GEN 30:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 30:30" />Lunaali nsinaize, nama yobe teyaali yavulile, inzi evi ivulile. Yawe wakikupaala kupitila muli nene. Ale ni musitaki unakaba kubombela ba mu nghanda yane?”<verse eid="GEN 30:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 30:31" />Labani waamwipuziizie evi, “Ale ndikukupeelaki?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 30:31">Yakobo wa-asukile evi, “Teun'mpeela kantu, kine ulikunkitila keki kintu, ndikutwalilila kuliisia ni kusunga kisepe kyobe. <verse eid="GEN 30:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 30:32" />Lelo ndikupita mu kisepe kyobe kyonse nalimukufumia kubalua nama wa mabala mabala ni mantolintoli, ni kubalua nama wa fi pa mikooko, ni wa mabala mabala pa mbuzi. Ezio i yaakaba nsazio yane. <verse eid="GEN 30:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 30:33" />Kisinka kyane kyaakamoneka bobo busiku buwaakeeza kumona nsazio yane. Kine ukeeze kusanga mbuzi asili na mabala mabala ao mantolintoli, ao kubalua mukooko asili wa fi, wewe waakaba wali ni nsambu ya kulanda nangue nakikwibila.”<verse eid="GEN 30:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 30:34" />Labani waamwanine evi, “Ee, kibe nga muwalandila.” <verse eid="GEN 30:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 30:35" />Bobo busiku Labani waafumiiziepo tupwata twa mabala mabala ni twa mingoloozio, ni mbuzi ikota ya mabala mabala ni mantolintoli, ni ya mabala mabala a sue pamo ni mikooko ya fi wapeela baana bakue. <verse eid="GEN 30:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 30:36" />Ezio nama baile nayo kule kwa kwenda nsiku itatu. Yakobo wene waasyele wasunga kisepe kyakua Labani.<verse eid="GEN 30:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 30:37" />Yakobo waabuulile misambo ibisi ya milibna ni ya mlozi ni ya mwaramoni, waubulako mamba pakuti mumoneke mingoloozio ya sue. <verse eid="GEN 30:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 30:38" />Ezio misambo i aubwileko waiimikile mu biziba bya menda byaali byaminamo nama yakentele ku misambo. Nama yaimitiile papo payaali yaiza kuminina menda. <verse eid="GEN 30:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 30:39" />Nama yaimitile ntanzi ya misambo yaali mu menda. Nama yaavyele twana twa mingoloozio, ni twa mabala mabala pamo ni twa mantolintoli.<verse eid="GEN 30:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 30:40" />Yakobo waakasaniizie mikooko, wabiika nama yakentele ku nama ili ni mingoloozio ni kubalua nama wa fi wakua Labani. Wabiika bisepe byakue kule, kabili taasanziizie pa bisepe byakua Labani.<verse eid="GEN 30:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 30:41" />Nama yaamwenekelepo yalumine luyaimitile, Yakobo waabiikile misambo ku ntanzi ya ezio nama palia payaali yaminina menda, evi iye yaimitila pa ezio misambo. <verse eid="GEN 30:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 30:42" />Inzi ezio misambo taibiikile ku ntanzi ya nama yaali itope. Evi Yakobo i vi-aakwete nama ilumine, ni Labani nama itope. <verse eid="GEN 30:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 30:43" />Yakobo waanonkeesie. Waali wakwete bisepe bingi. Waali wakwete babombi bengi balalume ni banakazi, ni nghamia pamo ni punda.<verse eid="GEN 30:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="GEN 31" />
  <para style="s1">Yakobo wamubutuka Labani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 31:1" />Yakobo waunvwile baana balalume bena Labani balanda nangue, “Mwamona! Yakobo watwama bunonsi bonse bwakua situe. Bobu bunonsi bonse wanonkela mu bunonsi bwakua situe.” <verse eid="GEN 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 31:2" />Yakobo waamwene lukebu lwakua Labani tekuba lwali nga vilwaali pa mambo. <verse eid="GEN 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 31:3" />Yawe waamwanine Yakobo, “Bwelela mu kyalo kya babikolue bobe uye wikale kwikeele bantu bobe, ni nene naakaba naali pamo nobe.”<verse eid="GEN 31:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 31:4" />Yakobo waamukuutile Rakeli ni Lea beze basaakaane nakue ku kisonso kwaali kwali bisepe byakue. <verse eid="GEN 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 31:5" />Waabaanine evi, “Namona lukebu lwakua sinue tekuba lwali nga vilwaali pa mambo. Inzi Leza wakua tawe ali pamo nane. <verse eid="GEN 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 31:6" />Kabili mumanine bwino nangue nene naamubombeele sinue na maka ane onse. <verse eid="GEN 31:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 31:7" />Sinue wan'mbiibikiziizie ni kwalulula nsazio yane nghendo lyanondo, inzi Leza wandabukiile. <verse eid="GEN 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 31:8" />Labani lu-aalandile nangue mikooko ya mabala mabala i yaakaba nsazio yobe, kisepe kyonse kyaavyele twana twa mabala mabala. Kabili lu-aalandile nangue ya mingoloozio i yaakaba nsazio yobe, kisepe kyonse kyaavyele twana twa mingoloozio. <verse eid="GEN 31:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 31:9" />Evi Leza i vi-aan'mpeele bisepe bi-aafumiizie mu bisepe byakua sinue.<verse eid="GEN 31:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 31:10" />“Musita wakuti ezi nama iimite, naalootele nama ndume ya mabala mabala ni ya mingoloozio pamo ni ya mantolintoli yalimukusela pa ikota. <verse eid="GEN 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 31:11" />Naalootele malaika wankuuta nangue, ‘Yakobo.’ Ni nene na-asukile, ‘Ne ono pano.’ <verse eid="GEN 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 31:12" />Wanghanine evi, ‘Mona,’ nama ndume yonse ya ezi nama i uliwasunga, ilimukusela pa ikota yali ni mabala mabala, ni mingoloozio, ni mantolintoli. Nakita evi pantu n'mwene Labani vi-alimukukubiibikizia. <verse eid="GEN 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 31:13" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31.13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:18-22">Kut 28.18-22</ref></char></note>Nene ndi Leza waakumwenekeele ku Beteli lolia luwaapongweleele mafuta a mizeituni pa libue liwaasaamiinepo ni kundaya. Ale bwelela ku kyalo ku waavyaliilue.”<verse eid="GEN 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 31:14" />Rakeli ni Lea baamwanine evi, “Fwefue tetukili na kantu kakuti tukapyane mu nghanda yakua Situe. <verse eid="GEN 31:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 31:15" />Fwefue tupendelue sie nga baeni mu nghanda yakua situe. Wene waatusisiizie, ni nfolanga yonse waaliile sie bunke. <verse eid="GEN 31:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 31:16" />Bobu bunonsi bobe bonse buuli nabo bwaabuulile Leza pa bunonsi bwakua situe, i bunonsi bwetu pamo ni baana betu. Wewe kita sie kyonse kyakikwana Leza.”<verse eid="GEN 31:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 31:17" />Kupwako, Yakobo wasezia baana bakue pamo ni bakazi bakue peulu nghamia. <verse eid="GEN 31:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 31:18" />Mu lwendo lwakue lwa kubwelela kuli se mu kyalo kya Kanaani, waile ni biteekua byakue byonse pamo ni bunonsi bwakue bonse bu-aanonkele ku Padani-Aramu. <verse eid="GEN 31:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 31:19" />Labani lu-aali waile ku kutebula masako a mikooko yakue, Rakeli waibile baleza bakua se. <verse eid="GEN 31:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 31:20" />Yakobo waamuzembulukile Labani Muaramea pasili kumulaya. <verse eid="GEN 31:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 31:21" />Yakobo waatweme bintu byakue byonse waya. Lu-aile kwabuka mwenzi wa Efrati, waile walungheeme lya ku kyalo kya mpili kya Gileadi.<verse eid="GEN 31:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Labani wamukonka Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 31:22" />Pa busiku bwa butatu, Labani waabwililue nangue Yakobo wakibutuka. <verse eid="GEN 31:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 31:23" />Waile pamo ni ba kwakue wamukonkele Yakobo. Busiku bwa kilooba, waile kumusanga mu kyalo kya mpili kya Gileadi. <verse eid="GEN 31:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 31:24" />Leza waizile kumwana Labani Muaramea mu kilooto musita wa busiku nangue, “Kengela, tekwezia kumwana Yakobo kantu kaweme ao kabiipile.” <verse eid="GEN 31:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 31:25" />Labani lu-aamusangile Yakobo, Yakobo waali waimikile liema lyakue mu kyalo kya mpili kya Gileadi, Labani ni bantu bakue ni ye waimikile liema mu kyalo kya mpili kya Gileadi.<verse eid="GEN 31:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 31:26" />Labani waamwanine Yakobo, “Wakinzembulukilaki watwama ni baana bane banakazi nga banakazi bakwetue ku bului? <verse eid="GEN 31:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 31:27" />Ale wakinzembulukilaki pasili kunghana? Pantu unghanenge, nga nakikulaya bwino. Nga pakiimbua nghimbo ni kombua nghoma pamo ni kulizia bilimba. <verse eid="GEN 31:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 31:28" />Kabili tewakin'mpeela nsambu ya kubalaya nabakumbatila benzikulu bane pamo ni baana bane. Waakikita bintu bimo bya bulubi. <verse eid="GEN 31:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 31:29" />Nene ndi ni nsambu ya kukukitila kintu kibiipile, inzi Leza wakua so wakinsoka lukeele busiku kuti nkengele, kabili tekuti nkwane kantu kaweme ao kabiipile. <verse eid="GEN 31:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 31:30" />N'manine nangue uli ni nkulu ya kubwelela kuli so. Ale kiwakiibila baleza bane ni kiki?”<verse eid="GEN 31:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 31:31" />Yakobo waamwasukile evi, “Nakitiina kukulaya pantu nakimona nangue pange kuti wan'mpoka baana bobe bakazyana mu maka. <verse eid="GEN 31:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 31:32" />Kansi kine wasangapo umo pakati ketu wali ni babo baleza bobe, tapalile kuba mukose. Ale iza umone kine pali ni kintu kyobe, kine pakili ukitwame.” Yakobo waalandile evio pantu taali wamanine nangue Rakeli i waali waibile baleza bakua Labani.<verse eid="GEN 31:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 31:33" />Kupwako, Labani waingila mu liema lyakua Yakobo, ni mu liema lyakua Lea, ni mu liema lya babombi babili banakazi. Momo taasangilemo baleza bakue. Kabili waile kwingila ni mu liema lyakua Rakeli. <verse eid="GEN 31:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 31:34" />Rakeli i waali watweme babo baleza ba mu nghanda ni kuya wababiikile pensina mpapa i-aali wapanzikile pa nghamia ni kuya waikeelepo. Labani waakebele mu maema onse pasili kumona. <verse eid="GEN 31:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 31:35" />Rakeli waamwanine se nangue, “We tawe, tekunfiitilua pantu nsimeene pa ntanzi yobe. Ndimukutiina kwimana pantu ndwele malwele a banakazi.” Labani waakilile kukeba pasili kusanga baleza bakue.<verse eid="GEN 31:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 31:36" />Yakobo waakilile kufiitua. Waalandile evi, “Eba, nene nakikuluviaki pakuti wize wankonkele wafiitilue mu ozu musango?” <verse eid="GEN 31:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 31:37" />Mu bintu byane byonse biwakebamo, kine wasangamo kintu kyobe, kibiike papa kimonue na bantu bobe ni bantu bane, evi batupingule kine nani ali ni nsambu. <verse eid="GEN 31:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 31:38" />Nakiikala nobe myaka 20. Mikooko yobe ao mbuzi yobe teyaapulumwine ata livumo, kabili nsyaaliilepo mpanga wa pa bisepe byobe. <verse eid="GEN 31:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 31:39" />Naali nakita kine mukooko waipawa na kinama, napyanikiziapo unge. Nsyaali nakuleetela ni kukwana nangue te kilubo kyane. Mikooko yonse yaali yaibua musita wa koba ni musita wa busiku, waali wanomba kuti nkubweziizie. <verse eid="GEN 31:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 31:40" />Musita wa koba naali nazia na lyuza, ni musita wa busiku naali naumina na kasama. Nsyaali nalaala. <verse eid="GEN 31:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 31:41" />Evi i vinaemene myaka yonse 20 naali mu nghanda yobe. Pakuti ungufie baana bobe babili, naakubombeele myaka lyanondo ni ina. Kabili naakubombeele myaka mutanda pakuti un'mpeele bisepe bya nama anzia kine waali wa-alulula alulula sie nsazio yane nghendo yonse lyanondo. <verse eid="GEN 31:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 31:42" />Kabenge Leza wakua tawe ni Leza wakua Abrahamu, Leza waatiininue na Izaaki, tekuba wali pamo nane, kisinka wewe nga wankumbile kale pasili kun'mpeela kantu. Inzi Leza waamwene maavia ane ni kubomba kunaakubombeele. Kabili wakikusoka lukeele busiku.<verse eid="GEN 31:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yakabo ni Labani baitabizyania</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 31:43" />Labani waamwanine Yakobo, “Babo baana banakazi, ni bane. Baana babo ni bo ni bane, ni bebi bisepe ni byo ni byane. Bebi byonse bi umwene ni byane. Inzi evi nsili na buvinde bwa kusunga babo baana bane pamo ni benzikulu. <verse eid="GEN 31:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 31:44" />Kansi evi, twende tupinghane pakuti kiye kyali kisininkizio pakati kobe ni nene.”<verse eid="GEN 31:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 31:45" />Kupwako, Yakobo wabuula libue ni kuliimika nga lipumpu. <verse eid="GEN 31:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 31:46" />Yakobo waabaanine bantu bakue batoole mabue ni ku-atuulika pepi na lelio libue. Kupwako, Yakobo ni Labani babamba kulia baikeele mumbali mabue. <verse eid="GEN 31:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 31:47" />Pa ezi nkendo Labani waapeenikile Yegari-Sahaduta.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">31.47 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Yegari-Sahaduta </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Leli liina lili mu Kiaramaika i kulanda nangue mului wa mabue wa kutusininkizia.</char></note> Inzi Yakobo wene waapeenikile Galedi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">31.47 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Galedi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Leli liina lili mu Kiebrania i kulanda nangue mului wa mabue wa kutusininkizia.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 31:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 31:48" />Labani waamwanine Yakobo, “Aza mabue i-aakaba kisininkizio kyetu bonse babili.” Ni pakako, ozo mului wainikilue Galedi, <verse eid="GEN 31:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 31:49" />ni lelia libue ni lyo lyainikilue Misipa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">31.49 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Misipa </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Leli liina mu Kiebrania i kulanda nangue lupungu. </char></note> Pantu Labani waalandile nangue, “Yawe aye watukenteleele fwe bonse babili pa tukalekana.” <verse eid="GEN 31:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 31:50" />Labani waalandile evi, “Kine ukeemie baana bane banakazi ao kuupilapo bange, anzia kine ne nsikaba namanine, ukamane sie nangue Leza i musininkizi pakati ketu.” <verse eid="GEN 31:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 31:51" />Labani waamwanine Yakobo, “Mona ozu mului wa mabue ni lipumpu linakiimika pakati kobe ni nene. <verse eid="GEN 31:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 31:52" />Ozu mului pamo ni leli lipumpu biye byali kisininkizio kya kulangulukilako nangue nene nsikataaluka ozu mului ni kwiza kukusakukila, ao wewe kutaaluka ozu mului ni kwiza kunsakukila. <verse eid="GEN 31:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 31:53" />Leza wakua Abrahamu ni Leza wakua Nahori, ni Leza wa babikolue babo, akatupingule fwe bonse babili.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 31:53">Yakobo waalapile mu Liina lyakua Leza aliwatiinua na se Izaaki. <verse eid="GEN 31:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 31:54" />Yakobo waipaile nama ni kwelela peulu lupili, kabili waakupile bantu bakue kuti balie nakue ozo munani. Pa kyamba, baaleele penka papo peulu lupili. <verse eid="GEN 31:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 31:55" />Labani lu-aabuukile paakili lukeelekeele, waakumbatiile baana bakue pamo ni benzikulu ni kubaana bailepo bwino. Kupwako, Labani wabwelela kwakue.<verse eid="GEN 31:55" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="GEN 32" />
  <para style="s1">Yakobo waiteania kuya kumonana ni Esau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 32:1" />Yakobo lu-aali walimukubwelela kwabo, bamalaika bakua Leza baasaakeene nakue. <verse eid="GEN 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 32:2" />Yakobo lu-aamwene babo bamalaika waalandile nangue, “Leli i libumba lyakua Leza.” Ni pakako, pa ezio nkendo wainikilepo Mahanaimu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">32.2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mahanaimu </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Leli liina mu Kiebrania i kulanda nangue </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Mabumba abili a bantu baakuulile mitanda.</char></note><verse eid="GEN 32:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 32:3" />Yakobo waatumine mikenzi kuli mukuluube Esau mu Seiri, mu kyalo kya Edomu. <verse eid="GEN 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 32:4" />Waabalaiziizie wabaana baye balande nangue, “Mubombi obe Yakobo walanda evi, ‘We mukuluamwine, naile kwikala ni Labani nali mweni ezi myaka yonse, <verse eid="GEN 32:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 32:5" />ni evi naiza nali ni nghombe, ni punda, ni mikooko, ni mbuzi, pamo ni babombi balalume ni banakazi. Nalaizia evio naswapiile kwitabilua na we mukuluamwine.’”<verse eid="GEN 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 32:6" />Mikenzi yaizile kubwezia kapingu kuli Yakobo nangue, “Twayanga kuli mukuluubo Esau, ni ye alimukwiza kukupokelela wali ni bantu 400.” <verse eid="GEN 32:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 32:7" />Yakobo lu-aunvwile evio, waatoobokele ni kutiina. Ni pakako, waakasaniizie bantu ba-aali nabo pamo ni mikooko, ni mbuzi, ni nghombe, pamo ni nghamia mu mabumba abili. <verse eid="GEN 32:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 32:8" />Waalandile evi, “Kine Esau waiza kusakukila libumba limo, linge lilikupusuka.”<verse eid="GEN 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 32:9" />Kabili waamulombele Leza walanda nangue, “We Leza wakua tawekulu Abrahamu ni wakua tawe Izaaki, we Yawe wanghanine nangue, ‘Bwelela ku kyalo kyobe ni ku lupua lobe evi nkakukitile biweme.’ <verse eid="GEN 32:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 32:10" />Naikeefia ku buwame ni ku kisinka kyobe kiwaanangisiizie ne mubombi obe, pantu mwenzi wa Yordani naawabukile tekuba natweme kantu inga sie kabango, inzi evi nabwela natweme mabumba abili. <verse eid="GEN 32:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 32:11" />Nakulomba un'mpususie kuli mukuluamwine Esau, pantu natiina nkeeza kusakukilua, nene ni bakazi bane pamo ni baana bane. <verse eid="GEN 32:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 32:12" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32.12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:17">Kut 22.17</ref></char></note>We Leza languluka bulayo buwandaile nangue waakankitila biweme ni kuvuzia nvyalo yane, ikabe yavulile nga musenga wa mumbali lyezi usili wavinda kupendua na muntu.”<verse eid="GEN 32:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 32:13" />Bobo busiku Yakobo waaleele penka papo. Kupwako, wabuulapo bimo pa bintu bi-aali nabio, evi amutwalile mukuluube Esau kilambu. <verse eid="GEN 32:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 32:14" />Waabuulile makota a mbuzi 200 ni tupwata 20 ni mikooko ikota 200 ni mpanga 20, <verse eid="GEN 32:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 32:15" />nghamia 30 yaali yaonsia pamo ni twana twabo, nghombe ikota 40 ni nghombe ndume lyanondo, punda ikota 20, ni punda ndume lyanondo. <verse eid="GEN 32:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 32:16" />Yakobo waakasaniizie bisepe, kubalua kisepe kyaali kyali ni musungi umo. Waabaanine basungi nangue, “Ale abuke mwenzi muntangilile, kubalua kisepe kiye kyaenda kyalekenkeene ni kinge.” <verse eid="GEN 32:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 32:17" />Yakobo waamwanine mubombi wa mambo nangue, “Esau pa-aya kusaakaana nobe ni kwipuzia nangue, ‘Wewe uli muntu wakua ni? Kabili ulimukuya pi? Ni ezi nama ikutangiliile ni yakua ni?’” <verse eid="GEN 32:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 32:18" />Uye umwane nangue, “Ezi nama ni yakua mubombi obe Yakobo. Wene wamutumina selenzi Esau. Inzi Yakobo alimukwiza pa kyamba kyetu.” <verse eid="GEN 32:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 32:19" />Evi i vya-anine ni musungi wa bubili, ni wa butatu, ni bange basungi ba bisepe. Evi i vyakuti muye mulande pamuya kusaakaana ni Esau. <verse eid="GEN 32:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 32:20" />Kabili muye mulande nangue, “Mubombi obe Yakobo alimukwiza pa kyamba.” Yakobo waali walangakana evi, “Bobu bupe bunamutumina, pange bulikumufuukiako mutima evi n'monane nakue ni kungeleela bilubo byane.” <verse eid="GEN 32:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 32:21" />Evi i vyaatangiile bupe bwakue. Yakobo waasyele kulaala papo pa tutanda.<verse eid="GEN 32:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yakobo wakanzana na Leza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 32:22" />Bobo bwenka busiku musita wa busiku Yakobo waabuukile, watwama bakazi bakue babili ni babombi bakue banakazi babili pamo ni baana bakue lyanondo ni umo, waya kwabuka pa musalala wa mwenzi wa Yaboki. <verse eid="GEN 32:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 32:23" />Yakobo wa-abusiizie lupua lwakue pamo ni bintu byakue byonse bi-ali nabio, <verse eid="GEN 32:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 32:24" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 12:3-4">Hos 12.3-4</ref></char></note>inzi waasyele bunke ku kyamba.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 32:24">Kwaizile muntu umo waabambile kukanzana nakue mpaka ku makia. <verse eid="GEN 32:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 32:25" />Ozo muntu lu-aamwene nangue wamwandua, waamukwete Yakobo pa kitungu, kitungu kyakua Yakobo kyaavyukile musita u-ali walimukulua nakue. <verse eid="GEN 32:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 32:26" />Ozo muntu waalandile evi, “Ndekele ngie naya! Mona pasyabukie.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 32:26">Yakobo waalandile evi, “Nsikulekela kine teunan'mpaale.”<verse eid="GEN 32:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 32:27" />Ozo muntu waamwipuziizie evi, “Liina lyobe uli ni?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 32:27">Wa-asukile nangue, “Nene ndi Yakobo.”<verse eid="GEN 32:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 32:28" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">32.28: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 35:10">Kut 35.10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ozo muntu waalandile evi, “Wewe teukiya wakuutua Yakobo pantu wakanzana na Leza ni bantu, ni we wa-anzia. Inzi waya wasyakuutua Izraeli.” <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">32.28 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Izraeli </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Leli liina mu Kiebrania i kulanda nangue “walwana ni Leza” ao nangue “Leza aliwalwana.”</char></note><verse eid="GEN 32:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 32:29" />Yakobo waamwipuziizie evi, “Ale wewe uli ni?”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32.29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 13:17-18">Bap 13.17-18</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 32:29">Waamwasukile, “Wangipuziiziaki Liina lyane?” Kupwako, ozo muntu wamupaala Yakobo.<verse eid="GEN 32:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 32:30" />Yakobo waalandile evi, “Namonana ni Leza, kabili nasyala nakosele.” Ni pakako, pa ezio nkendo wainikilepo nangue, “Penueli.” <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">32.30 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Penueli </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Leli liina mu Kiebrania i kulanda nangue, “Kumonana ni Leza.” </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 32:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 32:31" />Koba lukaali kasyatula, Yakobo waafumine pa Penueli ni kubamba kuya wasunkuta pantu waali wavyulilue kitungu kyakue. <verse eid="GEN 32:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 32:32" />Ni pakako, Baizraeli i kibasilibaliila buzwazua bwa mu kitungu, pantu pa buzwazua i paakumiiziwe Yakobo ni kuvyulua kitungu.<verse eid="GEN 32:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="GEN 33" />
  <para style="s1">Yakobo wasaakaana ni Esau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 33:1" />Yakobo lu-aamumwene Esau walimukwiza pamo ni bantu 400, waalekenkaniizie baana bakue: Lea ni baana bakue, Rakeli ni baana bakue, ni babombi babili banakazi ni baana babo. <verse eid="GEN 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 33:2" />Waatangiziizie babombi bakue babili pamo ni baana babo, Lea ni baana bakue i baakonkelepo, Rakeli i waali wasyaliile pamo ni Yusufu. <verse eid="GEN 33:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 33:3" />Yakobo waabatangiliile koku walimukuya wafwinamina pansi mpaka nghendo kilooba ni kuya kufika mu kyeni kyakua mukuluube. <verse eid="GEN 33:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 33:4" />Inzi Esau waile kumusensekela wali lubilo. Lu-aafikile, waamukumbatiile mu mukosi ni kumufyompa, ni bonse babili batendeka kulila. <verse eid="GEN 33:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 33:5" />Esau akente evi, wamona banakazi baimeene pamo ni baana babo. Esau waipuzia kale, “Eba, ale baba bauli nabo ni bani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 33:5">Yakobo waalandile evi, “Baba i baana baapeelue mubombi obe na nkumbu yakua Leza.” <verse eid="GEN 33:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 33:6" />Babombi banakazi bakua Yakobo pamo ni baana babo baamupalamiine Esau ni kumufwinamina. <verse eid="GEN 33:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 33:7" />Lea ni baana bakue ni bo baile kumufwinamina. Pa mpeleezio, Yusufu ni Rakeli ni bo baile kumufwinamina.<verse eid="GEN 33:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 33:8" />Esau waamwipuziizie Yakobo, “Ewe, ale belia bisepe binasaakaananga nabio kolia ni byaki?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 33:8">Yakobo waamwasukile evi, “Nakituma bebi bisepe pakuti n'mpokelelue na mukuluamwine.”<verse eid="GEN 33:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 33:9" />Esau wa-asukile evi, “Sunga sie bebi bisepe byobe, ni nene wenka nkwete sie bingi.”<verse eid="GEN 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 33:10" />Yakobo waalandile evi, “Napaapaata upokelele pakuti kiye kyali kisininkizio kya kulangisia nangue wan'mpokelela. Kumona kunakumona, ni kukonkana ni viwan'mpokelela, na-aluka nga ne wamona lukebu lwakua Leza. <verse eid="GEN 33:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 33:11" />Nakupaapaata upokelele bobu bupe bwane buwaleetelua pantu Leza wakin'mpaala ni kun'mpeela kubalua kantu.” Yakobo waakilile kumupaapaata Esau mpaka wafikiila kupokelela.<verse eid="GEN 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 33:12" />Esau waalandile evi, “Ale iza twende, ni ne ndikuya nakutangiliile.”<verse eid="GEN 33:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 33:13" />Yakobo waalandile evi, “We mukuluamwine, umwene baana vibanakile, kabili nene wenka i alimukusunga mikooko ni mbuzi ilimukonsia twana. Ezi nama yane kine yaenda kukila busiku bumo yonse ilikufua. <verse eid="GEN 33:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 33:14" />Ni pakako, wewe tangila sie, ne ozo alimukwiza buke buke kukonkana ni nghendelo ya baana ni bisepe byane. Twakaba kwiza kumonana koko kwenka ku Seiri.”<verse eid="GEN 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 33:15" />Esau waalandile evi, “Kansi nkusiile baba bantu bandi nabo wize pamo nabo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 33:15">Yakobo waalandile evi, “Ata, ale viwangeleela kale! Wewe endo waya sie.” <verse eid="GEN 33:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 33:16" />Kupwako, Esau wamusia ni kubwelela ku Seiri. <verse eid="GEN 33:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 33:17" />Yakobo ni ye waile ku Sukoti ku-aakuulile nghanda yakue ni bipata bya nghombe. Ni pakako, pa ezio nkendo i kipalipakuutilua Sukoti.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">33.17 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Sukoti </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Leli liina mu Kiebrania i kulanda nangue kipata.</char></note><verse eid="GEN 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 33:18" />Yakobo lu-aabwelele kufuma ku Padani-Aramu, waabwelele sie bwino mpaka kuya kufika ku Sekemu mu kyalo kya Kanaani ni kwimika liema lyakue ntanzi ya muzi. <verse eid="GEN 33:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 33:19" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 24:32">Yos 24.32</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 4:5">Yoa 4.5</ref></char></note> Ezi nkendo i aimikilepo liema, waasitile ku luvyalo lwakua Hamori se kwa Sekemu na shekeli 100 ya mutofue. <verse eid="GEN 33:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 33:20" />Waakuulilepo kitale ni kwi-inika Eli-Elohe-Izraeli.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">33.20 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Eli-Elohe-Izraeli </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Leli liina i kulanda nangue “Leza, i Leza wakua Izraeli.”</char></note><verse eid="GEN 33:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="GEN 34" />
  <para style="s1">Sekemu wamukitila Dina bintu bisipalile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 34:1" />Dina, se waali Yakobo, ni nghina waali Lea. Waile kupita wapempula bakazyana nakue ba mu kekio kyalo. <verse eid="GEN 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 34:2" />Sekemu mwana mwalalume mwina Hamori Muhivi, mukulu wa kyalo, lu-aamumwene Dina walimukupita, waamukwete ni kumupatikizia kukumana nakue. <verse eid="GEN 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 34:3" />Sekemu waawamiinue sana na ozo mukazyana Dina mwina Yakobo. Sekemu waabambile kumubembia ozo mukazyana na twebo tuweme. <verse eid="GEN 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 34:4" />Sekemu waamwanine se Hamori amutwamine ozo mukazyana kuti abe mukazi wakue.<verse eid="GEN 34:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 34:5" />Yakobo lu-aunvwile nangue mwana wakue Dina wakipatikiziiwa na Sekemu kuti alaale nakue, taalandile kantu pantu baana bakue balalume baali baile ku kusunga nama mu kisonso. Waapembeele mpaka musita ubaabwelele. <verse eid="GEN 34:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 34:6" />Hamori se kwa Sekemu waile kuli Yakobo kuti alanzyanie nakue. <verse eid="GEN 34:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 34:7" />Baana bena Yakobo lubaunvwile byaakitikile, baabwelele ku muzi, baafiitilue sana pantu Sekemu waakitile bintu bya bulubi mu Izraeli. Bintu bisipalile kukitika. <verse eid="GEN 34:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 34:8" />Hamori waamwanine Yakobo ni baana bakue, “Mwana wane Sekemu wamutona sana Dina. Kansi namipaapaata mumupeele nsambu ya kuti abe mukazi wakue. <verse eid="GEN 34:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 34:9" />Tunvwane sie kuti tuye twaufyania. Tupeele baana benu banakazi, ni fwe tumipeele baana betu banakazi. <verse eid="GEN 34:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 34:10" />Kuti mwaikala pamo ni fwefue mu keno kyalo. Kuti mwaikala konse kumwatona kwikala, ni kusuluzia kyonse kimwatona kusuluzia ni kwikwatila kazonga kenu.”<verse eid="GEN 34:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 34:11" />Sekemu waamwanine se kwa Dina ni bakuluube, “Namipaapaata kuti mungitabile, ni nene ndikumikitila kyonse kimulikutona kuti n'mikitile. <verse eid="GEN 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 34:12" />Anzia munundila mutengo ni bupe, ndikumipeela byonse bimulikun'mpingula, inzi mun'mpeele nsambu ya kuupa ozu mukazyana Dina kuti abe mukazi wane.”<verse eid="GEN 34:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 34:13" />Inzi pantu Sekemu waamupatikiizie Dina kukumana nakue, baana bena Yakobo baamwasukile Sekemu pamo ni Hamori mu bukengezi. <verse eid="GEN 34:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 34:14" />Baalandile evi, “Fwefue tetuvinda kuufia nkazyetu ku bantu basiteetelue yando. Keki ni kya busoni kuli fwefue. <verse eid="GEN 34:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 34:15" />Inzi kine mwaitabila kuya mwateetua yando nga fwefue, kuti twaitabila kuti muye mwaupila kono kwetu. <verse eid="GEN 34:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 34:16" />Baana benu kuti baupua na baana betu ni baana betu kuti baupua na baana benu. Kabili kuti twaikala nenu ni kuba mutundu umo. <verse eid="GEN 34:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 34:17" />Inzi kine mwakaana kuteetua yando, tulikumutwama Dina ni kukuuka tukuuke pa eno nkendo.”<verse eid="GEN 34:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 34:18" />Hamori ni mwana wakue Sekemu baawamiinue na kako kaalandilue. <verse eid="GEN 34:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 34:19" />Ni pakako, mulumendo taakokwele kuteetua yando pantu waali wamutoneesie Dina. Sekemu waali wakindikilue sana mu lupua lwakue.<verse eid="GEN 34:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 34:20" />Hamori ni mwana wakue baile pa mulyango wa muzi ni kulanzyania ni bantu ba mu muzi wabo nangue, <verse eid="GEN 34:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 34:21" />“Emwe, baba bantu ni bantu ba mutende. Kansi baleke bekale pamo ni fwefue mu keno kyalo ni kusuluzia. Keno kyalo ni kikata kuti baikala. Baana betu kuti baupua na baana babo, ni baana babo kuti baupua na baana betu. <verse eid="GEN 34:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 34:22" />Inzi tupalile sie kukita kintu kimo pakuti tuye twapwene nabo ni kuya twali mutundu umo. Balalume bonse mu lono lupua lwetu bapalile kuya bateetua yando. <verse eid="GEN 34:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 34:23" />Fwe bonse kine twaitabizyania, twaakeekala nabo, ni bunonsi bwabo bonse pamo ni bisepe byabo byonse bya nama ni inge nama, byonse byaakaba byetu.” <verse eid="GEN 34:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 34:24" />Bekazi bonse ba mu ozo muzi baitabiziizie bintu byaalandile Hamori ni mwana wakue Sekemu. Balalume bonse baateetelue yando.<verse eid="GEN 34:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 34:25" />Lupaapitile nsiku itatu bantu bakilimukukisua na bilonda bya yando i baateetelue, Simeoni ni Lawi bandumeze ba munda mumo ni Dina baatweme bipanga, baya kusakukila muzi mu kafiso ni kwipaya balalume bonse. <verse eid="GEN 34:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 34:26" />Hamori ni mwana wakue Sekemu ni bo kumo baipailue. Baamufumiizie Dina ku nghanda yakua Sekemu ni kuya nakue. <verse eid="GEN 34:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 34:27" />Pa kyamba kya kwipaiwa kwa babo bantu, baana bena Yakobo baatweme bintu bya babo baipailue, pantu Sekemu waamupatikiizie Dina kukumana nakue. <verse eid="GEN 34:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 34:28" />Bintu bibaabatwamiine ni bebi: Mikooko, ni mbuzi, ni punda, pamo ni binge byaali byali mu muzi ni mu makaba. <verse eid="GEN 34:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 34:29" />Kubalua nghanda baatwememo bunonsi bwabo bonse, ni baana babo bonse, ni bakazi babo bonse pamo ni bintu byonse bibaali nabio.<verse eid="GEN 34:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 34:30" />Yakobo waamwanine Simeoni ni Lawi, “Mwe baana bane, mone vimwakita! Evi mwanghingizia mu bwavia bukata ku bantu ba mu Kanaani ni ku bantu ba mu Perisi bekeele batuzyungulukiile. Evi bantu bonse bakaba kunsuula. Nene nsili na bantu bengi. Kine bakabe kukolonghana ni kwiza kunsakukila, bakaba kungipaya pamo ni bantu bane bonse.”<verse eid="GEN 34:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 34:31" />Inzi baana baalandile evi, “Fwefue tetuvinda kulekelela nkazyetu kwalulua nga mukambue.”<verse eid="GEN 34:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="GEN 35" />
  <para style="s1">Yakobo wabwelela ku Beteli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 35:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">35.1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 28:11-17">Kut 28.11-17</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Leza waamwanine Yakobo nangue, “Ale bwela uye wikale ku Beteli kunaakumonekeele lolia luwaamubutukile mukuluubo Esau. Koko i kwa kuti ukabe kuya kukuula nghanda yobe pamo ni kunkuulila kitale.”<verse eid="GEN 35:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 35:2" />Yakobo wa-anine lupua lwakue pamo ni bantu ba-aali nakue nangue, “Ale fumie baleza baeni pakati kenu, musambe ni kuvwala ngubo inge. <verse eid="GEN 35:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 35:3" />Mane tuye twaya ku Beteli, koko kunakaba kuya kumukuulila Leza kitale. Wene i Leza wanghunvwile mu maavia ane, ni waali pamo nane konse kunaali naya.” <verse eid="GEN 35:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 35:4" />Baamupeele Yakobo baleza baeni bonse babaali nabo pamo ni ntimbi yabo. Yakobo waabuulile bebio byonse ni kubifiika mwinsina kimuti kya ku Sekemu.<verse eid="GEN 35:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 35:5" />Yakobo ni bantu bakue lubaali basyaya, bantu ba mu mizi yaali yabazyungulukiile baunvwile mwezo ukata. Kabili tekuli muntu waeziizie kukonka baana bena Yakobo. <verse eid="GEN 35:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 35:6" />Evi, Yakobo waafikile ku Luzi (i Beteli) mu kyalo kya Kanaani, wene pamo ni bantu bonse baali bali pamo nakue. <verse eid="GEN 35:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 35:7" />Pa ezio nkendo waakuulilepo kitale kyaali kyakuutua, “Eli-Beteli.” Papo Leza i pa-aamumwenekeele lu-aali wabutukile mukuluube Esau. <verse eid="GEN 35:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 35:8" />Ni Debora kalela wakua Rebeka waafwile ni kuziikua lya ku nkungulua ya Beteli, mwinsina kimuti kya Muterebinti. Kekio kimuti kyaakuutilue, “Aloni-Bakuti.”<verse eid="GEN 35:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 35:9" />Kabili Leza waamumonekeele Yakobo lu-aafumine ku Padani-Aramu ni kumupaala. <verse eid="GEN 35:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 35:10" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 32:28">Kut 32.28</ref></char></note>Leza waamwanine evi, “Liina lyobe uli Yakobo. Teukiya wakuutua Yakobo, inzi waya wasyakuutua Izraeli.” Kupwako wamwinika Izraeli. <verse eid="GEN 35:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 35:11" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:4-8">Kut 17.4-8</ref></char></note>Leza waamwanine evi, “Nene ndi Leza wa Maka onse. Sanduluka ni kuvula. Ntundu ni libumba lya ntundu ingi yaakafuma muli wewe, ni makolo aakafuma mu kitungu kyobe. <verse eid="GEN 35:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 35:12" />Kyalo kinaamupeele Abrahamu ni Izaaki, naakakupeela wewe pamo ni nvyalo yobe.” <verse eid="GEN 35:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 35:13" />Kupwako, Leza wafumapo ni kumusia Yakobo penka papo pa-aalandile nakue. <verse eid="GEN 35:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 35:14" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:18-19">Kut 28.18-19</ref></char></note>Ni Yakobo waimikile lipumpu lya libue pa kifuka ki-aalanziiziwepo na Leza, ni kwitililapo ngelelo ya bya kumina, ni mafuta. <verse eid="GEN 35:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 35:15" />Yakobo pa kelia kifuka ki-aalanziiziwepo na Leza, waapeenikile, Beteli.<verse eid="GEN 35:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Rakeli wafua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 35:16" />Baafumine ku Beteli. Lubaali basyafika ku Efura, misa ya luvyalo yaamukwete Rakeli. Waakisilue sana na misa ya luvyalo. <verse eid="GEN 35:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 35:17" />Ozo musita misa ya luvyalo luyaakilile, kinghombe waamwanine evi, “Tekutiina! Ulikuvyala ni unge mwana.” <verse eid="GEN 35:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 35:18" />Rakeli lu-aali wasyafua, (pantu waafwile), waasiile wainika mwana nangue ni Benoni.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">35.18 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Benoni </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Leli liina mu Kiebrania i kulanda nangue </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Mwana wa mubulanda bwane.</char></note> Inzi se waasyele kumwinika Benyamina.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">35.18 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Benyamina </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Leli liina mu Kiebrania i kulanda nangue </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Mwana wa ku kulio kwane.</char></note><verse eid="GEN 35:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 35:19" />Rakeli lu-aafwile waaziikilue mu nzila ya kuya ku Efura. Linge liina lya ozo muzi ni Betlehemu. <verse eid="GEN 35:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 35:20" />Yakobo waimikile lipumpu lya libue lya kulangulukilako pa kilibu. Leli lipumpu lya libue ni lenu kumo lililyakuutua nangue kilibu kyakua Rakeli. <verse eid="GEN 35:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 35:21" />Izraeli waile kwimika liema lyakue ku bunge bwala bwa lupungu lwa Ederi.<verse eid="GEN 35:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baana bena Yakobo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 2:1-2">1 Milandu Ya Nsiku 2.1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 35:22" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">35.22 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 49:4">Kut 49.4</ref> </char>
    </note>Izraeli lu-aali wakiikeele mu kekio kyalo, Rubeni waaleele ni Biliha mukazi mwanike muka Izraeli. Izraeli waunvwile ezio mpunda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 35:22">Baana bena Yakobo baali lyanondo ni babili. <verse eid="GEN 35:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 35:23" />Baana bena Lea meena abo ni aza: Rubeni (libeli wakua Yakobo), ni Simeoni, ni Lawi, ni Yuda, ni Isakari pamo ni Zabuloni. <verse eid="GEN 35:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 35:24" />Baana bena Rakeli meena abo ni aza: Yusufu ni Benyamina. <verse eid="GEN 35:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 35:25" />Baana bena Biliha mubombi wakua Rakeli meena abo ni aza: Dani ni Nafutali. <verse eid="GEN 35:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 35:26" />Baana bena Silipa mubombi wakua Lea meena abo ni aza: Gadi ni Aseri. Babo i baana bena Yakobo baavyaliilue ku Padani-Aramu.<verse eid="GEN 35:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Izaaki wafua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 35:27" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">35.27 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 13:18">Kut 13.18</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yakobo waile kuli se Izaaki ku Mamure pepi ni Kiriati-Arba, i Hebroni, koko kwaali kwaikeele Abrahamu ni Izaaki. <verse eid="GEN 35:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 35:28" />Izaaki waikeele pa kyalo myaka 180. <verse eid="GEN 35:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 35:29" />Izaaki waafwile ni kuya kwikala pamo ni bantu bakue wasyali mukote wa myaka ingi. Waaziikilue na baana bakue babili, Esau ni Yakobo.<verse eid="GEN 35:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="GEN 36" />
  <para style="s1">Nvyalo yakua Esau</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 1:34-37">1 Milandu Ya Nsiku 1.34-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 36:1" />Ezi i mpendua ya bantu ba mu lupua lwakua Esau. (Esau i Edomu). <verse eid="GEN 36:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 36:2" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 26:34">Kut 26.34</ref></char></note>Esau waupile banakazi ba mu Kanaani: Ada mwana mwanakazi mwina Eloni Muhiti i waali mukazi wa mambo. Mukazi wa bubili waali wakuutua Oholibama mwana mwanakazi mwina Ana, mwinzikulu wakua Sibeoni Muhivi. <verse eid="GEN 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 36:3" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:9">Kut 28.9</ref></char></note>Mukazi wa butatu waali wakuutua Basemati mwana mwanakazi mwina Isimaeli, ndumeze kwa Nebayoti. <verse eid="GEN 36:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 36:4" />Ada waavyele, Elifasi. Basemati waavyele, Rueli. <verse eid="GEN 36:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 36:5" />Oholibama waavyele Yeusi ni Yalama pamo ni Kora. Babo bonse baana balalume i baana bena Esau baavyaliilue mu kyalo kya Kanaani.<verse eid="GEN 36:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 36:6" />Esau waatweme bakazi bakue pamo ni baana bakue balalume ni banakazi, pamo ni bantu bonse ba mu nghanda yakue, kabili waatweme biteekua byakue byonse ni bunonsi bonse bu-aanonkele mu kyalo kya Kanaani. Waamusiile mwalawakue Yakobo ni kuya kwikala ku kyalo kinge. <verse eid="GEN 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 36:7" />Ba-aandilue kwikala pamo pantu bunonsi bwabo bwaali bwavulile, kabili mu kyalo kibailemo, temwaali nkendo pantu nama yabo yaali yavulile. <verse eid="GEN 36:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 36:8" />Esau, i Edomu, waile kwikala ku kyalo kya mpili kya Seiri.<verse eid="GEN 36:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 36:9" />Ezi i nvyalo yakua Esau kikolue wa Baedomu ba mu kyalo kya mpili kya Seiri. <verse eid="GEN 36:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 36:10" />Aza i meena a baana balalume bena Esau: Elifasi mwana mwalalume mwina Ada muka Esau. Rueli mwana mwalalume mwina Basemati muka Esau. <verse eid="GEN 36:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 36:11" />Baana balalume bena Elifasi ni baba: Temani, ni Omari, ni Zefo, ni Gatamu pamo ni Kenasi. <verse eid="GEN 36:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 36:12" />Timuna waali mukazi mwanike muka Elifasi mwana mwalalume mwina Esau. Timuna waamuvyaliile Elifasi mwana mwalalume liina lyakue Amaleki. Baba bonse i baana balalume bena Ada muka Esau. <verse eid="GEN 36:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 36:13" />Baana balalume bena Rueli ni baba: Nahati, ni Zera, ni Sama, pamo ni Miza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 36:13">Baba i baana balalume bena Basemati muka Esau.<verse eid="GEN 36:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 36:14" />Baana bena Esau baavyelue na Oholibama mwana mwanakazi mwina Ana, mwinzikulu wakua Zibeoni, baali baana batatu balalumenke. Ni meena abo ni aza: Yeusi, ni Yalamu pamo ni Kora.<verse eid="GEN 36:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 36:15" />Baba i babikolue ba nvyalo yakua Esau. Baana bena Elifasi libeli wakua Esau, meena abo ni aza: Lisiiko Temani, ni Omari, ni Zefo, ni Kenasi, <verse eid="GEN 36:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 36:16" />ni Kora, ni Gatamu, pamo ni Amaleki. Baba i babikolue baafumine kuli Elifasi mu kyalo kya Edomu. Baba i baana balalume bena Ada.<verse eid="GEN 36:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 36:17" />Baana balalume bena Rueli mwana mwalalume mwina Esau, meena abo ni aza: Lisiiko Nahati, ni Zera, ni Sama pamo ni Miza, baba i babikolue baafumine kuli Rueli mu kyalo kya Edomu. Baba i baana balalume bena Basemati muka Esau.<verse eid="GEN 36:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 36:18" />Baana balalume bena Oholibama muka Esau, meena abo ni aza: Lisiiko Yeusi, ni Yalamu pamo ni Kora, baba i babikolue baafumine kuli Oholibama mwana mwanakazi mwina Ana muka Esau. <verse eid="GEN 36:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 36:19" />Babo bonse i baana balalume bena Esau, kabili i babikolue ba Baedomu.<verse eid="GEN 36:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baana balalume ba luvyalo lwakua Seiri</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 1:38-42">1 Milandu Ya Nsiku 1.38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 36:20" />Baana balalume bena Seiri Muhori, bene kyalo, meena abo ni aza: Lotani, ni Sobali, ni Sibeoni, ni Ana, <verse eid="GEN 36:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 36:21" />ni Disoni, ni Ezeri pamo ni Disani. Babo bantu i babikolue baafumine ku Bahori, baana balalume bena Seiri mu kyalo kya Edomu.<verse eid="GEN 36:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 36:22" />Baana balalume bena Lotani, meena abo ni aza: Hori ni Hemamu. Lotani waali ni nkaziize liina lyakue Timuna.<verse eid="GEN 36:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 36:23" />Baana balalume bena Sobali, meena abo ni aza: Alwani, ni Manahati, ni Ebali, ni Sefo pamo ni Onamu.<verse eid="GEN 36:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 36:24" />Baana balalume bena Sibeoni, meena abo ni aza: Aya ni Ana. Ozu Ana i olia waasangile nsulo ya menda a mwenzi mu kaseeba lu-aali wasunga punda yakua se Sibeoni. <verse eid="GEN 36:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 36:25" />Meena a baana bena Ana ni aza: Disoni ni Oholibama waali mwana mwanakazi mwina Ana. <verse eid="GEN 36:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 36:26" />Baana balalume bena Disoni, meena abo ni aza: Hemudani, ni Esibani, ni Itirani pamo ni Kerani.<verse eid="GEN 36:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 36:27" />Baana balalume bena Ezeri, meena abo ni aza: Bilihani, ni Zawani pamo ni Akana.<verse eid="GEN 36:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 36:28" />Baana balalume bena Disani, meena abo ni aza: Uzi ni Arani.<verse eid="GEN 36:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 36:29" />Babikolue baafumine mu Bahori, meena abo ni aza: Lotani, ni Sobali, ni Sibeoni, ni Ana, <verse eid="GEN 36:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 36:30" />ni Disoni, ni Ezeri, pamo ni Disani. Baba i babikolue ba Bahori, kukonkana ni mikowa yabo mu kyalo kya Seiri.<verse eid="GEN 36:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Makolo a ku Edomu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 1:43-54">1 Milandu Ya Nsiku 1.43-54</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 36:31" />Baba i bamakolo baateekele mu kyalo kya Edomu lukwaali tekunabe likolo ku Baizraeli.<verse eid="GEN 36:31" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 36:32" />Bela mwana mwalalume mwina Beori waateekele mu Edomu. Liina lya muzi wakue lyaali lyakuutua Dinihaba. <verse eid="GEN 36:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 36:33" />Bela lu-aafwile, Yobabu mwana mwalalume mwina Zera wa ku Bosera waateekele pa kifuka kyakue.<verse eid="GEN 36:33" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 36:34" />Yobabu lu-aafwile,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="GEN 36:34">Husamu wa ku kyalo kya Batemani waateekele pa kifuka kyakue. <verse eid="GEN 36:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 36:35" />Husamu lu-aafwile,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="GEN 36:35">Hadadi mwana mwalalume mwina Bedadi, waumine Bamidiani mu bukaba bwakua Moabu, waateekele pa kifuka kyakue. Ozo muzi waali wakuutua Awiti. <verse eid="GEN 36:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 36:36" />Hadadi lu-aafwile,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="GEN 36:36">Samula wa ku Masireka, waateekele pa kifuka kyakue. <verse eid="GEN 36:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 36:37" />Samula lu-aafwile, Sauli wa ku Rehoboti ili mumbali mwenzi, waateekele pa kifuka kyakue. <verse eid="GEN 36:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 36:38" />Sauli lu-aafwile,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="GEN 36:38">Bali-Hanani mwana mwalalume mwina Akibori, waateekele pa kifuka kyakue. <verse eid="GEN 36:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 36:39" />Bali-Hanani mwana mwalalume mwina Akibori lu-aafwile,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="GEN 36:39">Hadari waateekele pa kifuka kyakue. Liina lya muzi wakue lyaali lyakuutua Pau, ni liina lya mukazi wakue lyaali lyakuutua Mehetabeli mwana mwanakazi mwina Matiredi, ni Matiredi ni ye waali mwana mwanakazi mwina Me-Zahaba.<verse eid="GEN 36:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 36:40" />Babikolue baafumine kuli Esau mu lupua lwabo ni mu nkendo yabo, meena abo ni aza: Timuna, ni Alwa, ni Yeteti, <verse eid="GEN 36:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 36:41" />ni Oholibama, ni Ela, ni Pinoni, <verse eid="GEN 36:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 36:42" />ni Kenasi, ni Temani, ni Mibusari, <verse eid="GEN 36:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 36:43" />ni Magdieli pamo ni Irama. Baba i baali babikolue ba Baedomu baali baikeele mu kyalo kibaapeelue. Esau i kikolue wa Baedomu.<verse eid="GEN 36:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="GEN 37" />
  <para style="s1">Yusufu ni bakuluube</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 37:1" />Yakobo waatwaliliile kwikala mu kyalo kya Kanaani, momo mwaali mwaikeele se nga mweni. <verse eid="GEN 37:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 37:2" />Lyasi lyakua Yakobo ni leli.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 37:2">Yusufu lu-aali wakili na myaka lyanondo ni kilooba, waali wasunga mikooko ni mbuzi, kabili waali wali pamo ni bakuluube bena Biliha ni Silipa, bakazi bakua Yakobo. Yusufu waile kumubwila se bintu bibiipile byaali byakita bakuluube.<verse eid="GEN 37:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 37:3" />Inzi Izraeli waali wamutoneesie Yusufu kukila bange baana bonse pantu waali mwana wa mu bukote, kabili waamukitiile nkanzu ya mikumino ilekenkeene. <verse eid="GEN 37:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 37:4" />Bakuluube lubaamwene nangue Yusufu waali watonenue kukila bange bonse, baamusuulile sana mpaka balekela ni kulanda nakue bwino bwino.<verse eid="GEN 37:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 37:5" />Busiku bumo Yusufu waalootele kilooto kimo. Lu-aile kubwilako bakuluube kilooto kyakue, baakilile kumusuula. <verse eid="GEN 37:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 37:6" />Yusufu waalandile evi, “Emwe, unvue kilooto kinalootanga. <verse eid="GEN 37:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 37:7" />Twile twalimukukaka bisi bya nghano mu bukaba, kisi kyane kyabuukanga ni kwimana misiki, inzi bisi byenu byaimananga byazyungulukiile kisi kyane ni kukikontamina.”<verse eid="GEN 37:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 37:8" />Bakuluube baamwipuziizie evi, “Eba, umwene nangue wewe i wakaba kututeeka ao kuya wali ni buvinde pali fwefue?” Kabili baakilile sie kumusuula pa mulandu wa bilooto byakue ni pa mulandu wa bintu bi-aali walanda.<verse eid="GEN 37:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 37:9" />Kabili Yusufu waalootele ni kinge kilooto ni kubabwila bakuluube nangue, “Emwe, kabili nalootanga ni kinge kilooto. Namonanga koba ni kwezi pamo ni ntanda lyanondo ni lumo byankontamina.”<verse eid="GEN 37:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 37:10" />Inzi lu-aabwilileko se pamo ni bakuluube, se waamusasiliile wamwana nangue, “Eba, i kilooto kya musangoki keki kiwalootanga? Ulangakeene nangue noko ni nene pamo ni bakuluubo bonse twaakeeza kukukontamina?” <verse eid="GEN 37:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 37:11" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:9">Mii 7.9</ref></char></note>Bakuluube kwa Yusufu baamunvwiliile sana bunkua, inzi se waatwaliliile sie kuya walangakana palua bebio bilooto.<verse eid="GEN 37:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yusufu wasisiiwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 37:12" />Busiku bumo bakuluube baile ku Sekemu ku kusunga mikooko yakua sibo. <verse eid="GEN 37:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 37:13" />Izraeli waamwanine Yusufu, “Unvua, bakuluubo balimukusunga mikooko ku Sekemu.” Ale iza nkutume uye wayako.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 37:13">Yusufu waalandile evi, “We tawe, kili sie bwino, kuti naya.”<verse eid="GEN 37:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 37:14" />Se waamwanine evi, “Ale endo waya umone kine bakuluubo bakosele, uye umone ni mikooko kine ili bwino, mane uye wize un'mbwile.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 37:14">Evi i vyaatuminue Yusufu na se kufuma mu lulambe lwa Hebroni kuya ku Sekemu. <verse eid="GEN 37:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 37:15" />Muntu umo waamusangile walimukwenda mu kisonso. Ozo muntu waamwipuziizie Yusufu, “Ewe, ulimukukebaki?”<verse eid="GEN 37:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 37:16" />Yusufu wa-asukile evi, “Ndimukukeba bakuluamwine. Kuti wanangilila kubalimukusungila mikooko yabo?”<verse eid="GEN 37:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 37:17" />Ozo muntu waamwanine evi, “Pano baafumangapo kale, pantu naunvwanga balimukulanda nangue, ‘Twende ku Dotana.’” Kupwako, Yusufu wabakonka ni kuya kubasanga ku Dotana.<verse eid="GEN 37:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 37:18" />Bakuluube baamumwene walimukwiza lwa kule. Lu-aali tanafike papo pa baali, baunvwene kuti bamwipaye. <verse eid="GEN 37:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 37:19" />Baalandile evi, “Mone kaloota wa bilooto olia alimukwiza! <verse eid="GEN 37:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 37:20" />Ale tumwipaye ni kumupooza mu kiina kimo kya pa biina. Twaya tulande sie nangue bamwipayanga na kinama, evi tumone kine bilooto byakue byaakakitaki.”<verse eid="GEN 37:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 37:21" />Rubeni lu-aunvwile balanda evio, waamupokolwele walanda nangue, “Emwe, tekuti tumwipaye, <verse eid="GEN 37:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 37:22" />tekumukisie, inzi mupooze sie mu keki kiina kili mono mu kaseeba pasili kumukita kantu.” Mapange akua Rubeni aali a kuti aye eze amutwame ni kumutwala kuli se. <verse eid="GEN 37:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 37:23" />Yusufu lu-aafikile papo paali bakuluube, baamuvuulile nkanzu yakue ya mikumino ilekenkeene i-aali wavwele, <verse eid="GEN 37:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 37:24" />bamutwama ni kuya kumupooza mu kiina kyaali kyakaminemo menda.<verse eid="GEN 37:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 37:25" />Lubaikeele kuti balie, baamwene libumba lya Baisimaeli basulu pamo ni nghamia yabo, baali batweme manukato ni zeri ni manemane balimukukookela ku Misri. <verse eid="GEN 37:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 37:26" />Yuda waabaanine bakuluube, “Emwe, unvue! Kine twamwipaya mwalawetu ni kuzuumia mulopa wakue tulikunonkapoki? <verse eid="GEN 37:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 37:27" />Nene namona sie kuti tumusisie ku Baisimaeli pasili kumukisia pantu ni mwalawetu, kabili tuli sie nakue mubili umo ni mulopa umo.” Ba kwakue baamwitabiizie. <verse eid="GEN 37:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 37:28" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37.28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:9">Mii 7.9</ref></char></note>Basulu ba Bamidiani lubaali balimukupita lya papo, bakuluube baamufumiizie mu kiina ni kumusisia ku Baisimaeli na nfolanga 20. Babo bantu baamutweme ni kuya nakue ku Misri.<verse eid="GEN 37:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 37:29" />Rubeni lu-aabwelele ni kusanga Yusufu tekuba wali mu kiina, waunvwile bulanda bukata ni kuzabula ngubo yakue. <verse eid="GEN 37:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 37:30" />Waile kwaali kwali balabakue ni kubaana nangue, “Emwe, Yusufu mu kiina talimo! Ndikukita syani?”<verse eid="GEN 37:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 37:31" />Baabuulile nkanzu ni kutubia mu mulopa wa kapwata kabaipaile. <verse eid="GEN 37:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 37:32" />Baatweme nkanzu ya mikumino ilekenkeene ni kuya kumutwalila sibo balanda nangue, “We tawe, twatoolanga ezi ngubo! Monanke kine ni yakua mwana obe ao abe.”<verse eid="GEN 37:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 37:33" />Se wainikile ni kulanda nangue, “Ezi ni ngubo yakua mwana wane, waliiwanga na kinama. Kisinka Yusufu waazanghununwanga bipusa bipusa!” <verse eid="GEN 37:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 37:34" />Yakobo waazabwile ngubo yakue ni kuvwala lisaaka mu kitungu. Waamulilile mwana wakue nsiku ingi. <verse eid="GEN 37:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 37:35" />Baana bakue bonse, balalume pamo ni banakazi, baile kumutalazia, inzi wene waakeene kutalaziwa. Waalandile evi, “Nakaana. Nene nakaba kufua nalimukulila ni kuziikua pepi ni mwana wane.” Ni pakako, waatwaliliile sie kumulila mwana wakue Yusufu.<verse eid="GEN 37:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 37:36" />Balia Bamidiani baile kumusisia Yusufu ku Misri kuli Potifari kiloolo wakua Farao, kabili i waali kiloolo wa bakalinda.<verse eid="GEN 37:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="GEN 38" />
  <para style="s1">Kibalo kyakua Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 38:1" />Pa ozo musita Yuda waasiile bakuluube ni kuya kwikala na muntu umo wa ku Adulamu liina lyakue Hira. <verse eid="GEN 38:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 38:2" />Yuda waamweneko mukazyana mwina Mukanaani umo liina lyakue Sua, waamuupile ni kukumana nakue. <verse eid="GEN 38:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 38:3" />Ozo mwanakazi waimitile ni kuvyala mwana mwalalume ni kumwinika Eri. <verse eid="GEN 38:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 38:4" />Kabili waimitile, wavyala unge mwana mwalalume ni kumwinika Onanu. <verse eid="GEN 38:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 38:5" />Lu-aimitile lya butatu, waavyele unge mwana mwalalume ni kumwinika Sela. Ozo mwana lu-aavyelue, Yuda wali ku Kezibu.<verse eid="GEN 38:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 38:6" />Pa kyamba, Yuda waakebele mwanakazi wa kuupua na mwana wakue libeli liina lyakue Eri. Ozo mukazyana waali wakuutua Tamari. <verse eid="GEN 38:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 38:7" />Inzi Eri, libeli wakua Yuda, waali wali mubi ku menso akua Yawe. Ni pakako, Yawe waamwipaile. <verse eid="GEN 38:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 38:8" />Yuda waamwanine Onanu, “We mwana wane, pyana ozu mwanakazi muka Eri evi umuvyalile wa kobe baana.” <verse eid="GEN 38:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 38:9" />Inzi Onanu waamanine nangue baana tebakaba bakue. Ni pakako, lu-aali walaala na ozo mwanakazi, waali waitilila mbezu ya buvyazi pansi watiina kumuvyalila wa kwakue baana. <verse eid="GEN 38:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 38:10" />Yawe taawamiinue na misango yaakitile Onanu. Ni pakako, ni ye waamwipaile. <verse eid="GEN 38:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 38:11" />Yuda waamwanine Tamari muka mwana wakue nangue, “Ikala mu bumukanfwilua mu nghanda yakua so wapembeele mpaka musita waakakula mwana wane mwalalume Sela.” Ki-aalandiile evio, waali watiina nangue Sela ni ye kuti wafua nga vyaafwile bakuluube. Kupwako, Tamari wabwelela ku nghanda yakua se.<verse eid="GEN 38:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 38:12" />Lupaapitile myaka ingi, muka Yuda, mwana mwanakazi mwina Sua, waafwile. Malilo lu-aapwile, Yuda ni kibuza wakue Hira wa ku Adulamu, baile ku Timuna kwaali kwatebulua mikooko yakue. <verse eid="GEN 38:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 38:13" />Muntu umo waile kumubwila Tamari nangue sevyala waya kutebula mikooko yakue ku Timuna. <verse eid="GEN 38:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 38:14" />Tamari waavuulile ngubo yakue ya bumukanfwilua, waikupa kitambala ni kwikala pa mulyango wa nghingililo ya muzi wa Enaimu waali mumbali musebo uwile ku Timuna. Waakitile evi pantu waali wamanine nangue Sela mwana mwalalume mwina Yuda waali wasyakulile, kabili pantu tanapeelue Sela kuba mulume wakue.<verse eid="GEN 38:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 38:15" />Yuda lu-aapitiile paali paikeele Tamari, waalangakeene nangue ozo mwanakazi waali wali mukambue pantu waali waikupile pa menso. <verse eid="GEN 38:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 38:16" />Waamukonkele mumbali musebo ni kumwana nangue, “Nene natona kuti ndaale nobe.” Taali wamanine nangue i waali muka mwana wakue.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:16">Ozo mwanakazi waamwipuziizie evi, “Kine walaala ni nene ulikun'mpeelaki?”<verse eid="GEN 38:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 38:17" />Waamwasukile, “Nakaba kukupeela musoka wa mbuzi wa pa kisepe kyane.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:17">Mwanakazi waamwanine evi, “Ale kansi n'mpeele kikwatizi kya kuti nsyale nakio mpaka paukantumina ozo mbuzi.”<verse eid="GEN 38:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 38:18" />Mwalalume waipuziizie evi, “Ale ndikukusiila kikwatiziki?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:18">Mwanakazi waalandile evi, “Ulikunsiila kazele ka kumunue ni lwando pamo ni kabango kauliwaendelako.” Kupwako wamupeela. Lu-aaleele nakue, mwanakazi waimitile. <verse eid="GEN 38:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 38:19" />Kupwako, wabuuka waya, waivimbula kitambala kyakue ni kuvwala paakale ngubo ya bumukanfwilua.<verse eid="GEN 38:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 38:20" />Yuda waamutumine kibuza wakue Muadulamu kuti aye atwale mbuzi kuli ozo mwanakazi ni kupoka bintu bi-aasiileko, inzi taamusangile. <verse eid="GEN 38:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 38:21" />Waipuziizie bantu bamo ba ku Enaimu, “Emwe, olia mukambue waali waikeele papa mumbali musebo ali pi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:21">Baamwasukile nangue, “Pano tetunamonepo mukambue.”<verse eid="GEN 38:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 38:22" />Waabweleele kuli Yuda. Waamwanine evi, “Nsyamusanghanga. Ni bantu ba koko banghananga nangue pano tetunamonepo mukambue.”<verse eid="GEN 38:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 38:23" />Yuda waalandile evi, “Muleke sie asyale ni bikwatizi. Tetutonene kusekua na bantu. Namutuminanga mbuzi, inzi we tewamusanghanga.”<verse eid="GEN 38:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 38:24" />Lupaapitile myezi itatu, muntu umo waizile kumubwila Yuda nangue, “Tamari muka mwana obe waakikita bukambue, kabili ali ni liimi lya mu bukambue.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:24">Yuda waalandile evi, “Ozo mwanakazi aziziiwe mu mulilo afue.”<verse eid="GEN 38:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 38:25" />Ozo mwanakazi lu-aali walimukutwalua, waatumine muntu umo kuli sevyala aye amwane nangue, “Nene nghimisiiziwe na mwine wa bebi bintu. Waalandile evi, ‘Nakulomba winike mwine wa kaka kazele ka ku munue ni lwando pamo ni kabango.’”<verse eid="GEN 38:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 38:26" />Yuda lu-aabiinikile, waalandile evi, “Ozu mwanakazi ali ni nsambu kukila nene, pantu nsyamupeele Sela mwana wane amuupe.” Ni pakako, taaleele nakue kabili.<verse eid="GEN 38:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 38:27" />Musita wakuvyala luwakumeene, kyaamwenekele nangue alikuvyala bampundu. <verse eid="GEN 38:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 38:28" />Misa luyaamukwete, mwana umo waafumiizie kuboko. Kinghombe waakakile nyunzi ya kasi ku kuboko. Waalandile evi, “Ozu i wa mambo.” <verse eid="GEN 38:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 38:29" />Inzi lu-aabweziizie kuboko, mwinakue waavyelue. Kinghombe waalandile evi, “Wewe i waizula nzila.” Ni pakako, ozo mwana wainikilue Perezi. <verse eid="GEN 38:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 38:30" />Mwinakue waakakilue nyunzi ya kasi ku kuboko lu-aavyelue, wainikilue Zera.<verse eid="GEN 38:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="GEN 39" />
  <para style="s1">Yusufu wamukaana muka Potifari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 39:1" />Yusufu waatwelue ku Misri. Potifari wa ku Misri, kiloolo wakua likolo, mukulu wa bakalinda, i waamusitile Yusufu ku Baisimaeli baamutwele koko. <verse eid="GEN 39:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 39:2" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:9">Mii 7.9</ref></char></note>Yawe waali pamo ni Yusufu ni kumupaala mu byonse bi-aali wakita mu nghanda yakua selenzi Mumisri. <verse eid="GEN 39:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 39:3" />Potifari wainikile nangue Yawe waali wali pamo ni Yusufu, kabili nangue waali wapaalilue mu byonse bi-aali wakita. <verse eid="GEN 39:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 39:4" />Potifari waawamiinue sana mpaka wamupeela Yusufu mwilo wa kulabukila nghanda yakue pamo ni bintu byonse bi-aali nabio. <verse eid="GEN 39:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 39:5" />Kutula musita u-aabiikilue kuba ndabukizi wa mu nghanda yakua Potifari ni wa bintu byonse bi-aali nabio, Yawe waapaalile nghanda yakua Potifari pa mulandu wakua Yusufu, ni kupaala bintu byonse bi-aali nabio mu nghanda ni mu makaba. <verse eid="GEN 39:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 39:6" />Waasiile bintu byonse mu maboko akua Yusufu, kabili taapoozeleko maano ku bintu byakue, inga sie ku bilio bi-aali walia</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 39:6">Ni Yusufu waali ni mibeele iweme, ni lukebu lwaweme. <verse eid="GEN 39:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 39:7" />Pa kyamba kya bebi byonse, muka Potifari waamutokeemue Yusufu ni kumwana alaale nakue. <verse eid="GEN 39:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 39:8" />Inzi wene waakeene wamwana muka Potifari nangue, “Potifari tamanine bintu bindi nabio mono mu nghanda, wene an'mpeele nsambu ya kusunga byonse. <verse eid="GEN 39:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 39:9" />Mu eno nghanda temuli unge ankilile pa nsambu in'mpeelue, kabili n'mpeelue nsambu pa bintu byonse kufumiako sie wewe pantu uli mukazi wakue. Ale ndikukitilaki kintu kibiipile evi ni kumuluvia Leza?” <verse eid="GEN 39:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 39:10" />Anzia kine waali wamukebakeba sie kubalua busiku, wene taamwitabiizie kuti alaale nakue ao kuba pamo nakue.<verse eid="GEN 39:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 39:11" />Busiku bumo Yusufu lu-aingiile mu nghanda mu kubomba miilo yakue, ozo musita mu nghanda temwaali ata mubombi unge. <verse eid="GEN 39:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 39:12" />Muka Potifari waamukwete ku ngubo wamwana nangue, “Iza ulaala ni nene!” Yusufu waifompwele, wabutukila panze ni kumusia wakwete ngubo yakue. <verse eid="GEN 39:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 39:13" />Muka Potifari lu-aamwene nangue Yusufu wabutukila panze, ni ye wasyala sie wakwete ngubo yakua Yusufu mu minue, <verse eid="GEN 39:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 39:14" />waapundile wakuuta bantu ba mu nghanda yakue wabaana nangue, “Mone, waaleetele Muebrania kono kwetu kuti atuleebule! Wakiba waumiine kulaala ni nene, inzi nene nasamunanga na maka, <verse eid="GEN 39:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 39:15" />ni ye lu-aunvwanga nasamuna, wabutukilanga panze ni kunsiila ngubo yakue.”<verse eid="GEN 39:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 39:16" />Muka Potifari waasungile ngubo yakua Yusufu mpaka lwaizile mulume wakue. <verse eid="GEN 39:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 39:17" />Waamwanine mulume wakue lyasi lyonse nangue, “Ozu Muebrania muzia uwaatuleeteele, wakinghingilila wakebele kulaala ni nene. <verse eid="GEN 39:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 39:18" />Inzi lunakisamuna, wakibutukila panze ni kunsiila ngubo yakue.”<verse eid="GEN 39:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 39:19" />Mulume wakue Potifari lu-aunvwile bi-aabwililue na mukazi wakue nangue i vyakikita mubombi wakue, waafiitilue sana. <verse eid="GEN 39:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 39:20" />Potifari waamutweme ni kumukaka mu buloko mwaali mwakakilue bakakua bakua likolo. <verse eid="GEN 39:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 39:21" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39.21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:9">Mii 7.9</ref></char></note>Inzi Yawe waali wali pamo ni Yusufu ni kumulangisia ntono yakue ikata, evi mukulu wa buloko aye wawamiinue na Yusufu. <verse eid="GEN 39:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 39:22" />Kalinda wa buloko waamupeele Yusufu bukulu pa bakakua bonse, ni byonse bibaali bakita papo, wene i waali watantika. <verse eid="GEN 39:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 39:23" />Kalinda wa buloko taapoozeleko maano ku bintu byaali byatantika Yusufu pantu Yawe waali wali pamo nakue. Ni byonse bi-aali wakita, Yawe waali wabipaalile.<verse eid="GEN 39:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="GEN 40" />
  <para style="s1">Yusufu walondolola bilooto bya bakakua nakue</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 40:1" />Bebi byonse lubyaapitile, muntu waali wapeelue nsambu ya kupeela likolo divai, ni olia kaapika wa mikate baamuluviizie Farao, likolo wa ku Misri. <verse eid="GEN 40:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 40:2" />Farao waabafiitiilue babo babiloolo babili, mukulu wa balia bapeelue nsambu ya kupeela likolo divai, ni mukulu wa bakaapika ba mikate. <verse eid="GEN 40:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 40:3" />Waabatumine kuya kusungua mu buloko mu nghanda ya mukulu wa bakalinda, momo mwaali mwakakilue Yusufu. <verse eid="GEN 40:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 40:4" />Mukulu wa buloko waamwanine Yusufu kuti aye wali mubombi wa babo babiloolo babili. Waabasuungile, ni bo baikeelemo musita uniini.<verse eid="GEN 40:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 40:5" />Busiku bumo busiku, babo bakakua babili, mukulu wa bakateania ba divai ni mukulu wa bakaapika ba mikate baali babombela likolo wa ku Misri, kubalua muntu waalootele kilooto kyaali ni ndubulwilo iibeeleele. <verse eid="GEN 40:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 40:6" />Yusufu lu-aile kubamona lukeelekeele, waabamwene baali ni bulanda. <verse eid="GEN 40:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 40:7" />Waipuziizie balia babiloolo babili bakua Farao baali bakakilue pamo nakue mu nghanda yakua Potifari nangue, “Ale lelo mumwenekeeleki mwali ni bulanda?”<verse eid="GEN 40:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 40:8" />Baamwasukile nangue, “Fwefue twalootanga kubalua muntu kilooto kyakue, ni evi tetuli na muntu wa kutulondolwela.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 40:8">Yusufu waabaanine evi, “Eba, Leza te i ali ni buvinde bwa kulondolola bilooto? Ale n'mbwile vimwalootanga.”<verse eid="GEN 40:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 40:9" />Mukulu wa bakateania ba divai waamwanine Yusufu kilooto kyakue, “Nene nalootanga muzabibu waimeene ku ntanzi yane. <verse eid="GEN 40:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 40:10" />Ku ozo muzabibu kwakiba misambo itatu. Penka papo maani atomba kale, buluba ni bo bwatoota, ni bisansa bya mizabibu ni byo byapia. <verse eid="GEN 40:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 40:11" />Namonanga nakwete kikombe kyakua Farao, nabuula mizabibu, nafininamo ni kuya kumupeela Farao.”<verse eid="GEN 40:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 40:12" />Yusufu waalandile evi, “Elia misambo itatu, i nsiku itatu. <verse eid="GEN 40:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 40:13" />Nsiku itatu paikaba kupua, Farao wakaba kukufumia mu buloko, ni kukubweziizia mwilo obe u waali wabomba. Wewe wakaba kumupeela Farao kikombe kya divai mu minue nga viwaali wamupeela pa mambo luwaali wali kateania wa divai. <verse eid="GEN 40:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 40:14" />Inzi ukaananguluke paukapaalua, kabili tekukalaba kunandilako kuli Farao evi ni nene nkakakulue mono mu buloko. <verse eid="GEN 40:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 40:15" />Pantu kisinka lunaali ku kyalo kyetu kya Baebrania, naibilue. Kabili ni mono mwenka mu Misri nkakilue mu buloko tekuba nali na mulandu.”<verse eid="GEN 40:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 40:16" />Mukulu wa bakaapika ba mikate lu-aunvwile ndubulwilo ya kilooto yaweme, waamwanine Yusufu nangue, “Ni nene wenka nalootanga naitwikile bipanda bitatu bya mikate. <verse eid="GEN 40:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 40:17" />Mu kipanda kya pa muulu mwaba mwali bilio byapikilue bya misango ilekekeene byakua Farao, mu kekio kipanda mwakookelanga tooni twaizanga kulia ezio mikate.”<verse eid="GEN 40:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 40:18" />Yusufu waamwanine evi, “Ndubulwilo ya kilooto ni ezi: Bipanda bitatu i nsiku itatu. <verse eid="GEN 40:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 40:19" />Nsiku itatu paikaba kupua, Farao wakaba kuputula mutue ni kukulika mubili obe ku kimuti evi tooni tukabe ku kulia.”<verse eid="GEN 40:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 40:20" />Busiku bwa butatu bwa nsikunkulu ya kuvyalua kwakua Farao, Farao waabatebetele babombi bakue bonse. Mukulu wa bakateania ba bya kumina ni mukulu wa bakaapika ba mikate baakakwilue ni kuleetua pa ntanzi yakua Farao, ni pa ntanzi ya babombi bakue. <verse eid="GEN 40:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 40:21" />Mukulu wa bakateania ba bya kumina waabweziiziwe pa mwilo wakue, evi atendeke kumutwalila Farao kikombe. <verse eid="GEN 40:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 40:22" />Inzi mukulu wa bakaapika ba mikate waakulikilue. Byonse byaakitikile nga mwaalandiile Yusufu. <verse eid="GEN 40:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 40:23" />Inzi mukulu wa bakateania ba bya kumina taamulangulukile Yusufu. Waamulabile.<verse eid="GEN 40:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 40" />
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="GEN 41" />
  <para style="s1">Yusufu walondolola kilooto kyakua likolo Farao</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 41:1" />Ku mpeleezio ya myaka ibili, Farao waalootele waimeene mumbali Mwenzi wa Nile. <verse eid="GEN 41:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 41:2" />Waamwene nghombe kilooba iweme yainine yalimukufuma mu mwenzi. Luyaafumine, yaatendekele kulia bikusi. <verse eid="GEN 41:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 41:3" />Kabili waamwene inge nghombe kilooba yalimukufuma mu mwenzi. Nghombe yabiipile kabili yaondele. Ezio nghombe yaizile kwimana pepi na inge nghombe mumbali mwenzi. <verse eid="GEN 41:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 41:4" />Nghombe iinine yaweme yaatelekelue na nghombe yondele yabiipile. Mu kumona sie evio, Farao wasantamuka. <verse eid="GEN 41:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 41:5" />Farao waaleele paakale ni kuloota kinge kilooto. Waamwene misokoti kilooba ya nghano iweme yatanine yali ku kamuti kamo ka nghano. <verse eid="GEN 41:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 41:6" />Kabili waamwene, misokoti kilooba ya nghano yondele yapukilue na mwela wa ku kabanga. <verse eid="GEN 41:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 41:7" />Misokoti kilooba yaatelekele misokoti ya nghano yaali yatanine. Farao lu-aasantamukile, wainikile nangue waali walimukuloota. <verse eid="GEN 41:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 41:8" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41.8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 2:2">Dan 2.2</ref></char></note>Lubwaakiile, Farao waatoobokele. Waatumine bantu ba kuya kukuuta nghanga ni bantu ba maano ba mu Misri. Waababwilile kilooto kyakue, inzi tekwaali muntu waamulondolweleele.<verse eid="GEN 41:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 41:9" />Muntu waali wapeelue nsambu ya kupeela likolo divai waamwanine Farao, “Nene nalanguluka bilubo byane lelo. <verse eid="GEN 41:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 41:10" />Musita umo Farao waafiitiilue babombi bakue, wankakile mu nghanda ya mukulu wa bakalinda, nene pamo ni mukulu wa bakaapika ba mikate. <verse eid="GEN 41:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 41:11" />Busiku bumo fwe babili twaalootele kubalua muntu kilooto kili ni bulondolozi bwakue. <verse eid="GEN 41:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 41:12" />Kwaali mulumendo umo Muebrania utwaali twakakilue nakue, mubombi wakua mukulu wa bakalinda. Lutwaamwanine bilooto byetu, kubalua muntu waalondolweleelue ndubulwilo ya kilooto kyakue. <verse eid="GEN 41:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 41:13" />Byonse bi-aalandile byaatukitikiile. Wewe wan'mbweziizie nene pa mwilo wane, inzi mukulu wa bakaapika ba mikate wewe waamukulikile.”<verse eid="GEN 41:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 41:14" />Farao waatumine muntu wa kuya kumutwama Yusufu. Penka papo wakakulua kale mu buloko. Lu-aatebwilue misisi ni kuvwala ngubo yakue, waile kwimana ntanzi yakua Farao. <verse eid="GEN 41:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 41:15" />Farao waamwanine Yusufu, “Nakiloota bilooto, ni bebi bilooto bantu bakyandua kubilondolola. Inzi nakyunvua nangue wewe kuti wavinda kubilondolola.”<verse eid="GEN 41:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 41:16" />Yusufu waamwasukile Farao, “Nene na maano ane nsivinda, inga sie Leza mwine i alikumulondolwela Farao ndubulwilo ya kiine.”<verse eid="GEN 41:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 41:17" />Farao waalandile evi, “Nene nakiloota naimeene mumbali mwenzi. <verse eid="GEN 41:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 41:18" />Nakimona nghombe kilooba iweme yainine yalimukufuma mu mwenzi. Luyakifuma, yakitendeka kulia bikusi. <verse eid="GEN 41:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 41:19" />Kabili nakimona inge nghombe kilooba yondele itope yabiipile yalimukufuma mu mwenzi. Mono mu Misri nsinamonemo nghombe yondele nga ezio. <verse eid="GEN 41:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 41:20" />Nghombe yondele yabiipile yaatelekele nghombe kilooba ya mambo yaali yainine. <verse eid="GEN 41:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 41:21" />Luyaatelekele ezio nghombe, teyaamanikile nangue i yatelekanga nghombe iinine, inzi yaali yamwenekele sie yabiipile nga viyaali pa mambo. Kupwako, nasantamuka. <verse eid="GEN 41:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 41:22" />Kabili nakiloota misokoti kilooba ya nghano yatanine yaweme yaali yasyakosele yatweme ku kamuti kamo ka nghano. <verse eid="GEN 41:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 41:23" />Kabili nakimona misokoti kilooba ya nghano yondele yapukilue na mwela wa ku kabanga. <verse eid="GEN 41:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 41:24" />Nghano yaali yaondele yaatelekele misokoti kilooba iweme. Nakilootolwela banghanga, inzi tekuli muntu wakinondolwela ndubulwilo.”<verse eid="GEN 41:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 41:25" />Yusufu waamwanine Farao nangue, “Bebi bilooto byobe ni bimonke sie. Leza wakikulangisia vi-aliwakaba kukita pa kyamba kya musita uniini. <verse eid="GEN 41:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 41:26" />Elia nghombe kilooba iweme, i myaka kilooba, ni elia misokoti kilooba ya nghano iweme, ni yo i myaka kilooba. Bebi bilooto byonse ni bimonke sie. <verse eid="GEN 41:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 41:27" />Elia nghombe kilooba yondele ni ibiipile yaafumine pa kyamba kya inge, i myaka kilooba, ni elia misokoti kilooba musili kantu, i myaka kilooba ya nzala. <verse eid="GEN 41:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 41:28" />Kaka i keebo kanamwana Farao, Leza wakimulangisia Farao vi-aliwakaba kukita pa kyamba kya nsiku iniini. <verse eid="GEN 41:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 41:29" />Unvua, myaka kilooba mu Misri mwaakaba bya kulia bingi, <verse eid="GEN 41:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 41:30" />ni inge myaka kilooba yaakakonkapo, mwaakaba nzala. Ni bantu bonse baakalaba nangue mu kyalo kya Misri mwaali ni bya kulia bingi, pantu ezio nzala yaakeenoona kyalo. <verse eid="GEN 41:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 41:31" />Ni pakako, bwingi bwa bilio tebukalangulukua mu kyalo pantu ezio nzala yaakeeza, yaakaba yakilile kubiipa. <verse eid="GEN 41:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 41:32" />Keki kilooto kyakua Farao kikibweleele libili, ni pa mulandu wa kusininkizia mapange akaba kukitua na Leza pa kyamba kya nsiku iniini.<verse eid="GEN 41:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 41:33" />“Ni pakako, Farao akebe muntu wa maano ni mulangue wakuti abe ndabukizi wa kyalo kya Misri. <verse eid="GEN 41:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 41:34" />Kabili asaakwilepo ni bange babiloolo bakuti baye babiika kimo kya pa bisaano bya pa buzombozi bwa mu myaka kilooba ya bilio mu kyalo kya Misri, <verse eid="GEN 41:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 41:35" />bakolonghanie buzombozi mu eno myaka iweme ilimukwiza ni kuziba bobo buzombozi mu matala a mu mizi ni kubusunga. <verse eid="GEN 41:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 41:36" />Bebi bilio byaakasungua mu kyalo mu myaka kilooba ya nzala yaakaba mu kyalo kya Misri, evi kyalo tekuti kikeenoonue na nzala.”<verse eid="GEN 41:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yusufu wa-aluka ndabukizi mu Misri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 41:37" />Farao pamo ni babiloolo bakue bonse baawamiinue sana na bobo bulanzi. <verse eid="GEN 41:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 41:38" />Farao waipuziizie evi, “Ati, kubako ni kiine kuti twasanga unge muntu nga ozu ali ni Mweo wakua Leza?” <verse eid="GEN 41:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 41:39" />Farao waamwanine Yusufu, “Tekuli unge ali ni maano ni mulangue nga wewe, pantu wewe i wakifyulilua na Leza totu twebo tonse. <verse eid="GEN 41:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 41:40" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41.40: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:10">Mii 7.10</ref></char></note>Ni pakako, wewe wenka i waakaba mukulu pa nghanda yane, ni bulanzi bobe bwaakanakilua na bantu bane bonse. Inzi naakaba mukulu wa kyalo kyonse kukila wewe.” <verse eid="GEN 41:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 41:41" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41.41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 5:29">Dan 5.29</ref></char></note>Farao waamwanine Yusufu, “Mona nakubiika kuba mukulu wa kyalo kyonse kya Misri.” <verse eid="GEN 41:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 41:42" />Farao waavuulile kazele kakue ka kalangi ni kumuvwika Yusufu ku munue, waamuvwika ni ngubo ya kitani kiweme, kabili wabuula ni mukufu wa oro wamuvwika mu mukosi. <verse eid="GEN 41:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 41:43" />Yusufu waaseziiziwe mu tyakala ya bubili yakua Farao kuya wali nkonkani wakua Farao. Bakalinda bakue baali baya bamutangiliile balimukupunda nangue, “Fukame.” Yusufu wapeelua bukulu bwa kuteeka kyalo kyonse kya Misri. <verse eid="GEN 41:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 41:44" />Farao waamwanine Yusufu nangue, “Nene ndi Farao, inzi mono mu Misri monse tekuli muntu wakulendula kuboko ao lukasa kine teumupeele nsambu.” <verse eid="GEN 41:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 41:45" />Farao waamwinikile Yusufu linge liina lya Zafenati-Panea ni kumuufia mwana mwanakazi liina lyakue Asenati mwina Potifera kitambua wa mu muzi wa Oni.<verse eid="GEN 41:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 41:46" />Yusufu waali na myaka 30 lu-aabiikilue pa mwilo na Farao, likolo wa ku Misri. Yusufu waafumine kuli Farao ni kuya kwenda mu kyalo kyonse kya Misri. <verse eid="GEN 41:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 41:47" />Mu ezio myaka kilooba, kyalo kyaameniizie bilio bingi. <verse eid="GEN 41:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 41:48" />Mu ezio myaka kilooba Yusufu waakolonghaniizie bilio byonse bya mu kyalo kya Misri ni kubiziba mu milue. Mu mizi yonse ya mu Misri mwaazibilue bilio bya mu makaba aali aizyungulukiile. <verse eid="GEN 41:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 41:49" />Yusufu waazibile bilio bingi sana byavulile nga musenga wa mumbali lyezi. Baalekeele ni kupenda pantu byaali byakilile kuvula.<verse eid="GEN 41:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 41:50" />Lubaali tebanaingile mu mwaka wa nzala, Asenati mwana mwanakazi mwina Potifera kitambua wa mu muzi wa Oni, waali wasyamuvyaliile Yusufu baana babili balalume. <verse eid="GEN 41:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 41:51" />Libeli wakue waamwinikile Manase. I kulanda nangue, “Leza wanengia kulaba maavia ane onse pamo ni lupua lwane.” <verse eid="GEN 41:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 41:52" />Mwana wa bubili waamwinikile Efraimu. I kulanda nangue, “Leza wan'mpeela luvyalo mu kyalo kya lyemo lyane.”<verse eid="GEN 41:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 41:53" />Myaka kilooba ya bilio yaali mu kyalo kya Misri yaapwile, <verse eid="GEN 41:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 41:54" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41.54: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:11">Mii 7.11</ref></char></note>ni myaka kilooba ya nzala yaabambile nga mwaalandiile Yusufu, ni nzala yaakumeene mu kyalo kyonse. Inzi mu kyalo kya Misri temwaabulile bilio. <verse eid="GEN 41:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 41:55" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41.55: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 2:5">Yoa 2.5</ref></char></note>Nzala luyaakumeene mu kyalo kyonse kya Misri, bantu baile kumulilila Farao. Farao waabaanine Bamisri bonse nangue, “Endo mwaya kuli Yusufu. Kyonse ki-alikumyana, kite.” <verse eid="GEN 41:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="GEN 41:56" />Nzala luyaakumeene mu kyalo kyonse, Yusufu waizwile milue onse ni kubamba kubasisia Bamisri bilio, ni nzala yaali yakilile kubiipa mu kyalo kya Misri. <verse eid="GEN 41:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="GEN 41:57" />Bantu ba mu byalo byonse baali baya kusita bilio mu Misri kuli Yusufu pantu nzala yaali yakilile kubiipa pa kyalo.<verse eid="GEN 41:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 41" />
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="GEN 42" />
  <para style="s1">Bakuluube kwa Yusufu baya kusita bilio ku Misri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 42:1" />Yakobo lu-aamanine nangue bilio bili ku Misri, waabaanine baana bakue nangue, “Mwe baana, ale mukentaniineki? <verse eid="GEN 42:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 42:2" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:12">Mii 7.12</ref></char></note>Nene nakyunvua nangue ku Misri bilio kubili. Kansi kookeleko muye mutusitileko, evi tekuti tufue na nzala.” <verse eid="GEN 42:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 42:3" />Kupwako, bakuluube lyanondo bakua Yusufu bakookelako baya ku kusita nghano. <verse eid="GEN 42:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 42:4" />Inzi Yakobo taamutumineko Benyamina mwalawakue kwa Yusufu pantu waali watiina nangue pange kuti wakitikilua na kibiipile.<verse eid="GEN 42:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 42:5" />Baizraeli baile pamo ni bange bantu ku kusita bilio ku Misri pantu mu kyalo kya Kanaani nzala yaali yakilile. <verse eid="GEN 42:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 42:6" />Ozo musita, Yusufu waali wali ndabukizi wa kyalo, kabili i waali wasisia bilio ku bantu bonse ba mu byalo. Bakuluube kwa Yusufu baizile kumufukamina ni kulaala kyuba. <verse eid="GEN 42:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 42:7" />Yusufu lu-ainikile nangue ni bakuluube, waabambile kulanda nabo wasasile nga asibenikile. Waabeepuziizie evi, “Mufumine pi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 42:7">Baamwasukile nangue, “Fwefue tufumine ku kyalo kya Kanaani. Twizile kono ku kusita bilio.”<verse eid="GEN 42:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 42:8" />Anzia kine Yusufu waabenikile, bene tebaamwinikile. <verse eid="GEN 42:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 42:9" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42.9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 37:5-10">Kut 37.5-10</ref></char></note>Yusufu waalangulukile bilooto bi-aali waloota. Waabaanine evi, “Mwemue muli nengu. Mwiziile sie kumona bunake bwa kyalo.”<verse eid="GEN 42:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 42:10" />Baakeene balanda nangue, “Ata we mukulu, fwefue tuli babombi bobe, twiziile sie kusita bilio. <verse eid="GEN 42:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 42:11" />Fwefue tuli bena umo, tetuli nengu. We mukulu, fwefue tuli bantu ba kisinka.”<verse eid="GEN 42:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 42:12" />Yusufu waabaanine evi, “Tekukaane, mwemue mwiziile kulengula bunake bwa kyalo.”<verse eid="GEN 42:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 42:13" />Baalandile evi, “Fwe babombi bobe twaavyelue lyanondo ni babili, baana bena muntu umo wa mu kyalo kya Kanaani, mwalawetu wa mpeleezio asyele na situe, ni unge umo talipo.”<verse eid="GEN 42:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 42:14" />Yusufu waalandile evi, “Mwemue muli nengu, nga munamyaninanga. <verse eid="GEN 42:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 42:15" />Ni pakako, namilapila mu liina lyakua Farao nangue mupalile kweziiwanke. Kine mwalawenu tanamoneke pano temukapeelua nsambu ya kubwelela kwenu. <verse eid="GEN 42:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 42:16" />Tume umo pakati kenu wakuti aye amutwame mwalawenu, ni mwe bange musyale mwakakilue mpaka lwakaba kusininkiziwa bintu bimwalanda. Inzi kulanda kisinka ntanzi yakua Farao mwemue muli nengu.” <verse eid="GEN 42:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 42:17" />Kupwako, wabakaka bonse mu buloko nsiku itatu.<verse eid="GEN 42:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 42:18" />Busiku bwa butatu Yusufu waabaanine evi, “Kite bindikumyana mukeeza kufua pantu nene ndinatiina Leza. <verse eid="GEN 42:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 42:19" />Kine muli bantu ba kisinka, mukwenu umo asyale wakakilue molia mu buloko mumukakilue, inzi mwe bange endo mutwale bilio bya kupwisia nzala kwenu. <verse eid="GEN 42:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 42:20" />Mukabe kumuleeta mwalawenu pano evi nkabe kusininkizia nangue bulanzi bwenu ni bwa kisinka. Kine mukabe kukita evio nsikaba kumiipaya.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 42:20">Ni bo baakitile evio. <verse eid="GEN 42:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 42:21" />Baalanzyaniizie nangue, “Emwe, kisinka tulubile pantu twaakeene kunvwila mwalawetu nkumbu lu-aali watupaapaata. Keki i kitwaingilila mu aza maavia.”<verse eid="GEN 42:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 42:22" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">42.22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 37:21-22">Kut 37.21-22</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Rubeni waalandile evi, “I kalia kanaamyanine nangue tekumukitile kibiipile, inzi mwe mwaakeene. Te mwamona! Mulopa wakue ulimukukebua pali fwefue.” <verse eid="GEN 42:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 42:23" />Tebaamanine nangue Yusufu waabenikile pantu waali walanda nabo kupitila mu muntu waali walondolola bulanzi bwabo. <verse eid="GEN 42:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 42:24" />Yusufu lu-aafumine papo pa baali, waatendekele kulila. Lu-aabweleelepo kabili, waamukwete Simeoni wamukaka ni bonse bamwene.<verse eid="GEN 42:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bakuluube kwa Yusufu babwelela ku Kanaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 42:25" />Yusufu wa-anine bantu babeezuziizie bilio mu masaaka ni kubabiikilamo nfolanga yabo, kabili babapailile ni mpamba ya mu nzila. Evi i vibaabakitiile. <verse eid="GEN 42:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 42:26" />Baaseziizie masaaka abo pa punda. Kupwako, babamba kuya. <verse eid="GEN 42:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 42:27" />Lubaafikile pa nkendo ya kuti balaale, umopo waakakwile lisaaka lyakue abuulemo bilio bya kuliisia punda wakue, waamwene nfolanga yakue yali mukati. <verse eid="GEN 42:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 42:28" />Waabaanine benakue nangue, “Emwe, ize mumone nfolanga yane inabweziiziwanga ezi ili momu mu lisaaka lyane.” Bonse baabambile kukwaka na mwezo balanda nangue, “Ni kiki keki kyatukitilanga Leza?”<verse eid="GEN 42:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 42:29" />Lubaile kufika kuli sibo Yakobo ku kyalo kya Kanaani, baamubwilile byonse byaabakitikiile nangue, <verse eid="GEN 42:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 42:30" />“Ozo mukulu wa kekio kyalo waali walanda wasasile sana kuli fwefue, kabili waali walanda nangue, ‘Tuli nengu ya kyalo.’” <verse eid="GEN 42:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 42:31" />Twaamwanine, “We mukulu, fwefue tetuli nengu, inzi tuli sie bantu ba kisinka. <verse eid="GEN 42:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 42:32" />Fwefue tuli benenke baana lyanondo ni babili bena situe umo. Mwana umo talipo, mwana mukala wene asyele ku kyalo kya Kanaani kuli situe.” <verse eid="GEN 42:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 42:33" />Ozo mukulu wa kyalo wakitwana evi, “Pakuti nsininkizie nangue mwemue muli bantu ba kisinka, umo pakati kenu alikusyala kono, inzi bange babwelelemo ni bilio pantu kuli nzala. <verse eid="GEN 42:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 42:34" />Endo mumutwame mwalawenu mumuleete, mane nkabe kusininkizia nangue temuli nengu, kabili mane nkabe kumibweziizia muntu wenu. Kabili ni mwe mwaakaba mwasuluzia mu keno kyalo.”<verse eid="GEN 42:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 42:35" />Bonse lubaapongwele bilio mu masaaka abo, kubalua muntu waamwene kafunda kakue ka nfolanga mu lisaaka. Baana bonse pamo ni sibo lubaamwene evio, baatiinine. <verse eid="GEN 42:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 42:36" />Sibo Yakobo waabaanine evi, “Mwemue mulimukun'mpwila baana bane! Yusufu talipo, ni Simeoni talipo, kabili evi mulimukukeba mumutwame ni Benyamina! Ena we lyemo!”<verse eid="GEN 42:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 42:37" />Rubeni waamwanine se, “We tawe, kine nsikakubweziizia ozu mwana obe, ukepailemo baba baana bane babili. N'mpeele, ni ne nakaba kumubwezia”<verse eid="GEN 42:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 42:38" />Waalandile evi, “Ata, ozu mwana wane wene temuya nakue. Unvue, mukuluube waafwile, ozu i wenka asyelepo sie. Pa-akaba kukitikilua na kibiipile mu nzila, nga mwakaba kunengia kufua na kikonko kya mu bukote bwane.”<verse eid="GEN 42:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 42" />
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="GEN 43" />
  <para style="s1">Bakuluube kwa Yusufu baya ku Misri ni Benyamina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 43:1" />Ozo musita, nzala yaakilile kubiipa mu kyalo. <verse eid="GEN 43:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 43:2" />Lubaapwile bilio byonse bibaile kusita ku Misri, sibo waabaanine evi, “Endo mutusitileko binge bilio.”<verse eid="GEN 43:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 43:3" />Yuda waamwanine evi, “Olia muntu waatwaanine nangue, ‘Kine temukeeza ni mwalawenu, tekuti tukamonane nenu.’ <verse eid="GEN 43:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 43:4" />Kine ulikutupeela mwalawetu kuti tuye nakue, tulikukooka kuya ku kusitila bilio. <verse eid="GEN 43:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 43:5" />Inzi kine wakaana kuti tuye nakue, fwefue tetukookelako pantu olia muntu waatwaanine nangue, ‘Kine temukeeza pamo ni mwalawenu, tekuti tukamonane nenu.’”<verse eid="GEN 43:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 43:6" />Izraeli waalandile evi, “Mwandeetela bwavia bukata sana. Ale mwaamubwiliileki nangue muli ni unge mwalawenu?”<verse eid="GEN 43:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 43:7" />Baamwasukile nangue, “Ozo muntu waatwipuziizie biipuzio bingi sana palua lupua lwetu nangue, ‘Sinue akikosele? Temuli na mwalawenu?’ Fwefue twaamwasukile kukonkana ni vikili, inzi tetwaali twamanine nangue kuti watwana tukeeze ni mwalawetu.”<verse eid="GEN 43:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 43:8" />Yuda waamwanine se Izraeli, “N'mpeele mulumendo ngie nakue, ni fwe tulikuya, tetukafua na nzala, inzi twaakaba twakosele, fwefue ni wewe pamo ni baana betu. <verse eid="GEN 43:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 43:9" />Nene naakaba kikwatizi kyakue. Kine nsikamubwezia wakosele, ukansonze, ni kilubo kyaakaba kyali kyane muyayaya. <verse eid="GEN 43:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 43:10" />Pantu kabenge tekukokola, evi nga tetusyabweleleko ni lya bubili.”<verse eid="GEN 43:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 43:11" />Sibo Izraeli waabaanine evi, “Kine ni evio, kite evi: Twame mazabo awamiisie a mu keno kyalo mu bitwamo byenu mumutwalile ozo muntu byabupe: Zeri iniini, ni kapelo kaniini, ni manukato, ni manemane, ni batani, pamo ni lozi. <verse eid="GEN 43:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 43:12" />Mutwame nfolanga ya kuya kusitamo bilio ni ya kuya kubweziizia pa elia nfolanga i mwaiziliile nayo mu masaaka enu pantu pange baalabiliile kubiikamo. <verse eid="GEN 43:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 43:13" />Mumutwame ni mwalawenu muye nakue kuli ozo muntu. <verse eid="GEN 43:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 43:14" />Leza wa Maka onse akalengie ozo muntu kumyunvwila nkumbu, evi mukabwele ni Benyamina pamo ni mukuluube. Kine kufwilua na baana bonse, nkafwilue sie.”<verse eid="GEN 43:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 43:15" />Kupwako, babo baana batwama byabupe ni Benyamina pamo ni nfolanga ya kusitamo bilio ni ya kuya kubwezia. Baabambile lwendo, bakookela ku Misri ni kuya kwimana pa ntanzi yakua Yusufu. <verse eid="GEN 43:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 43:16" />Yusufu lu-aabamwene bali pamo ni Benyamina, waamwanine mubombi wakue nangue, “Bengizie mu nghanda yane, sinza nama uteanie pantu baba bantu lelo ndikulia nabo bilio bya musita wa koba.” <verse eid="GEN 43:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 43:17" />Mubombi waabengiziizie mu nghanda mwa Yusufu nga mwa-aniinue.<verse eid="GEN 43:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 43:18" />Bakuluube baatiinine pantu baingiziiziwe mu nghanda mwa Yusufu. Baalandile evi, “Twaingiziiwa mono pa mulandu wa nfolanga i twatwaaminiine mu masaaka etu lolia lutwaizile kusita bilio lwa mambo, evi atupeele mulandu ni kutupingula, apoke punda yetu ni kutwalula bazia bakue.” <verse eid="GEN 43:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 43:19" />Baamupaleeme kalinda wa nghanda yakua Yusufu, babamba kulanda nakue pa mulyango nangue, <verse eid="GEN 43:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 43:20" />“We mukulu, kisinka twaakookele kono lwa mambo kukusita bilio. <verse eid="GEN 43:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 43:21" />Lutwaafikile pa nkendo ya kulaala, twaakakwile masaaka etu, kubalua muntu waamwene nfolanga yakue elia itwaasitilemo bilio yali mu lisaaka lyakue nga muyaali yabeeleele. Nfolanga ezi i twabwela nayo. <verse eid="GEN 43:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 43:22" />Kabili twaiza ni inge nfolanga ya kusitilako binge bilio. Fwefue tetumanine muntu waabiikile nfolanga yetu mu masaaka etu.”<verse eid="GEN 43:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 43:23" />Mubombi waalandile evi, “Mutende ube nenu, tekutiine. Leza wenu, Leza wakua sinue i waamipeele nfolanga mu masaaka enu. Pantu nene mwan'mpeele yakumeene.” Kupwako, wabaleetela Simeoni.<verse eid="GEN 43:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 43:24" />Mubombi waabengiziizie mu nghanda yakua Yusufu, wabapeela menda a kusamba ku makasa, kabili waya kuliisia ni punda yabo. <verse eid="GEN 43:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 43:25" />Baateaniizie byabupe bya kupeela Yusufu, pantu waabaanine kwiza kulia nabo musita wa koba. <verse eid="GEN 43:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 43:26" />Yusufu lu-aizile kwakue, baamupeele byabupe bibaizile nabio mu nghanda ni kumukontamina. <verse eid="GEN 43:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 43:27" />Waabeepuziizie wabaana nangue, “Ale sinue mukote umwaalandile palwakua wene, ali sie bwino? Ni lenu kumo akikosele?”<verse eid="GEN 43:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 43:28" />Baamwasukile nangue, “Mubombi obe, situe, ali sie bwino, ni lenu kumo akikosele.” Kabili baafukeeme ni kumukontamina.<verse eid="GEN 43:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 43:29" />Lu-aamumwene mwalawakue Benyamina, mwana mwina nghina, waalandile evi, “Ati, ozu i mwalawenu umwan'mbwilile? Waalandile evi, ‘We mwana wane, Leza akunvwile nkumbu.’” <verse eid="GEN 43:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 43:30" />Kupwako, Yusufu wafumapo pantu waali wasyakeba kulila na nsansa ya kumona mwalawakue. Waingiile mu nghanda ku kati ni kubamba kulila. <verse eid="GEN 43:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 43:31" />Pa kyamba, waasambile ku menso, wafuma waisipikiizie ni kubaana bateanie bilio. <verse eid="GEN 43:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 43:32" />Yusufu waateaniiziiziwe pa bunke, ni bakuluube pa bunke, Bamisri baali balia koko ni bo pa bunke pantu kyaali kya busoni Bamisri kuliila pamo ni Baebrania. <verse eid="GEN 43:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 43:33" />Balupua bakua Yusufu baikeele pa ntanzi yakue bakonkeene, libeli pa nsambu yakue ya bubeli, ni mukala pa nsambu yakue ya bumukala. Ni bo, baali basyaipapa sie. <verse eid="GEN 43:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 43:34" />Waabapeele bilio byaali byafuma pa ntanzi yakue. Benyamina waatuulikiiluepo lisaano kukila bakuluube. Baaminine ni kuwaminua pamo nakue.<verse eid="GEN 43:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 43" />
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="GEN 44" />
  <para style="s1">Kikombe kyakua Yusufu kyabiikua mu lisaaka lyakua Benyamina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 44:1" />Yusufu wa-anine mubombi wa mu nghanda yakue nangue, “Izuzia bilio mu masaaka a baba bantu kukonkana ni vibalikuvinda kutwama, ubabiikilemo ni nfolanga yabo. <verse eid="GEN 44:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 44:2" />Kabili ubiike ni kikombe kyane kya mutofue mu lisaaka lyakua ozu mwanike, ubiikemo ni nfolanga yakue.” Ni ye waakitile mwa-aniinue na Yusufu. <verse eid="GEN 44:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 44:3" />Lukeele lwakue paakili ba-aninue kuti baye pamo ni punda yabo. <verse eid="GEN 44:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 44:4" />Lubaali tebanafike kule ni muzi, Yusufu waamwanine mubombi wa mu nghanda yakue nangue, “Lenga ubakonke balia bantu bayanga. Pauya kubasanga, uye ubeepuzie evi, ‘Mwakitilangaki bibiipile ku muntu waamikitiile biweme? <verse eid="GEN 44:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 44:5" />Temuli na kikombe kyakua tawelenzi?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">44.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bwaluzi bumo bwa kale buli na </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Temuli na kikombe kyakua tawelenzi? </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kiebrania tekikwete totu twebo.</char></note> ki-aliwamininamo ni kubukilako? Mwaluvia sana.’”<verse eid="GEN 44:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 44:6" />Lu-aabasangile, waabaanine totu twebo. <verse eid="GEN 44:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 44:7" />Baamwanine evi, “We mulopue, walandilaki evio? Kulanda kisinka tetwakitanga kintu kya ozu musango. <verse eid="GEN 44:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 44:8" />Unvua, lolia lutwaatwaminiine nfolanga mu masaaka etu mpaka ku Kanaani, twakikubweziizia. Eba, ale tulikwibilaki mutofue ao oro yakua solenzi? <verse eid="GEN 44:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 44:9" />Ewe, kansi kine pa fwefue babombi bobe palikusangua umo ali nakio, afue, ni fwefue bange bonse tukabe bazia benu.”<verse eid="GEN 44:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 44:10" />Waalandile evi, “Kibe nga mumwalandila. Olia alikusangua nakio, alikuya wali muzia wane, ni mwe bange temuya mwali na kilubo.” <verse eid="GEN 44:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 44:11" />Kupwako, penka papo bakoosiizia masaaka abo pansi, kubalua muntu wabamba kukakula lisaaka lyakue. <verse eid="GEN 44:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 44:12" />Waabambiile kukeba mu lisaaka lyakua mukulu mpaka wapeleezia mu lisaaka lyakua mwanike. Kikombe kyaamonekele mu lisaaka lyakua Benyamina. <verse eid="GEN 44:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 44:13" />Kupwako, bonse bazabula ngubo yabo, kubalua muntu wabiika lisaaka lyakue pa punda wakue ni kubwelela ku Misri.<verse eid="GEN 44:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 44:14" />Yuda ni bakuluube baile mu nghanda yakua Yusufu, ni ye waali wakili penka palia. Bonse baaleele kyuba. <verse eid="GEN 44:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 44:15" />Yusufu waabaanine evi, “Mwakitilangaki evi? Temumanine nangue muntu nga nene kuti nabuka ni kumana bintu byonse?”<verse eid="GEN 44:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 44:16" />Yuda waamwasukile evi, “We mukulu, tulikukwanaki? Kabili tulikulandaki? Tulikukaana syani kibalo? Leza mwine i-amwene bubi bwa babombi bobe. Evi fwe bonse tuli bazia bobe pamo ni olia wakwatwanga watweme kikombe.”<verse eid="GEN 44:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 44:17" />Yusufu waalandile evi, “Ata, nene nsivinda kukita evio! Nalanda evi, olia wenka wakwatwanga wali ni kikombe i muzia wane. Inzi mwemue bange ilepo bwino kuli sinue.”<verse eid="GEN 44:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yuda wapaapaata palwakua Benyamina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 44:18" />Yuda waamupaleeme ni kumwana nangue, “We mulopue, napaapaata nandepo keebo kamo ka kunvwika ku matui akua tawelenzi. Tekufiitilua mubombi obe pantu wewe uli nga Farao. <verse eid="GEN 44:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 44:19" />We Tawelenzi, waatwipuziizie fwe babombi bobe nangue, ‘Kubako muli ni sinue ao mwalawenu?’ <verse eid="GEN 44:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 44:20" />Fwefue twa-asukile evi, ‘Ee, tuli ni situe mukote ni mwana wa mu bukote bwakue, inzi mukuluube kwa ozo mwanike waafwile. Ozo mwana i asyelepo sie wakosele mu livumo lyabo, ni se amutonene.’ <verse eid="GEN 44:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 44:21" />Wewe waatwanine fwe babombi bobe tumuleete umumone, <verse eid="GEN 44:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 44:22" />Inzi fwefue twa-asukile nangue, ‘Mulumendo tavinda kumusia se, pantu kine wamusia, se kuti wafua.’ <verse eid="GEN 44:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 44:23" />Wewe wa-anine babombi bobe nangue, ‘Kine temukeeza ni mwalawenu, tekuti tukamonane nenu.’<verse eid="GEN 44:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 44:24" />“Lutwaabweleele kuli situe, twaamubwilile byonse bitwa-aninue na tawelenzi. <verse eid="GEN 44:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 44:25" />Situe waalandile evi, ‘Kabili endo mwaye mutusitileko binge bilio.’ <verse eid="GEN 44:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 44:26" />Fwefue twaalandile evi, ‘Tetuvinda kukookelako. Inzi kine tulikuya ni mwalawetu, tulikukookelako, pantu tetuvinda kuya kumonana na olia muntu kine tetuiile ni mwalawetu.’ <verse eid="GEN 44:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 44:27" />Mubombi obe, tawe, waatwanine, ‘Mumanine nangue mukazi wane Rakeli wanvyaliile sie baana babili balalumenke. <verse eid="GEN 44:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 44:28" />Umo nsikili nakue, kisinka waaputwilue sie tuniini tuniini, kabili nsyamumwene. <verse eid="GEN 44:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 44:29" />Kine mwantwamina ni ozu, ni ye waya kukitikilua na kibiipile, kuti mwangipailila sie na bulanda bwa mu bukote bwane.’<verse eid="GEN 44:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 44:30" />“Ni pakako kine naya kuli tawe, mubombi obe, tekuba nali na ozu mulumendo, pantu maswapi a bukose bwakua tawe ali mu ozu mwana, <verse eid="GEN 44:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 44:31" />pa-akaba kumona nangue mulumendo tetuli nakue wakaba kufua. Ni babombi bobe baakeepaizia sibo mukote wali ni bulanda. <verse eid="GEN 44:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 44:32" />Pantu mubombi obe waikitile kikwatizi kuli se walanda nangue, ‘Kine nsikaba kumubwezia kuli wewe, naakaba ni kilubo kya muyayaya kuli we tawe.’ <verse eid="GEN 44:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 44:33" />Kansi evi ne mubombi obe nakulomba nsyale nali muzia kuli we tawelenzi pa kifuka kyakua ozu mulumendo, inzi ozu mulumendo asele aye pamo ni bakuluube. <verse eid="GEN 44:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 44:34" />Ale ndikubwela syani kuli tawe tekuba namutweme ozu mulumendo? Nsitonene kuya kumona kyakaba kumukitikila tawe.”<verse eid="GEN 44:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 44" />
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="GEN 45" />
  <para style="s1">Yusufu waimania ku bakuluube</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 45:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">45.1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 7:13">Mii 7.13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yusufu wa-andilue kusipikizia ntanzi yabo bonse baali baimeene pepi nakue. Waalandile evi, “Mwe babombi bonse ba mu Misri, fume.” Lwaafuminepo babombi bonse ba mu Misri, Yusufu waimaniizie ku bakuluube. <verse eid="GEN 45:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 45:2" />Wa-angwile walila mpaka ni Bamisri baali bali panze baunvua, pamo ni ba mu nghanda yakua Farao. <verse eid="GEN 45:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 45:3" />Yusufu waabaanine bakuluube, “Nene ndi Yusufu. Tawe akikosele ni lenu kumo?” Bakuluube lubaunvwile evio, ba-andilue kumwasuka pantu baamutiinine. <verse eid="GEN 45:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 45:4" />Yusufu waabaanine bakuluube, “Namilomba mun'mpalame.” Baamupaleeme. Waabaanine evi, “Nene ndi Yusufu umwasisiizie ni kuleetua kono ku Misri. <verse eid="GEN 45:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 45:5" />Kansi tekunvue bulanda ao kufiitilwane pantu mwansisiizie, inzi waminue sie pantu Leza wantangiziizie kono pakuti n'mpususie bukose bwa bantu. <verse eid="GEN 45:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 45:6" />Eno ikili sie myaka ibili ya nzala mu kyalo. Kusyele ni inge myaka isaano ya nzala. Mu ezio myaka tekukaba kulima ao kuzombola. <verse eid="GEN 45:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 45:7" />Leza wantangiziizie ntanzi yenu pakuti n'misunge mwe basyelepo, kuti luvyalo lwenu lukatwalilile pa kyalo ni kumipususia na bupusuko bukata. <verse eid="GEN 45:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 45:8" />Kansi te mwemue bandeetele pano, inzi ni Leza. Ni ye wankitile kuba nga se kwa Farao ni mukulu wa mu nghanda yakue yonse, ni ndabukizi wa kyalo kyonse kya Misri.<verse eid="GEN 45:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 45:9" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">45.9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 7:14">Mii 7.14</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Ale lenge musele kuli tawe mumwane nangue Yusufu mwana obe walanda evi, ‘Leza anteekele kuba ndabukizi wa kyalo kyonse kya Misri. Lenga ukookele kono kuli nene, <verse eid="GEN 45:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 45:10" />ukabe kwiza kwikala ku Goseni, koko i kuwaakaba wapalameene ni nene. Wewe ni baana bobe, ni benzikulu bobe, ni mikooko yobe, ni nghombe yobe pamo ni binge byonse byuli nabio. <verse eid="GEN 45:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 45:11" />Papo i panaakakusunga pantu kukili ni inge myaka isaano ya nzala, evi tekuti ukabe mupabi, wewe ni lupua lobe pamo ni byonse byuli nabio.’<verse eid="GEN 45:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 45:12" />“Evi mwaimwena na menso enu, ni mwalawane Benyamina waimwena na menso akue nangue nene i wenka Yusufu alimukulanda nenu. <verse eid="GEN 45:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 45:13" />Mukabe kuya kumubwila tawe bulumba bwane bonse bundi nabo mu kyalo kya Misri, ni bintu byonse bimwamona. Kabili mukabe kulenga kumukoosiizia tawe kono.”<verse eid="GEN 45:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 45:14" />Kupwako, wamukumbatila Benyamina watendeka kulila. Benyamina ni ye wamukumbatila ni kutendeka kulila. <verse eid="GEN 45:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 45:15" />Kabili waakumbatiile bakuluube bonse ni kubalilila. Pa kyamba, bakuluube baalanzyenie nakue.<verse eid="GEN 45:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 45:16" />Mpunda luyaunvwikile ku nghanda yakua Farao nangue bakuluube kwa Yusufu bakiiza, Farao ni babombi bakue baawamiinue. <verse eid="GEN 45:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 45:17" />Farao waamwanine Yusufu, “Baane bakuluubo nangue, ‘Kite evi, longele bintu pa nama yenu musele muye ku kyalo kya Kanaani, <verse eid="GEN 45:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 45:18" />muye mu mutwame sinue ni lupua lwenu mwize kono kwane, ni ne naakamipeela biweme bya mu kyalo kya Misri, kabili mwaakaba mwalia binonene bya mu kyalo.’ <verse eid="GEN 45:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 45:19" />Kabili baane nangue, ‘Twame matyakala a mono mu Misri a kuti muye mutwaminemo baana benu ni bakazi benu pamo ni sinue mwize nakue. <verse eid="GEN 45:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 45:20" />Kabili tekusakamane palua bintu byenu pantu bintu biweme bya mu kyalo kyonse kya Misri byaakaba byenu.’”<verse eid="GEN 45:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 45:21" />Baizraeli baakitile muba-aniinue. Yusufu waabapeele matyakala ni mpao ya mu nzila nga mwaalandiile Farao. <verse eid="GEN 45:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 45:22" />Kubalua muntu waapeelue ngubo ya lenu, inzi Benyamina wene waapeelue ngubo isaano ya lenu ni nfolanga ya mutofue 300. <verse eid="GEN 45:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 45:23" />Waamutumiine se punda lyanondo yaali yatweme bintu biweme bya mu Misri ni punda ikota lyanondo yaali yatweme nghano ni mikate pamo ni binge bilio bya mpao ya mu nzila. <verse eid="GEN 45:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 45:24" />Lu-aabapeele nsambu ya kuya, waabaanine evi, “Tekukankabule mu nzila.”<verse eid="GEN 45:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 45:25" />Kupwako, basela kufuma ku Misri ni kuya ku kyalo kya Kanaani kuli sibo Yakobo. <verse eid="GEN 45:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 45:26" />Baamwanine nangue, “Yusufu akikosele ni lenu kumo, kabili i ndabukizi wa mu kyalo kyonse kya Misri!” Yakobo lu-aunvwile evio, waapenzukile pantu taabaketekeele.<verse eid="GEN 45:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 45:27" />Baamulondolweleele byonse biba-aninue na Yusufu. Lu-aamwene matyakala aatuminue na Yusufu akuti atwamuemo, mutima wakua sibo Yakobo waateekameene. <verse eid="GEN 45:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 45:28" />Izraeli waalandile evi, “Emwe! Eyo mwana wane akikosele! Mpaka nkabe kuya kumumona lunsinafue.”<verse eid="GEN 45:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 45" />
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="GEN 46" />
  <para style="s1">Yakobo ni lupua lwakue baya ku Misri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 46:1" />Izraeli waile pamo ni byonse bi-aali nabio waya kufika ku Beri-Seba, wamwelela Leza wakua se Izaaki ngelelo. <verse eid="GEN 46:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 46:2" />Leza waamwanine Izraeli mu kimonua kya busiku. Waamukuutile, “Yakobo, Yakobo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 46:2">Wa-asukile nangue, “Ne ono pano.”<verse eid="GEN 46:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 46:3" />Waamwanine, “Nene ndi Leza, Leza wakua so. Tekutiina kukookela ku Misri pantu i kunaakakukita kuba mutundu ukata. <verse eid="GEN 46:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 46:4" />Ndikukooka pamo nobe ku Misri, kabili naakakusezia paakale. Yusufu i waakakuziika.”<verse eid="GEN 46:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 46:5" />Yakobo waafumine ku Beri-Seba. Baizraeli baamutweme sibo Yakobo, ni baana babo pamo ni bakazi babo mu matyakala aatuminue na Farao kuti bamutwamemo. <verse eid="GEN 46:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 46:6" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46.6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:15">Mii 7.15</ref></char></note>Kupwako, batwama nama yabo pamo ni bunonsi bwabo bubaanonkele mu kyalo kya Kanaani. Yakobo waya ku Misri pamo ni luvyalo lwakue lonse. <verse eid="GEN 46:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 46:7" />Baana bakue balalume, ni baana bakue banakazi, ni benzikulu bakue balalume ni banakazi, waile nabo ku Misri.<verse eid="GEN 46:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 46:8" />Yakobo ni baana bakue baile ku Misri. Meena a baana bena Yakobo, aliwakutua Izraeli, ni aza: Rubeni i libeli. <verse eid="GEN 46:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 46:9" />Ni bena Rubeni ni baba: Hanoki, ni Palu, ni Hesroni pamo ni Karmi. <verse eid="GEN 46:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 46:10" />Ni meena a baana balalume bakua Simeoni ni aza: Yemueli, ni Yaminu, ni Ohadu, ni Yakini, ni Zohari pamo ni Sauli mwina mwanakazi wa ku Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 46:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 46:11" />Ni meena a baana balalume bakua Lawi ni aza: Gershoni, ni Kohati pamo ni Merari. <verse eid="GEN 46:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 46:12" />Ni meena a baana balalume bakua Yuda ni aza: Eri, ni Onanu, ni Sela, ni Peresi, ni Zera. Inzi Eri ni Onanu baafwiliile mu kyalo kya Kanaani. Ni meena a baana balalume bakua Perezi ni aza: Hesroni ni Hamuli. <verse eid="GEN 46:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 46:13" />Ni meena a baana balalume bakua Isakari ni aza: Tola, ni Pua, ni Iobu pamo ni Simuroni. <verse eid="GEN 46:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 46:14" />Ni meena a baana balalume bakua Zabuloni ni aza: Seredi, ni Eloni pamo ni Yaleli. <verse eid="GEN 46:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 46:15" />Babo i bena Lea ba-aamuvyaliile Yakobo ku Padani-Aramu pamo ni Dina mwana mwanakazi. Baana bakue bonse, balalume ni banakazi, baali 33.<verse eid="GEN 46:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 46:16" />Ni meena a baana balalume bakua Gadi ni aza: Sifioni, ni Hagi, ni Suni, ni Eziboni, ni Eri, ni Arodi pamo ni Areli. <verse eid="GEN 46:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 46:17" />Ni meena a baana balalume bakua Aseri ni aza: Imuna, ni Isiwa, ni Isiwi, ni Beria pamo ni nkazi yabo Sera. Ni meena a baana balalume bakua Beria ni aza: Heberi ni Malkieli. <verse eid="GEN 46:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 46:18" />Baba i baana bena Silipa waufiiziwe Yakobo. Lea waapeelue ozu Silipa na Labani kuti aye wali mubombi wakue. Bonse pamo baali lyanondo ni mutanda.<verse eid="GEN 46:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 46:19" />Ni meena a baana balalume bakua Rakeli muka Yakobo ni aza: Yusufu ni Benyamina. <verse eid="GEN 46:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 46:20" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46.20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 41:50-52">Kut 41.50-52</ref></char></note>Yusufu waavyele baana babili balalume muli Asenati mwina Potifera kitambua wa mu muzi wa Oni, ni bo meena abo ni aza: Manase ni Efraimu. <verse eid="GEN 46:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 46:21" />Ni meena a baana balalume bakua Benyamina ni aza: Bela, ni Bekeri, ni Asibeli, ni Gera, ni Naamani, ni Ehi, ni Rosi, ni Mupimu, ni Hupimu pamo ni Ardi. <verse eid="GEN 46:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 46:22" />Baba i baana lyanondo ni bana bakua Yakobo ba-aavyele muli Rakeli.<verse eid="GEN 46:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 46:23" />Dani waavyele mwana mwalalume Husimu. <verse eid="GEN 46:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 46:24" />Ni meena a baana balalume bakua Nafutali ni aza: Yazeli, ni Guni, ni Yezeri pamo ni Silemu. <verse eid="GEN 46:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 46:25" />Baba i baana kilooba bakua Yakobo ba-aavyele muli Biliha. Rakeli waapeelue Biliha na Labani kuti aye wali mubombi wakue.<verse eid="GEN 46:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 46:26" />Bantu baile na Yakobo mu Misri, bantu ba mu luvyalo lwakue pasili kupendako bamuka baana bakue, baali bantu 66. <verse eid="GEN 46:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 46:27" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46.27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:14">Mii 7.14</ref></char></note>Yusufu lu-aali ku Misri waavyele baana babili balalume. Bantu bonse ba mu luvyalo lwakua Yakobo baile ku Misri baali bantu 70.<verse eid="GEN 46:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yakobo ni lupua lwakue mu Misri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 46:28" />Yakobo waamutumine Yuda kuti abatangilile kuya kumwana Yusufu bakabe kuya kusaakaana nakue mu Goseni. Lubaafikile ku Goseni, <verse eid="GEN 46:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 46:29" />Yusufu waingiile mu tyakala yakue aye asaakaane ni se Izraeli ku Goseni. Lubaamoneene, Yusufu waile kumukumbatila mu mukosi. Waalilile musita ukata. <verse eid="GEN 46:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 46:30" />Izraeli waamwanine Yusufu nangue, “Evi vinakumona wakosele mpaka lenu, kansi kuti nafua.”<verse eid="GEN 46:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 46:31" />Kabili Yusufu waabaanine bakuluube pamo ni lupua lonse lwakua se nangue, “Evi ndikusela ngie n'mubwile Farao nangue, ‘Bakuluamwine pamo ni lupua lwakua tawe bakifuma ku Kanaani, baiza. <verse eid="GEN 46:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 46:32" />Baba bantu ni basungi ba nama, kabili bezile ni bisepe byabo bya nghombe ni bya mikooko pamo ni bintu byabo byonse.’ <verse eid="GEN 46:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 46:33" />Kine Farao akabe kumikuuta ni kumiipuzia nangue, ‘Mulimwabomba mwiloki?’ <verse eid="GEN 46:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 46:34" />Mukabe kumwana nangue, ‘Fwefue tuli basungi ba nama kutula ku bwanike bwetu nga mwaali mwakitila babikolue betu.’ Ni pakako, wakaba kumyana mukabe kwikala ku Goseni, pantu kubalua musungi wa mikooko, Bamisri bamumwene kuba wa mpuni.”<verse eid="GEN 46:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 46" />
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="GEN 47" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 47:1" />Yusufu waile kumwana Farao nangue, “Tawe ni bakuluamwine kufuma ku Kanaani, bakiiza ni bisepe bya nghombe ni bya mikooko pamo ni bintu byonse bibali nabio. Evi bali ku Goseni.” <verse eid="GEN 47:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 47:2" />Waatweme bakuluube basaano ni kuya kubalangisia kuli Farao. <verse eid="GEN 47:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 47:3" />Farao waabeepuziizie babo bantu, “Mulimwabomba mwiloki?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 47:3">Baamwasukile Farao, “Fwefue tuli basungi ba nama nga vyaali babikolue betu. <verse eid="GEN 47:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 47:4" />Twaiza twikale mu keno kyalo pantu mu kyalo kya Kanaani nzala yakila kubiipa, kabili ni bikusi bya kuliisia nama yetu tekuli. Ni pakako, twapaapaata utwitabizie kwikala ku Goseni.” <verse eid="GEN 47:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 47:5" />Farao waamwanine Yusufu, “Kyawama pantu so ni bakuluubo bakiiza. <verse eid="GEN 47:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 47:6" />Kyalo kya Misri kili mu maboko obe. Baleke bakuluubo pamo ni so bekale pa nkendo iwamiisie ya Goseni. Kabili kine umaninepo bantu bapamine, ukababiike pa busungi bwa nama yane.”<verse eid="GEN 47:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 47:7" />Yusufu waile kumulangisia se Yakobo kuli Farao. Yakobo waamupaalile Farao. <verse eid="GEN 47:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 47:8" />Farao waamwipuziizie Yakobo, “Uli na myaka inga?”<verse eid="GEN 47:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 47:9" />Yakobo wa-asukile evi, “Ndi sie na myaka 130, kabili naali nakuukakuuka sie. Babikolue bane ni bo baali bakuukakuuka sie. Inzi bene baikeele myaka ingi, kabili ni bwikazi bwabo tebwaali bwabiipile nga bwane.” <verse eid="GEN 47:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 47:10" />Kupwako, Yakobo wamupaala Farao ni kufumamo waya. <verse eid="GEN 47:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 47:11" />Yusufu waamupeele se ni bakuluube nkendo yaali yawamiisie ya mu kyalo kya Misri pepi ni muzi wa Ramese nga mwa-aniinue na Farao. <verse eid="GEN 47:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 47:12" />Yakobo ni baana bakue pamo ni luvyalo lwakue lonse, baali bapeelua bilio na Yusufu kukonkana ni bwingi bwa baana babo.<verse eid="GEN 47:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kimina kya nzala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 47:13" />Nzala yaakilile kubiipa mpaka bilio byapwililika mu kyalo kyonse, bantu ba mu Misri ni ba ku Kanaani baemiiziwe sana na nzala. <verse eid="GEN 47:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 47:14" />Yusufu waakolonghaniizie nfolanga yonse yaamwenekele mu kyalo kya Misri ni mu kyalo kya Kanaani, ezio yaanonkelue lubaasisiizie nghano. Yusufu waatwele nfolanga mu nghanda yakua Farao. <verse eid="GEN 47:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 47:15" />Nfolanga yonse luyaapwile mu kyalo kya Misri ni kya Kanaani, Bamisri baile kumwana Yusufu nangue, “Tupeele bilio tukeeza kufua na nzala pa ntanzi yobe pantu tetukili na nfolanga.”<verse eid="GEN 47:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 47:16" />Yusufu waabaanine evi, “Kine temukwete nfolanga, n'mpeele nama yenu ni nene n'mipeele bilio.” <verse eid="GEN 47:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 47:17" />Bamisri baamupeele Yusufu farasi, ni mikooko, ni mbuzi, ni nghombe, pamo ni punda. Ni wene waabapeele bilio bya kulia mwaka onse walingi.<verse eid="GEN 47:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 47:18" />Mwaka waakonkelepo, baile kumwana Yusufu nangue, “Tetuvinda kukufiika kantu. We mukulu, nfolanga yetu yonse yapua, ni bisepe bya nama bitwaali nabio twaakupeele. Evi tetukili kabili na kantu ka kukupeela, inga sie mibili yetu ni kyalo kyetu. <verse eid="GEN 47:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 47:19" />Tekutulekeela tufue pa ntanzi yobe, fwefue ni kyalo kyetu. Kansi twaipeela sie utusite fwefue benka ni kyalo kyetu na bilio, evi tuye twali bazia bakua Farao, twalomba utupeele bilio tulie tukafua, ni kyalo kyetu kikeeza kusyala kibolia.”<verse eid="GEN 47:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 47:20" />Yusufu waamusitiile Farao kyalo kyonse kya Misri. Bamisri baasisiizie kyalo pa mulandu wa nzala yaakilile kubiipa. Kyalo kyonse kya Misri kya-alukile kyakua Farao. <verse eid="GEN 47:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 47:21" />Yusufu waakuusiizie Bamisri kufuma mu mipaka yonse ya Misri ni kubaleeta mukati mizi. <verse eid="GEN 47:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 47:22" />Inga sie nkendo yaali yaikeelemo babitambua i isyaasitilue pantu Farao waali wabapeela bilio bya kulia. Keki i kyaalengele tekuti basisie nkendo yabo. <verse eid="GEN 47:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 47:23" />Yusufu waabaanine bantu nangue, “Unvue, kyalo pamo ni mwemue namusitila Farao. Ale poke mbezu ezi mubyale mu makaba enu. <verse eid="GEN 47:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 47:24" />Pa musita wa kuzombola, mukabuulepo kimo kya pa bisaano ni kumupeela Farao, ni byaakasyalapo i bimwaakaba mwafumiapo mbezu ni bilio bimwaakaba mwalia ni baana benu pamo ni ba mu nghanda yenu.”<verse eid="GEN 47:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 47:25" />Baalandile evi, “We mukulu, wabomba. Evi watupususia. Twaitabila kuya twali bazia bakua Farao.” <verse eid="GEN 47:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 47:26" />Ozu mulandu Yusufu waukitile kuba muzilo nangue, kimo kya pa bisaano kiye kyapeelua likolo. Leli lifunde ni lenu kumo likiliko. Inga sie mu nkendo yaali yaikeelemo babitambua.<verse eid="GEN 47:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kulomba kwa mpeelezio kwakua Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 47:27" />Baizraeli baikeele ku Goseni mu Misri momo mubaanonkele, baasandulukile ni kukila kuvula. <verse eid="GEN 47:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 47:28" />Yakobo waikeele mu Misri myaka lyanondo ni kilooba. Myaka yonse yaikeele Yakobo pa kyalo yaali 147. <verse eid="GEN 47:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 47:29" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">47.29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 49:29-32">Kut 49.29-32</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 50:6">50.6</ref></char></note>Kufua kwakua Izraeli lukwaapaleeme, waamukuutile mwana wakue Yusufu wamwana nangue, “Kine wangitabizia, biika kuboko kobe kwinsina litanta lyane unkitile kiweme ni kisinka. Nakulomba tekuti ukanziike mu Misri. <verse eid="GEN 47:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 47:30" />Inzi pankafua ntonene ukanziike kolia kwaaziikilue babikolue bane.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 47:30">Yusufu wa-asukile evi, “Nakaba kukita nga muwalandila.”<verse eid="GEN 47:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 47:31" />Izraeli waalandile evi, “Ale ndapile.” Yusufu walapa. Kupwako, Izraeli wafwinamina pa bulita lya ku mitue.<verse eid="GEN 47:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 47" />
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="GEN 48" />
  <para style="s1">Yakobo wapaala Manase ni Efraimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 48:1" />Pa kyamba kya nsiku, muntu umo waamubwilile Yusufu nangue se Yakobo alwele ku Goseni. Kupwako, Yusufu watwama baana bakue, Manase ni Efraimu, baya. <verse eid="GEN 48:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 48:2" />Lubaafikile, muntu umo waamubwilile Yakobo nangue, “Mwana obe Yusufu waiza,” Izraeli waikoseleziizie, wabuuka ni kwikala pa bulita. <verse eid="GEN 48:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 48:3" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:13-14">Kut 28.13-14</ref></char></note>Yakobo waamwanine Yusufu nangue, “Leza wa Maka onse lu-aan'mwenekeele ku Luzi mu kyalo kya Kanaani, waan'mpaalile. <verse eid="GEN 48:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 48:4" />Wanghanine nangue, ‘Naakakuvuzia ni kukusandulula, kabili naakakukita kuba libumba lya ntundu, ni pa kyamba kyobe, nvyalo yobe naakaipeela keki kyalo kuba bupyani bwabo lonse.’<verse eid="GEN 48:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 48:5" />“Ni evi baba baana babili bawaavyaliile mu Misri lunaali nsinaize kuli wewe, ni baana bane. Efraimu ni Manase baakaba bane nga Rubeni, ni Simeoni. <verse eid="GEN 48:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 48:6" />Inzi baana bawaakavyala pa kyamba kya baba, baakaba bobe, ni bupyani bwabo bwaakaba kuli Efraimu ni Manase. <verse eid="GEN 48:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 48:7" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48.7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 35:16-19">Kut 35.16-19</ref></char></note>Nakita evi pa mulandu wakua noko Rakeli waafwiliile mu Kanaanni pepi ni Efura lunaali nalimukufuma ku Padani-Aramu. Naamuziikile mu Kanaani mumbali musebo ulungi ku Efura.” (Eno nsiku Efura i Betlehemu).<verse eid="GEN 48:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 48:8" />Izraeli lu-aamwene bena Yusufu waipuziizie evi, “Ale baba ni bani?”<verse eid="GEN 48:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 48:9" />Yusufu wa-asukile evi, “Baba ni baana bane banaapeelue na Leza mono mu Misri.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 48:9">Yakobo waalandile evi, “Ale bapalamike pano n'mbapaale.” <verse eid="GEN 48:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 48:10" />Menso akua Yakobo te aali amona pa mulandu wa bukote. Yusufu waamupalamikiile baana, Yakobo ni ye waabakwete ni kubakumbatila. <verse eid="GEN 48:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 48:11" />Izraeli waamwanine Yusufu, “Nsyaali naswapiile nangue twaakamonana kabili. Inzi evi Leza wan'mpaala namonako ni baana bobe.” <verse eid="GEN 48:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 48:12" />Kupwako, Yusufu wabafumia mu kyeni kyakua Izraeli. Yusufu waakontamiine pansi.<verse eid="GEN 48:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 48:13" />Yusufu waabakwete baana bonse babili. Efraimu ku kuboko kwakue kwa kulio walungheeme ku kuboko kuso kwakua Izraeli, ni Manase ku kuboko kwakue kwa kuso walungheeme ku kuboko kulio kwakua Izraeli ni kubapalamika kuli wene. <verse eid="GEN 48:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 48:14" />Inzi Izraeli waakilinghaniizie maboko akue, kuboko kulio wabiika pa mutue wakua Efraimu waali wali mwanike, ni kuboko kwakue kwa kuso wabiika pa mutue wakua Manase waali wali mukulu. <verse eid="GEN 48:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 48:15" />Yakobo waamupaalile Yusufu walanda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 48:15">“Leza waali watangiliile tawekulu Abrahamu ni tawe Izaaki,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 48:15">Leza waali wanombwele mu bukose bwane bonse mpaka lenu,<verse eid="GEN 48:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 48:16" />olia malaika wan'mpususiizie mu maavia onse, abapaale baba balumendo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 48:16">Bakabe bakuutua mu liina lyane, ni mu liina lyakua tawekulu Abrahamu ni lyakua tawe Izaaki.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 48:16">Bakakile kusanduluka mu kyalo kyonse.”<verse eid="GEN 48:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 48:17" />Yusufu lu-aamwene nangue se wabiika kuboko kwakue kwa kulio pa mutue wakua Efraimu, taawaamiinue. Ni pakako, waakwete kuboko kwakua se, wafumia pa mutue wakua Efraimu wabiika pa mutue wakua Manase. <verse eid="GEN 48:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 48:18" />Waamwanine se nangue, “We tawe, tekukita evi pantu mukulu ni ozu. Wene i wakuti ubiikile kuboko kobe kwa kulio pa mutue wakue.”<verse eid="GEN 48:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 48:19" />Se waakeene walanda nangue, “We mwana wane, n'manine kindimukukita. Manase waakaba mutundu ukata. Inzi mwalawakue waakaba mukulu kukila wene, ni nvyalo yakue yaakaba libumba lya ntundu.”<verse eid="GEN 48:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 48:20" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">48.20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HEB 11:21">Bae 11.21</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Bobo busiku, Yakobo waabapaalile wabaana nangue ku ntanzi Baizraeli baakaba balombelana mapaalo balanda nangue, “Leza akupaale nga vi-aapaalile Efraimu ni Manase.” Yakobo waatangiziizie Efraimu pali Manase.<verse eid="GEN 48:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 48:21" />Kabili Izraeli waamwanine Yusufu, “Mona nene nsisyaumiine kufua, inzi Leza waakaba pamo nenu, kabili waakamilombola kuti mukabwelele mu kyalo kya babikolue betu. <verse eid="GEN 48:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 48:22" />Inzi wewe pantu uli nga mukulu pa ba kobe, nakulundilako nkendo imo pa nkendo inaapokele ku Ba-amori ku maka a kipanga ni buta bwane.”<verse eid="GEN 48:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 48" />
  <chapter number="49" style="c" sid="GEN 49" />
  <para style="s1">Yakobo wapaala baana bakue</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 49:1" />Yakobo waakuutile baana bakue wabaana nangue, “Ize munkolonghane n'myane bintu byaakamikitikila mu nsiku ya ku ntanzi.<verse eid="GEN 49:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 49:2" />“Mwe bena Yakobo, kolonghane munvue.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:2">Mutwilizie sinue Izraeli.<verse eid="GEN 49:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 49:3" />“Rubeni, wewe uli libeli wane,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:3">maka ane ni ntendeko ya kuluma kwane,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:3">mukulu mu mukinzi, mukulu mu buvinde.<verse eid="GEN 49:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 49:4" />Wewe uliwabiluluka nga menda.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:4">Teukaba wakindeeme,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:4">pantu waaselele pa bulita bwakua so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:4">ni kubutiikaania.<verse eid="GEN 49:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 49:5" />“Simeoni ni Lawi, ni benenke.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:5">Bipanga byabo i bilwilo bya bubi.<verse eid="GEN 49:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 49:6" />We mutima wane, tekwingila mu mapange abo a mu kafiso.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:6">Bulumba bwane tekuti bwampane na kilie kyabo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:6">pantu baipaile muntu na kipuki kyabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:6">ni mubutaale bwabo baaputwile misipa ya nghombe ndume.<verse eid="GEN 49:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 49:7" />Kikonko kyabo kitiipue, pantu kikilile kusasa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:7">ni kipuki kyabo pantu tekyaali na nkumbu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:7">Naakabakasania muli Yakobo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:7">Naakabasalanghania muli Izraeli.<verse eid="GEN 49:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 49:8" />“We Yuda, ba kobe baakakutasia.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:8">Kuboko kobe kwaakaba pa mukosi wa balwani bobe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:8">Baana bena so baakakukontamina.<verse eid="GEN 49:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 49:9" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49.9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 24:9">Mpe 24.9</ref>; <ref loc="REV 5:5">Nfy 5.5</ref></char>
    </note>Yuda, i nkalamu musoka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:9">kufuma mu kwipaya nama, we mwana wane wakibwela.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:9">Wene waakonteeme, waifiika nga nkalamu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:9">nga nkalamu mukota, nani waakamubuusia?<verse eid="GEN 49:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 49:10" />Nfimbo teikafuma mu Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:10">ao kabango ka bukolo mu maulu akue,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:10">mpaka Shilo akeeze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:10">wene waakanakilua na ntundu.<verse eid="GEN 49:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 49:11" />Wene waakakakila punda wakue ku muzabibu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:11">ni musoka wa punda ku muzabibu uwamiisie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:11">Waakufula ngubo yakue mu divai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:11">ni bivwalo byakue mu mulopa wa mizabibu.<verse eid="GEN 49:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 49:12" />Menso akue akaba akasikile na divai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:12">Meeno akue aswetele na mabeele.<verse eid="GEN 49:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 49:13" />“Zabuloni waakeekala mumbali lyezi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:13">ni ye waakaba kyabu kya maato.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:13">Mipaka yakue yaakaba yafikile ku Sidona.<verse eid="GEN 49:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 49:14" />“Isakari i punda alumine</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:14">aliwaifiika mu bipata bya mikooko.<verse eid="GEN 49:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 49:15" />Amwene nkendo ya kutuuziapo paweme,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:15">ni kyalo nangue kyaali kyafwaniine.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:15">Akoosiizie kikoope kyakue kuti kitwame bitwamo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:15">ni kuya wali mubombi wa miilo ikolele.<verse eid="GEN 49:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 49:16" />“Dani waakapingula bantu bakue</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:16">nga umo wa mu mikoa yakua Izraeli.<verse eid="GEN 49:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 49:17" />Dani waakaba kizoka kya mumbali musebo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:17">kizoka kiniini kya mumbali nzila kili ni bwimba</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:17">kilikyasuma farasi ku kasinghino</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:17">ni aselelepo wapona kansenia.<verse eid="GEN 49:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 49:18" />“We Yawe, n'mpembeele bupusuko bobe.<verse eid="GEN 49:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 49:19" />“Gadi, waakasakukilua na libumba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:19">inzi wene waakabasakukila ni kubakonka.<verse eid="GEN 49:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 49:20" />“Mu kyalo kya Aseri mwaakaba bilio bingi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:20">ni ye waakaba wafumia bya kulia biweme bya makolo.<verse eid="GEN 49:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 49:21" />“Nafutali i mbazi asikakilue</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:21">aliwalanda twebo tuweme.<verse eid="GEN 49:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 49:22" />“Yusufu i musambo wa mazabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:22">musambo wa mazabo mumbali kasulo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:22">Misambo yakue itambaleele mu kibumba.<verse eid="GEN 49:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 49:23" />Wene waasakukiilue na bantu bali ni mivui,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:23">baamulasile mivui ni kumwemia.<verse eid="GEN 49:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 49:24" />Inzi buta bwakue bwaasyele bwalumine,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:24">maboko akue aalumiiziwe na maboko akua wa Maka onse, wakua Yakobo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:24">Wa-aalwilue musungi wa mikooko, libue lyakua Izraeli,<verse eid="GEN 49:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 49:25" />Na Leza wakua so waakakukwasia.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:25">Na Leza wa Maka onse waakakupaala.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:25">Na mapaalo a mwiulu mu muulu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:25">mapaalo a mu biina bifikile pansi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:25">mapaalo a konsia ni a kwimita.<verse eid="GEN 49:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 49:26" />Mapaalo akua so ni akata kukila</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:26">mapaalo a mpili ya kale,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:26">kukila bintu bitonekele bya mpili ya muyayaya.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:26">Bebi byonse biye byali pa mutue wakua Yusufu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:26">pa mpala yakua mulombozi pa bakuluube.<verse eid="GEN 49:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 49:27" />“Benyamina i mumbue asasile.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:27">Lukeelekeele alikulia mabingo, ni kyungulo alikukasania bi-aipayanga.”<verse eid="GEN 49:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 49:28" />Ezi i mikoa lyanondo ni ibili yakua Izraeli, kabili evi i viba-aninue na sibo ni kubapaala kubalua muntu mapaalo akue.<verse eid="GEN 49:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kufua ni kuziikua kwakua Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 49:29" />Yakobo waabaanine baana bakue nangue, “Evi pasyankabe kufua ni kuya ku bantu bane. Mukabe kunziika mu kilibu kili mu bukaba bwakua Efuroni Muhiti, <verse eid="GEN 49:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 49:30" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49.30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 23:3-20">Kut 23.3-20</ref></char></note>kilibu kili mu bukaba bwa ku Makipela lya ku kabanga ka Mamure mu kyalo kya Kanaani, kilibu kyaasitilue na Abrahamu pamo ni bukaba bwakua Efuroni Muhiti, evi iye yali nkendo ya kuziikamo bantu bakue. <verse eid="GEN 49:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 49:31" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49.31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 25:9-10">Kut 25.9-10</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 35:29">35.29</ref></char></note>Momo i mwaaziikilue Abrahamu ni mukazi wakue Sara, momo i mwaaziikilue Izaaki ni mukazi wakue Rebeka, kabili momo i munaaziikile mukazi wane Lea. <verse eid="GEN 49:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 49:32" />Bobo bukaba pamo ni kilibu kilimo, byaasitilue ku bena Heti.” <verse eid="GEN 49:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 49:33" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49.33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:15">Mii 7.15</ref></char></note>Yakobo lu-aapwile kulanda na baana bakue, waaleele pa bulita ni kufua. Waakolonghaniiziwe pamo ni bantu bakue.<verse eid="GEN 49:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 49" />
  <chapter number="50" style="c" sid="GEN 50" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 50:1" />Yusufu waipoozele pali se ni kubamba kumulila wamukumbatiile. <verse eid="GEN 50:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 50:2" />Yusufu wa-anine babombi bakue bakondapa, basube mubili wakua se na mafuta tekuti ubole. <verse eid="GEN 50:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 50:3" />Baapwile nsiku 40 bamusuba mafuta akusibola. Bamisri baamulilile nsiku 70.<verse eid="GEN 50:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 50:4" />Nsiku ya kumulila luyaapitile, Yusufu waabaanine babiloolo bakua Farao nangue, “Kine kuti mwangitabizia, namipaapaata muye mumwane Farao nangue, <verse eid="GEN 50:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 50:5" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50.5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 47:29-31">Kut 47.29-31</ref></char></note>‘Tawe lu-aali wasyafua, wanghanine nkaye nkamuziike mu kilibu ki-aateaniizie mu kyalo kya Kanaani. Ni pakako, namilomba mun'mpeele nsambu ya kuya kuziika tawe, mane kabili nkabe kubwela.’”<verse eid="GEN 50:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 50:6" />Farao waamwanine evi, “Endo umuziike so nga mu-aakwaniine.”<verse eid="GEN 50:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 50:7" />Kupwako, Yusufu wasela ku Kanaani, waya kumuziika se. Babiloolo bonse bakua likolo, ni babikolue ba Baizraeli pamo ni babikolue ba Bamisri, baile pamo nakue. <verse eid="GEN 50:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 50:8" />Lupua lwakue lonse, ni bakuluube pamo ni bange bonse ba mu lupua lwakua se baile pamo nakue. Mu Goseni mwaasyele sie baana babo, ni mikooko yabo, ni mbuzi pamo ni nghombe. <verse eid="GEN 50:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 50:9" />Bantu baali baselele mu matyakala ni baali baselele pa punda, baile pamo nakue. Lyaali lyali libumba likata sana.<verse eid="GEN 50:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 50:10" />Lubaafikile ku Atadi pa nkendo ya kupupiiziapo lya ku kabanga ka Yordani, paapitile musita ukata balimukulila muzowa ukata. Yusufu pamo ni bange baamulilile se nsiku kilooba. <verse eid="GEN 50:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 50:11" />Bekazi ba mu Kanaani lubaamwene babo bantu balimukulila ku Atadi baalandile evi, “Azo malilo onvwikile, ni malilo akata a Bamisri!” Pa ezio nkendo i kipalipakuutilua Abeli-Misuraimu, ili ku bwala Yordani.<verse eid="GEN 50:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 50:12" />Baana bakue baamukitiile nga mu-aabaaniine. <verse eid="GEN 50:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 50:13" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50.13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:16">Mii 7.16</ref></char></note>Baamutweme ni kuya kumuziika mu kilibu kya ku Makipela lya ku kabanga ka Mamure, kilibu kyaasitile Abrahamu pamo ni bukaba kuli Efuroni Muhiti, pakuti ibe nkendo ya kuziikamo bantu bakue. <verse eid="GEN 50:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 50:14" />Yusufu lu-aapwile kumuziika se, waabweleele ku Misri ni bakuluube bonse pamo ni bonse baile pamo nakue.<verse eid="GEN 50:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yusufu wakoselezia bakuluube</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 50:15" />Bakuluube kwa Yusufu lubaamwene nangue sibo wafua, baalandile evi, “Pange Yusufu waakaba kutusuula ni kutukitila kibwelezi kya belia byonse bitwaamukitiile.” <verse eid="GEN 50:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 50:16" />Ni pakako baatumine mpunda kuli Yusufu ya kulanda nangue, “So lu-aali tanaafue waatukonkobeziizie walanda, <verse eid="GEN 50:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 50:17" />Mukabe kuya kumwana Yusufu nangue, ‘Nakupaapaata weleele bubi bwa bakuluubo bubaakuluviizie.’ Ni pakako, twakupaapaata weleele bubi bwa babombi bakua Leza wakua so.” Mpunda Luyaamufikiile, Yusufu waalilile.<verse eid="GEN 50:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 50:18" />Bakuluube baile kumukontamina balanda nangue, “Ewe, mona fwefue tuli babombi bobe.”<verse eid="GEN 50:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 50:19" />Inzi Yusufu waabaanine evi, “Tekutiine! Nene nsili na nsambu ya kwalula bintu bitantikile Leza. <verse eid="GEN 50:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 50:20" />Mwemue mwantekeele kilie kya kunkitila bintu bibiipile, inzi Leza waatonene kuti mapange akue aweme akitue, mapange a kupususia bantu bengi nga vikili lelo. <verse eid="GEN 50:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 50:21" />Kansi evi tekutiine. Nakaba kumiliisia, mwemue pamo ni baana benu.” Waabakoseleziizie ni kulanda nabo bwino bwino.<verse eid="GEN 50:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yusufu wafua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 50:22" />Yusufu waatwaliliile kwikala mu Misri pamo ni lupua lwakua se. Yusufu waafwile wali na myaka 110. <verse eid="GEN 50:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 50:23" />Yusufu waikeele nsiku ingi mpaka waamwene kuvyalua kwa baana bena Efraimu ni bena benzikulu. Kabili waamwene ni benzikulu bakua Manase baavyelue na Makiri, ni babo baana waabapokeleele mu lupua lwakue. <verse eid="GEN 50:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 50:24" />Yusufu waabaanine bakuluube, “Kufua kwane kwapalama. Inzi kulanda kisinka, Leza waakamisunga, kabili waakamilombola ni kumisezia ku kyalo ki-aalaile Abrahamu, ni Izaaki pamo ni Yakobo.” <verse eid="GEN 50:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 50:25" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50.25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:19">Kuf 13.19</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 24:32">Yos 24.32</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 11:22">Bae 11.22</ref></char></note>Yusufu waabalapiizie baana bakua Izraeli wabaana nangue, “Kisinka Leza waakamimona. Ni pakako, pamukaba mwaya, namyana mukatwame ni bikuza byane.” <verse eid="GEN 50:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 50:26" />Yusufu waafwile wali na myaka 110. Mubili wakue waasubilue mafuta tekuti ubole, ni pa kyamba, waabiikilue mu lisanduku.<verse eid="GEN 50:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 50" />
</usx>